
window.ATLAS_DATA={"modules":[{"id":"foundation","title":"阅读地图","subtitle":"先分类型，再选方法","caption":"积分类型 · 三大公式 · 空间几何"},{"id":"triple","title":"三重积分","subtitle":"把立体切成容易计算的薄片","caption":"坐标变换 · 截面法 · 积分极限"},{"id":"line1","title":"第一类曲线积分","subtitle":"长度微元，方向不改变结果","caption":"参数选择 · 对称性 · 轮换"},{"id":"line2","title":"第二类曲线积分","subtitle":"沿着方向，累计切向作用","caption":"有向参数 · 分段 · 凑微分"},{"id":"green","title":"格林公式与奇点","subtitle":"从平面边界走向区域内部","caption":"补线 · 挖洞 · 比较与证明"},{"id":"path","title":"路径无关与全微分","subtitle":"让曲线积分只取决于端点","caption":"原函数 · 反求参数 · 证明"},{"id":"surface1","title":"第一类曲面积分","subtitle":"投影之后，补上面积因子","caption":"投影 · 面积元 · 隐函数"},{"id":"surface2","title":"第二类曲面积分","subtitle":"先确定侧，再计算穿过曲面的量","caption":"法向量 · 合一投影 · 消抽象项"},{"id":"gauss","title":"高斯公式","subtitle":"封闭曲面的通量，转为体积分","caption":"补面 · 内外侧 · 散度"},{"id":"stokes","title":"斯托克斯公式","subtitle":"为一条空间边界，选一片好算的面","caption":"右手规则 · 选面 · 旋度"},{"id":"applications","title":"质量、重心与做功","subtitle":"用几何微元连接物理意义","caption":"质量矩 · 截面形心 · 做功最值"},{"id":"review","title":"复盘与核对","subtitle":"把会看懂，变成会独立列式","caption":"错因清单 · 原稿勘误 · 复习路径"}],"sections":[{"id":1,"title":"先判断是什么，再决定怎么算","module":"foundation","html":"<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><tr><th>看到什么</th><th>首先想到</th><th>必须核查</th></tr><tr><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds</annotation></semantics></math></td><td>第一类曲线积分；先对称/曲线上恒等式，再参数化</td><td>无方向；弧长微元非负</td></tr><tr><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Pdx+Qdy+Rdz</annotation></semantics></math></td><td>第二类曲线积分；先凑微分、化简，再选参数或定理</td><td>起终点、闭合与否、系数奇点</td></tr><tr><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS</annotation></semantics></math></td><td>第一类曲面积分；先对称，再投影或参数化</td><td>是否需要分片；面积因子</td></tr><tr><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Pdy dz+Qdz dx+Rdx dy</annotation></semantics></math></td><td>第二类曲面积分；先法向，再合一投影/高斯</td><td>上下/内外侧；是否封闭</td></tr><tr><td>平面闭曲线</td><td>格林：<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x-P_y</annotation></semantics></math>是否很简单？</td><td>整个内部及边界的光滑性</td></tr><tr><td>空间闭曲线</td><td>斯托克斯：旋度是否简单？</td><td>选择同边界曲面；右手规则</td></tr><tr><td>闭曲面的通量</td><td>高斯：<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_x+Q_y+R_z</annotation></semantics></math></td><td>内部是否有奇点；外侧</td></tr><tr><td>开放曲线/曲面</td><td>直接计算，或补线/补面后减去</td><td>辅助部分的方向和积分</td></tr><tr><td>抽象函数</td><td>先看能否代数消去；再看求导能否抵消</td><td>仅连续不能擅自求偏导</td></tr><tr><td>奇点在内部</td><td>挖洞/挖球后用定理</td><td>不能直接由“导数为零”判积分零</td></tr></table></div>\n<p><strong>考场的五步主线</strong> </p><ol><li><strong>看微元：</strong>先判是哪一类积分，避免把<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds,dS</annotation></semantics></math>和有向微元混用。</li><li><strong>画范围：</strong>封闭吗？投影是什么？有几片？起终点在哪？</li><li><strong>先化简：</strong>奇偶、轮换、曲线曲面方程、全微分，能省掉大量运算。</li><li><strong>比方法：</strong>直接参数/投影，与格林/高斯/斯托克斯，哪一种运算更少？</li><li><strong>再检条件：</strong>方向、奇点、光滑性、上下限全部确定后再积分。</li></ol>\n<p><strong>最优先掌握：</strong>四类积分直接法；第一类积分对称性；补线格林；全微分；合一投影；补面高斯；平面型边界的斯托克斯。</p>\n<p><strong>第二层提升：</strong>轮换对称＋约束恒等式；挖洞/挖球；积分恒定反求函数；齐次关系证明；法向导数积分；隐函数曲面约分；重心与做功最值。</p>\n<p><strong>重要判断：</strong>“出现空间曲线”不等于必须用斯托克斯；“出现封闭曲面”也不等于必须用高斯。若曲面上分母成为常数，或抽象函数与法向量点乘后消失，直接法往往更好。</p>"},{"id":2,"title":"四类积分：公式与本质","module":"foundation","html":"<p><strong>第一类曲线积分：沿曲线累计标量，微元是长度。</strong></p>\n<p>设<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=x(t),y=y(t),z=z(t)</annotation></semantics></math>，按不重复描绘曲线的参数区间<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a\\le t\\le b</annotation></semantics></math>积分： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\int_L f\\,ds=\\int_a^b f(x(t),y(t),z(t))\\sqrt{x'(t)^2+y'(t)^2+z'(t)^2}\\,dt.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 平面曲线删去<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z'</annotation></semantics></math>项；<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=x(y)</annotation></semantics></math>时取<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds=\\sqrt{1+(dx/dy)^2}\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math>，这里<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math>按从小到大积分。极坐标<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=r(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math>： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mtext>按递增区间积分</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nds=\\sqrt{r^2+(r')^2}\\,d\\theta\\qquad(\\theta\\text{按递增区间积分}).\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <strong>第二类曲线积分：沿指定方向累计切向作用。</strong> <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><msup><mi>z</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\int_L Pdx+Qdy+Rdz=\\int_{t_A}^{t_B}(Px'+Qy'+Rz')\\,dt.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 这里<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P,Q,R</annotation></semantics></math>都先代入参数方程；<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_A,t_B</annotation></semantics></math>按起终点取，允许<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_A&gt;t_B</annotation></semantics></math>。反向积分变号。</p>\n<p><strong>第一类曲面积分：沿曲面累计标量，微元是面积。</strong></p>\n<p>若<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=g(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math>，投影为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math>，则 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\iint_\\Sigma f\\,dS=\\iint_D f(x,y,g(x,y))\\sqrt{1+g_x^2+g_y^2}\\,dxdy.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <strong>第二类曲面积分：累计穿过指定侧的通量。</strong></p>\n<p>若<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=g(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math>且取上侧，法向量可取<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-g_x,-g_y,1)</annotation></semantics></math>，则 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>Q</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\iint_\\Sigma Pdy dz+Qdz dx+Rdx dy=\\iint_D(-Pg_x-Qg_y+R)\\,dxdy.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 下侧整体加负号；系数中的<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>必须替换为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>\n<p><strong>两组联系，别混用切向与法向</strong> <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nPdx+Qdy+Rdz=(P\\cos\\alpha+Q\\cos\\beta+R\\cos\\gamma)\\,ds.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 上式的方向余弦属于<strong>单位切向量</strong>；下式属于<strong>单位法向量</strong>： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nPdy dz+Qdz dx+Rdx dy=(P\\cos\\alpha+Q\\cos\\beta+R\\cos\\gamma)\\,dS.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <strong>本质：</strong>第一类的微元始终非负；第二类的符号由方向决定。非单位法向量不能直接当方向余弦，但可用“非单位法向量×投影面积”计算通量。</p>"},{"id":3,"title":"三个大公式：适用条件与方向","module":"foundation","html":"<p><strong>格林：平面边界积分变平面区域积分</strong> <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\oint_{\\partial D}Pdx+Qdy=\\iint_D(Q_x-P_y)\\,dxdy.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 要求<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P,Q</annotation></semantics></math>在包含区域及边界的适当邻域内有连续一阶偏导；边界分段光滑。正向为<strong>沿边界走，区域在左手边</strong>：外边界逆时针，内孔边界顺时针。</p>\n<p><strong>高斯：封闭曲面通量变体积分</strong> <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\iint_{\\partial\\Omega}Pdy dz+Qdz dx+Rdx dy\n=\\iiint_\\Omega(P_x+Q_y+R_z)\\,dv.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 曲面取<strong>整个边界的外侧</strong>；<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P,Q,R</annotation></semantics></math>在区域及边界有连续一阶偏导。若有内腔，“外侧”在内腔边界上指向空腔内部。</p>\n<p><strong>斯托克斯：空间边界积分变曲面通量</strong> 记<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=R_y-Q_z</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B=P_z-R_x</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C=Q_x-P_y</annotation></semantics></math>，则 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mi>A</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\oint_{\\partial\\Sigma}Pdx+Qdy+Rdz\n=\\iint_\\Sigma A\\,dy dz+B\\,dz dx+C\\,dx dy.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P,Q,R</annotation></semantics></math>须在所选曲面附近有连续一阶偏导。边界和法向满足<strong>右手规则</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>方向快速检查</strong> </p><ul><li>从<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>轴正向向原点看为逆时针：相应法向的<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>分量为正。</li><li>“上侧”只表示<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_z&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>，不保证是某立体的外侧。</li><li>下半球的上侧指向球内；抛物面<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=x^2+y^2</annotation></semantics></math>与上盖围成立体时，抛物面的上侧也指向内部。</li><li>圆孔挖掉后，孔的正向与外边界相反。不能让所有边界都逆时针再直接相加。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>散度是标量，旋度是向量</strong> <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">rot</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\operatorname{div}\\boldsymbol F=P_x+Q_y+R_z,\n\\qquad\\operatorname{rot}\\boldsymbol F=(R_y-Q_z,\\ P_z-R_x,\\ Q_x-P_y).\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 格林是平面情形；高斯看散度；斯托克斯看旋度。计算之前先把<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P,Q,R</annotation></semantics></math>逐项抄对。</p>"},{"id":4,"title":"三重积分：五类题一次归纳","module":"triple","html":"<p><strong>定位：H01—H05；也服务于后面的高斯与形心。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>A．球体、球壳、圆锥配球：球坐标。</strong> <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>φ</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>φ</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>φ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>φ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nx=r\\sin\\varphi\\cos\\theta,\\quad y=r\\sin\\varphi\\sin\\theta,\\quad z=r\\cos\\varphi,\n\\qquad dv=r^2\\sin\\varphi\\,dr\\,d\\varphi\\,d\\theta.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 先由球面确定<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math>，由圆锥确定<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varphi</annotation></semantics></math>，再由卦限/半平面确定<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>。例如上圆锥内部<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≥</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\ge\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}</annotation></semantics></math>对应<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le\\varphi\\le\\pi/4</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>\n<p><strong>B．上下曲面夹层：先单后重。</strong> <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\iiint_\\Omega f\\,dv=\\iint_D\\left[\\int_{z_1(x,y)}^{z_2(x,y)}f\\,dz\\right]dxdy.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 圆盘投影常转柱坐标<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=\\rho\\cos\\theta,y=\\rho\\sin\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>ρ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dv=\\rho\\,d\\rho\\,d\\theta\\,dz</annotation></semantics></math>。偏心圆<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2\\le2y</annotation></semantics></math>变为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le\\rho\\le2\\sin\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>，角度仍须结合区域确定。</p>\n<p><strong>C．截面简单：先重后单。</strong> <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\iiint_\\Omega f\\,dv=\\int_a^b\\left[\\iint_{D_z}f(x,y,z)\\,dxdy\\right]dz.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 若被积函数仅为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(z)</annotation></semantics></math>，就等于<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_a^b f(z)A(z)\\,dz</annotation></semantics></math>。单位球的截面面积<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(z)=\\pi(1-z^2)</annotation></semantics></math>，这正是H05的证明。</p>\n<p><strong>D．缩小区域的积分极限：连续函数近似为点值。</strong></p>\n<p>H02中<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(0,0,0)=1</annotation></semantics></math>，球体积<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_r=4\\pi r^3/3</annotation></semantics></math>。由连续性， <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><msub><mo>∭</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><munder><mrow><mi>sup</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>⟶</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\left|\\frac1{\\pi r^3}\\iiint_{\\Omega_r}(f-1)\\,dv\\right|\n\\le\\frac43\\sup_{\\Omega_r}|f-1|\\longrightarrow0.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 故极限为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4/3</annotation></semantics></math>。注意分母是<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi r^3</annotation></semantics></math>，不是球体积，不能直接答1。</p>\n<p><strong>E．未知函数中含整个定积分：设常数再积分。</strong></p>\n<p>H04设<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C=\\iiint_\\Omega f\\,dv</annotation></semantics></math>，原式成为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}+zC</annotation></semantics></math>。两边积分： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nC=A+BC,\\quad A=\\frac\\pi6,\\quad B=\\frac\\pi4,\n\\qquad C=\\frac{2\\pi}{12-3\\pi}.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 其中<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>z</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>ρ</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=\\int_0^1\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\int_0^z\\rho^2\\,d\\rho d\\theta dz</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>z</mi><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B=\\int_0^1z\\pi z^2\\,dz</annotation></semantics></math>。方法本质：积分变量积掉后，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math>是常数；若<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-B=0</annotation></semantics></math>须另判相容性。</p>"},{"id":5,"title":"第一类曲线积分：参数怎样选","module":"line1","html":"<p><strong>定位：B例2；E例3；H06—H09。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>A．抛物线优先选“没有根号的变量”。</strong></p>\n<p>若<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y^2=2x</annotation></semantics></math>，选<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=y^2/2</annotation></semantics></math>，则<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx/dy=y</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds=\\sqrt{1+y^2}\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math>。 H06从<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(2,-2)</annotation></semantics></math>到<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(8,4)</annotation></semantics></math>的整段弧应取<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-2\\le y\\le4</annotation></semantics></math>，不能只取上半支。 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mi>y</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mn>17</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\int_L y\\,ds=\\int_{-2}^4y\\sqrt{1+y^2}\\,dy\n=\\frac13\\left(17^{3/2}-5^{3/2}\\right).\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 用<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math>积分也能做，但必须在顶点分段，并区分<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\pm\\sqrt{2x}</annotation></semantics></math>。这就是选<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math>更省事的原因。</p>\n<p><strong>B．圆、椭圆用三角参数；星形线用三次幂参数。</strong> <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>椭圆：</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mtext>星形线：</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\text{椭圆：}\\quad x=a\\cos t,\\ y=b\\sin t;\n\\qquad\\text{星形线：}\\quad x=a\\cos^3t,\\ y=a\\sin^3t.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> H08中<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=1</annotation></semantics></math>。第一象限<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le t\\le\\pi/2</annotation></semantics></math>： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nds=3\\sin t\\cos t\\,dt,\\qquad\nL=4\\int_0^{\\pi/2}3\\sin t\\cos t\\,dt=6.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 全周期的<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds</annotation></semantics></math>要写成<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3|\\sin t\\cos t|dt</annotation></semantics></math>；缩到第一象限才可去掉绝对值。</p>\n<p><strong>C．双纽线：对称缩域＋极坐标弧长。</strong></p>\n<p>E例3中<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^2=a^2\\cos2\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>。第一象限那一段满足<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le\\theta\\le\\pi/4</annotation></semantics></math>，且 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n2rr'=-2a^2\\sin2\\theta,qquad\nr^2+(r')^2=\\frac{a^2}{\\cos2\\theta}.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 所以<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi></mrow></msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\,ds=(a\\sqrt{\\cos2\\theta}\\cos\\theta)\\cdot a/\\sqrt{\\cos2\\theta}\\,d\\theta\n=a^2\\cos\\theta\\,d\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>，从而 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\int_L|x|\\,ds=4a^2\\int_0^{\\pi/4}\\cos\\theta\\,d\\theta=2\\sqrt2\\,a^2.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <strong>易错点：</strong>端点参数导数可发散，但化简后的积分可收敛；按极限理解。不能因整个图形在四象限就任取<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le\\theta\\le\\pi/2</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>"},{"id":6,"title":"对称性：先省运算，再参数化","module":"line1","html":"<p><strong>定位：B例1、3；E例4；H07、H09、H20及应用题。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>A．奇偶对称：积分对象和微元都要保持不变。</strong></p>\n<p>对第一类积分，如果曲线/曲面关于<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0</annotation></semantics></math>对称，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math>关于<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math>为奇函数，则积分为零；若为偶函数，才能缩到<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math>并乘2。关于三个坐标面对称时，只有同时满足对应偶性才可乘8。</p>\n<p><strong>B．轮换对称：把相等的积分相加，凑已知条件。</strong></p>\n<p>B例3与E例4有同一条曲线：<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2+z^2=1</annotation></semantics></math>与<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x+y+z=0</annotation></semantics></math>的交圆，长度<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\pi</annotation></semantics></math>。交换/轮换坐标保持曲线不变，因此 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\oint_Lx^2ds=\\oint_Ly^2ds=\\oint_Lz^2ds\n=\\frac13\\oint_L(x^2+y^2+z^2)ds=\\frac{2\\pi}3.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 同理三个交叉项积分相等。先把约束平方： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n(x+y+z)^2=x^2+y^2+z^2+2(xy+yz+zx)=0,\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nxy+yz+zx=-\\frac12,\n\\qquad\\oint_Lxy\\,ds=\\frac13\\oint_L\\left(-\\frac12\\right)ds=-\\frac\\pi3.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 这类题的关键是<strong>积分相等</strong>，不是断言曲线上每点都有<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2=y^2=z^2</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>\n<p><strong>C．曲线上恒等式：直接凑常数。</strong></p>\n<p>B例1椭圆<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2/4+y^2/3=1</annotation></semantics></math>上，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3x^2+4y^2=12</annotation></semantics></math>，而<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xy</annotation></semantics></math>项由奇偶性消去。因此若周长为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math>，原积分等于<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12a</annotation></semantics></math>，无需计算椭圆周长。</p>\n<p><strong>D．只有部分对称，不能硬凑三等份。</strong></p>\n<p>H07曲线<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=y</annotation></semantics></math>与球面相交，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y,z</annotation></semantics></math>并不完全轮换对称。可取 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nx=\\frac a{\\sqrt2}\\cos t,\\quad y=\\frac a{\\sqrt2}\\cos t,\\quad z=a\\sin t,\n\\quad ds=a\\,dt.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 于是<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_Lx^2ds=\\pi a^3/2</annotation></semantics></math>，不是<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\pi a^3/3</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>\n<p><strong>第二类积分尤其小心：</strong>不能只看<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math>是奇函数就判<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Pdx</annotation></semantics></math>积分为零。先把方向和微元一起参数化，或转成第一类/投影积分，再检查完整被积函数的奇偶性。</p>"},{"id":7,"title":"第二类曲线积分：分段、降维与凑微分","module":"line2","html":"<p><strong>定位：B例4、5；E例5、6；H10—H13。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>A．折线或绝对值：在拐点/符号改变处分段。</strong></p>\n<p>E例5的两段：<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(1,0)\\to B(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math>上<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=1-x</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx+dy=0</annotation></semantics></math>；<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B\\to C(-1,0)</annotation></semantics></math>上<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=x+1</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|x|+|y|=1</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx+dy=2dx</annotation></semantics></math>。故 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\int_L\\frac{dx+dy}{|x|+|y|}=0+\\int_0^{-1}2dx=-2.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 特别注意第二段的<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math>由0到<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1</annotation></semantics></math>，不能为“从小到大”擅自交换上下限。</p>\n<p><strong>B．空间交线：先消元，可能直接降成平面题。</strong></p>\n<p>H12、H13均是两个球面的交线。方程相减得到<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>为常数，所以<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dz=0</annotation></semantics></math>；剩余为水平圆。H13里的<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|y-x|</annotation></semantics></math>可用三角参数分段，或利用中心对称检查整项，不能直接把绝对值去掉。</p>\n<p><strong>C．沿曲线先代入恒等式，再考虑用定理。</strong></p>\n<p>E例6中<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4x^2+y^2=1</annotation></semantics></math>，故原积分分解为 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\oint_L(-y\\,dx+x\\,dy)+\\oint_Lz\\,dz.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 第二项为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oint_Ld(z^2/2)=0</annotation></semantics></math>。取<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=\\tfrac12\\cos t,y=\\sin t</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le t\\le2\\pi</annotation></semantics></math>： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n-yx'+xy'=\\frac12\\sin^2t+\\frac12\\cos^2t=\\frac12,\n\\qquad I=\\pi.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 不必对原来含分母的表达式硬用斯托克斯。</p>\n<p><strong>D．常见全微分直接拆出。</strong> <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nxdx+ydy=d\\!\\left(\\frac{x^2+y^2}{2}\\right),\\qquad\nz\\,dz=d(z^2/2),\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n3x^2y\\,dx+x^3dy=d(x^3y),\\qquad\n yz\\,dx+zx\\,dy+xy\\,dz=d(xyz).\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 闭曲线上这些项为零，开放曲线上等于终点值减起点值。H14以后也常用这一招。</p>\n<p><strong>曲线两类积分互化：</strong>若已知切向量<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x',y')</annotation></semantics></math>，先除以<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{x'^2+y'^2}</annotation></semantics></math>得到方向余弦；切向方向必须与题目行进方向一致。</p>"},{"id":8,"title":"格林公式：闭合、补线、比较与证明","module":"green","html":"<p><strong>定位：B例7；E例7；H14—H16。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>A．闭曲线直接格林：先求<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x-P_y</annotation></semantics></math>。</strong></p>\n<p>只要差变成常数、低次多项式或径向函数，通常比边界逐段算快。若等于1，积分就是有向面积；若等于<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math>，就是<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math>乘面积。</p>\n<p><strong>B．开放曲线补线：必须把“减去辅助段”写出来。</strong></p>\n<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L:A\\to B</annotation></semantics></math>，补<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_0:B\\to A</annotation></semantics></math>；若<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L+L_0</annotation></semantics></math>为正向，则 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\int_LPdx+Qdy=\\iint_D(Q_x-P_y)\\,dxdy-\\int_{L_0}Pdx+Qdy.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 优先补坐标轴、水平线、竖直线，使<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx=0</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dy=0</annotation></semantics></math>或系数消失。B例7补<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math>轴；H15补<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math>轴。闭合方向若为负向，面积积分整体变号。</p>\n<p><strong>H15的两种值得掌握的方法</strong></p>\n<p>原式<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3x^2y\\,dx+(x^3+x-2y)\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math>可拆为 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nd(x^3y-y^2)+x\\,dy.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 终点<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,2)</annotation></semantics></math>减起点<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0)</annotation></semantics></math>给出<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-4</annotation></semantics></math>，剩余<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_Lx\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math>可用补线求面积。等价地，原式直接求得<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x-P_y=1</annotation></semantics></math>，补线积分为4，因此同样是“所围面积<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-4</annotation></semantics></math>”。</p>\n<p><strong>C．积分比较：比较“带符号的区域收益”，不能只比面积。</strong></p>\n<p>H14四条边界的格林被积函数为 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nQ_x-P_y=1-x^2-\\frac{y^2}{2}.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 它在<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2/2&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math>内为正，在外部为负。H14的<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_4:2x^2+y^2=2</annotation></semantics></math>恰为零值边界，围出的区域包含全部正贡献且不含负贡献，因此<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_4</annotation></semantics></math>最大。无需四个积分逐一计算。</p>\n<p><strong>D．等式与不等式：对称换元后取平均。</strong></p>\n<p>E例7经格林变成两个二重积分。正方形区域交换<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y</annotation></semantics></math>不变，先证两式相等；将两式相加除以2，再用 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\ne^t+e^{-t}\\ge2\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 得到下界<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\pi^2</annotation></semantics></math>。不需要求<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int e^{\\sin x}dx</annotation></semantics></math>的原函数。</p>"},{"id":9,"title":"奇点：挖洞与挖球为什么有效","module":"green","html":"<p><strong>定位：B例8、16；关联E例8、16。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>先明确：偏导关系成立，只能在没有奇点的区域使用定理。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>A．平面挖洞：把难边界换成包住同一奇点的简单边界。</strong></p>\n<p>设<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x-P_y=0</annotation></semantics></math>在两条逆时针曲线<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L,C</annotation></semantics></math>之间成立。对去掉小洞后的区域用格林，其正向边界是<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L-C</annotation></semantics></math>，所以 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>C</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\oint_LPdx+Qdy-\\oint_CPdx+Qdy=0.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 因此外圈积分等于小圈积分，<strong>不是等于零</strong>。</p>\n<p>B例8：<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=-y/(4x^2+y^2),Q=x/(4x^2+y^2)</annotation></semantics></math>。原圆包住原点，选足够小的椭圆<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>ε</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4x^2+y^2=\\varepsilon^2</annotation></semantics></math>，取 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>ε</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ε</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nx=\\frac\\varepsilon2\\cos t,\\quad y=\\varepsilon\\sin t.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 分子<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>ε</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xdy-ydx=\\varepsilon^2dt/2</annotation></semantics></math>，分母为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>ε</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon^2</annotation></semantics></math>，因此 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\oint_L\\frac{xdy-ydx}{4x^2+y^2}=\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\frac12dt=\\pi.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 若奇点不在内部且整个区域光滑，才可直接得零；奇点落在路径上需另查定义/收敛性。</p>\n<p><strong>B．空间挖球：散度为零也可有非零通量。</strong></p>\n<p>B例16的场为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol F=(x,y,z)/(x^2+y^2+z^2)^{3/2}</annotation></semantics></math>，原点外散度为零。挖掉半径<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math>的小球： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>ε</mi></msub></msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">n</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\iint_\\Sigma\\boldsymbol F\\cdot\\boldsymbol n\\,dS\n=\\iint_{S_\\varepsilon}\\boldsymbol F\\cdot\\boldsymbol n_{\\rm out}\\,dS.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 球面上<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">n</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol n_{\\rm out}=(x,y,z)/\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math>，故点乘为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>ε</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\varepsilon^2</annotation></semantics></math>，乘面积<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>ε</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\pi\\varepsilon^2</annotation></semantics></math>得到<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\pi</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>\n<p><strong>记忆条件：</strong>“<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\pi</annotation></semantics></math>”针对这个特定场、闭曲面包住原点一次、外侧且不穿过奇点的情形。改变方向变号；不包住原点则为零。</p>\n<p><strong>本质：</strong>定理可以在删掉奇点后的正常区域用；奇点的贡献通过新增加的内边界保留下来。不能把奇点偷偷忽略。</p>"},{"id":10,"title":"路径无关：求积分、求参数、求原函数","module":"path","html":"<p><strong>定位：B例9—11；H17、H18。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>常用充分条件：</strong>区域单连通，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P,Q</annotation></semantics></math>具有连续一阶偏导，且<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_y=Q_x</annotation></semantics></math>。在此条件下存在<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math>使<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">du=Pdx+Qdy</annotation></semantics></math>，积分只取决于端点。</p>\n<p><strong>A．求参数：对偏导相等进行恒等比较。</strong></p>\n<p>B例9的<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=x/(x^2+y^2-1)</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=-ay/(x^2+y^2-1)</annotation></semantics></math>。在单位圆内部无分母为零点： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nP_y=\\frac{-2xy}{(x^2+y^2-1)^2},\\qquad\nQ_x=\\frac{2axy}{(x^2+y^2-1)^2}.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 要在整个区域恒等，必须<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=-1</annotation></semantics></math>。不是只把某一个点代入。</p>\n<p><strong>B．求原函数：先对一个变量积分，再补“另一变量的函数”。</strong></p>\n<p>B例11中<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=y/x+x^2</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=\\ln x-2y</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>。先积<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math>： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nu=y\\ln x+\\frac{x^3}{3}+\\phi(y).\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 再令<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>ϕ</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_y=\\ln x+\\phi'(y)=Q</annotation></semantics></math>，得<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>ϕ</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi'=-2y</annotation></semantics></math>，从而 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nu=y\\ln x+\\frac{x^3}{3}-y^2+C.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <strong>易错：</strong>不能一开始只加常数<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math>；积分<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math>时未定部分可以是任意<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math>的函数。</p>\n<p><strong>C．三种实际方法怎样选</strong> </p><ul><li>凑微分：能看出乘积求导结构时最快。</li><li>积分法：先积<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math>补<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(y)</annotation></semantics></math>，最稳定。</li><li>折线法：坐标轴/水平竖直线让系数明显变简时更方便；折线必须始终在允许区域内。</li></ul> H17可凑出<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=x^2y^3-y^2\\sin x+y</annotation></semantics></math>，故积分为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u(\\pi/2,1)-u(0,0)=\\pi^2/4</annotation></semantics></math>。\n<p><strong>D．已知一个偏导和边界值：先恢复函数，再端点作差。</strong></p>\n<p>B例10由<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_x=(2x+1)e^{2x-y}</annotation></semantics></math>得<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f=xe^{2x-y}+\\phi(y)</annotation></semantics></math>。用<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(0,y)=y+1</annotation></semantics></math>确定<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi=y+1</annotation></semantics></math>，所以<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I(t)=e^{2-t}+t</annotation></semantics></math>。求导<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>I</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I'=1-e^{2-t}</annotation></semantics></math>，在<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=2</annotation></semantics></math>取最小值3。</p>"},{"id":11,"title":"路径无关的提升题：反求函数与证明","module":"path","html":"<p><strong>A．未知函数进入系数：偏导相等产生微分方程。</strong></p>\n<p>H18中 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nP=[xe^{2x}-6f(x)]\\sin y,\\qquad Q=[f'(x)-5f(x)]\\cos y.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 由<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_y=Q_x</annotation></semantics></math>，比较<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos y</annotation></semantics></math>的系数： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>f</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>f</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nxe^{2x}-6f=f''-5f',\\qquad f''-5f'+6f=xe^{2x}.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 齐次方程特征根为2、3。为避免重复繁算，设<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f=e^{2x}v</annotation></semantics></math>，代入后得到<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>v</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v''-v'=x</annotation></semantics></math>。取多项式特解<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_p=-x^2/2-x</annotation></semantics></math>，故 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nf=C_1e^{2x}+C_2e^{3x}-e^{2x}(x^2/2+x).\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(0)=0</annotation></semantics></math>给<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_1+C_2=0</annotation></semantics></math>；<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f'(0)=-1</annotation></semantics></math>给<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2C_1+3C_2-1=-1</annotation></semantics></math>，因此<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_1=C_2=0</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>\n<p><strong>B．所有包围原点的闭曲线积分相同：拼接相减。</strong></p>\n<p>E例8先给右半平面内的闭曲线接上同一条绕原点的辅助弧，构造两条包围原点的闭曲线。两积分相等，相减后公共弧抵消，得到右半平面内闭曲线积分为零，才可推出<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_y=Q_x</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>\n<p>令<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D=2x^2+y^4</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=\\phi(y)/D</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=2xy/D</annotation></semantics></math>，计算得 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>ϕ</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mi>D</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nP_y=\\frac{\\phi'D-4y^3\\phi}{D^2},\\qquad\nQ_x=\\frac{-4x^2y+2y^5}{D^2}.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 比较<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2</annotation></semantics></math>系数：<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>ϕ</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\phi'=-4y</annotation></semantics></math>，故<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi=-y^2+C</annotation></semantics></math>；再比较其余项，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C=0</annotation></semantics></math>。所以<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(y)=-y^2</annotation></semantics></math>。比较系数依赖于等式对任意<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>成立。</p>\n<p><strong>C．齐次条件：对缩放参数求导。</strong></p>\n<p>H16给<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(tx,ty)=t^{-2}f(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math>。两边对<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math>求导并令<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=1</annotation></semantics></math>： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nxf_x+yf_y=-2f.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 对<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=yf,Q=-xf</annotation></semantics></math>有<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x-P_y=-2f-xf_x-yf_y=0</annotation></semantics></math>。上半平面无孔、满足光滑条件，格林立即给闭曲线积分为零。</p>\n<p><strong>D．外法向导数积分：由法向转切向，再格林。</strong></p>\n<p>逆时针边界上外法向满足<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_xds=dy,n_yds=-dx</annotation></semantics></math>，故 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\oint_L\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial n}ds\n=\\oint_Lf_xdy-f_ydx=\\iint_D(f_{xx}+f_{yy})\\,dxdy.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> E例9中<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f=(x-2)^2+y^2</annotation></semantics></math>，两二阶偏导之和为4，单位圆盘上结果<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\pi</annotation></semantics></math>。这里要求相应二阶偏导连续。</p>"},{"id":12,"title":"第一类曲面积分：投影与面积元","module":"surface1","html":"<p><strong>定位：B例12；E例10；H19—H23。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>A．平面片：面积因子为常数。</strong></p>\n<p>若<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=c-ax-by</annotation></semantics></math>，则<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS=\\sqrt{1+a^2+b^2}\\,dxdy</annotation></semantics></math>。H19中<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=1-x-y</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math>，投影为三角形<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x+y\\le1</annotation></semantics></math>： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msubsup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\iint_\\Sigma y^2dS=\\sqrt3\\int_0^1\\int_0^{1-y}y^2\\,dxdy=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{12}.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <strong>B．圆锥面：先消元确定投影。</strong></p>\n<p>E例10：<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}</annotation></semantics></math>，截界<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z^2=2x</annotation></semantics></math>。消去<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>得到<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2=2x</annotation></semantics></math>，投影区域为偏心圆盘 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nD:\\ x^2+y^2\\le2x,\\qquad -\\pi/2\\le\\theta\\le\\pi/2,\\quad0\\le r\\le2\\cos\\theta.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 锥面上<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS=\\sqrt2\\,dxdy</annotation></semantics></math>（顶点处按极限处理），密度<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9\\sqrt{x^2+y^2+z^2}=9\\sqrt2r</annotation></semantics></math>，所以 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></msubsup><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>64.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nM=18\\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}\\int_0^{2\\cos\\theta}r^2\\,drd\\theta=64.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <strong>C．柱面不适合投到<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xOy</annotation></semantics></math>：换投影或直接参数化。</strong></p>\n<p>H21单位圆柱侧面取<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=\\cos\\theta,y=\\sin\\theta,z=z</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le z\\le1</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le\\theta\\le2\\pi</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS=d\\theta dz</annotation></semantics></math>： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\iint_\\Sigma\\frac{dS}{x^2+y^2+z^2}\n=2\\pi\\int_0^1\\frac{dz}{1+z^2}=\\frac{\\pi^2}{2}.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 柱面在<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xOy</annotation></semantics></math>上的投影是一条圆周，不能把它当普通二维区域套<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=g(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math>公式。</p>\n<p><strong>D．球面优先对称。</strong></p>\n<p>完整半径<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math>的球面上，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∬</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint x^2dS=\\frac13R^2\\cdot4\\pi R^2=4\\pi R^4/3</annotation></semantics></math>。第一卦限球面三角形上的偶函数积分可取全球的八分之一。</p>\n<p><strong>E．方向导数最大值反求参数，再求面积。</strong></p>\n<p>H23中最大方向为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-3,-4)</annotation></semantics></math>，先单位化为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-3/5,-4/5)</annotation></semantics></math>，梯度长度为10，故<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(6a,8b)=(-6,-8)</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=b=-1</annotation></semantics></math>。再对<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=2-x^2-y^2\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math>投影求面积。</p>"},{"id":13,"title":"隐函数曲面：几何条件与根式抵消","module":"surface1","html":"<p><strong>定位：E例11，p.22—25。这是一道值得整题复盘的综合题。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>主线：切平面条件 → 轨迹 → 投影域 → 隐函数面积元。</strong></p>\n<p>设<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F=x^2+y^2+z^2-yz-1</annotation></semantics></math>，曲面法向量为 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n(F_x,F_y,F_z)=(2x,2y-z,2z-y).\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 切平面与<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xOy</annotation></semantics></math>面垂直，意味着两平面的法向量垂直，因此<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_z=2z-y=0</annotation></semantics></math>。代回曲面得轨迹 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nz=y/2,\\qquad x^2+3y^2/4=1.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 上方曲面为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\ge y/2</annotation></semantics></math>那一支，投影为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D:x^2+3y^2/4\\le1</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>\n<p><strong>不用先解复杂根式，直接隐函数求导：</strong> <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mrow><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></msqrt><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nz_x=-\\frac{F_x}{F_z},\\qquad z_y=-\\frac{F_y}{F_z},\\qquad\n dS=\\frac{\\sqrt{F_x^2+F_y^2+F_z^2}}{|F_z|}\\,dxdy.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 这里 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nF_x^2+F_y^2+F_z^2=4x^2+5y^2+5z^2-8yz.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 利用曲面关系<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4x^2+4y^2+4z^2-4yz=4</annotation></semantics></math>，化为 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nF_x^2+F_y^2+F_z^2=4+y^2+z^2-4yz.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 恰与原题分母相抵： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nI=\\iint_D(x+\\sqrt3)\\,dxdy.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math>项由对称性为零；椭圆半轴为1与<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2/\\sqrt3</annotation></semantics></math>，所以 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>⋅</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nI=\\sqrt3\\cdot\\pi\\cdot1\\cdot\\frac2{\\sqrt3}=2\\pi.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <strong>为什么这个方法高效：</strong>原题中的<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|y-2z|</annotation></semantics></math>和根式，正是在提示面积投影因子<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|F_z|/|\\nabla F|</annotation></semantics></math>。先识别这个结构，可避免显式解<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>后反复求导。</p>\n<p><strong>边界条件：</strong><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_z=0</annotation></semantics></math>恰出现在投影边界，不能说整个闭域上都能直接除以它；在内部推导，最后按极限延伸。原积分的几何对象与化简后的积分仍有正常意义。</p>"},{"id":14,"title":"第二类曲面积分：合一投影与方向","module":"surface2","html":"<p><strong>定位：B例13—15；E例12—14；H24—H27。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>A．单项投影：先找这一项对应的法向分量。</strong> <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nRdxdy=Rn_z\\,dS.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 对于<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=g(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math>，上侧转成<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+Rdxdy</annotation></semantics></math>，下侧转成<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-Rdxdy</annotation></semantics></math>。不再额外乘<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{1+g_x^2+g_y^2}</annotation></semantics></math>。H24先用曲面方程将<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{4-x^2-4z^2}</annotation></semantics></math>化为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|y|</annotation></semantics></math>，不是<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>\n<p><strong>B．多项合一投影：全部统一到同一平面。</strong></p>\n<p>上侧<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-g_x,-g_y,1)</annotation></semantics></math>给出 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>Q</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\iint_\\Sigma Pdy dz+Qdz dx+Rdx dy=\\iint_D(-Pg_x-Qg_y+R)\\,dxdy.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 下侧使用<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(g_x,g_y,-1)</annotation></semantics></math>，即<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_D(Pg_x+Qg_y-R)dxdy</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>\n<p>若<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=h(y,z)</annotation></semantics></math>且取<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_x&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>一侧，则改为 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>Q</mi><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>R</mi><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\iint_D(P-Qh_y-Rh_z)\\,dydz.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 不必死记“前后左右”名称，直接检查法向分量正负最稳。</p>\n<p><strong>C．抽象函数先消去：不一定需要可导。</strong></p>\n<p>B例14的平面<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x-y+z=1</annotation></semantics></math>，上侧法向量<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,-1,1)</annotation></semantics></math>。抽象函数系数向量为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(f,2f,f)</annotation></semantics></math>，点乘为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f-2f+f=0</annotation></semantics></math>。剩下<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x-y+z=1</annotation></semantics></math>，故通量化为投影面积。</p>\n<p>E例13锥面下侧法向量可取<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x/z,y/z,-1)</annotation></semantics></math>，抽象部分为 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nf(xy)\\left(\\frac{x^2+y^2}{z}-z\\right)=0.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 因为锥面上<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2=z^2</annotation></semantics></math>。只需连续，不必求<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f'</annotation></semantics></math>。该例题干与解式不同，详见核对提醒。</p>\n<p><strong>D．有绝对值又有对称：必须先合并完整被积函数。</strong></p>\n<p>E例14取抛物面下侧，合一投影后得到 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n2x|x|y^2z+2xy^4z-|y|xz^2,qquad z=x^2+y^2.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 三项均关于<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math>为奇函数，投影是单位圆盘，所以积分为0。不能在投影之前只凭<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|x|</annotation></semantics></math>或<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y^3</annotation></semantics></math>的奇偶性判断。</p>"},{"id":15,"title":"高斯公式：封闭、补面与反向","module":"gauss","html":"<p><strong>定位：B例15、16；E例15、16；H28—H31。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>A．封闭外侧：先算散度，再选体积分次序。</strong></p>\n<p>E例15球心为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(a,b,c)</annotation></semantics></math>，半径<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math>，散度为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2(x+y+z)</annotation></semantics></math>。均匀球体形心在球心： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\iiint_\\Omega x\\,dv=aV,\\quad\\iiint_\\Omega y\\,dv=bV,\\quad\\iiint_\\Omega z\\,dv=cV.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 故<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=2(a+b+c)V=8\\pi r^3(a+b+c)/3</annotation></semantics></math>。这是<strong>先高斯、再用形心</strong>，无需展开球坐标。</p>\n<p><strong>B．开放曲面补面：先统一为封闭外侧。</strong></p>\n<p>若原面<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math>就是外侧，补面<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma_0</annotation></semantics></math>也取外侧，则 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nI_\\Sigma=\\iiint_\\Omega\\operatorname{div}\\boldsymbol F\\,dv-I_{\\Sigma_0}.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 若原面是内侧，则 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nI_\\Sigma=I_{\\Sigma_0}-\\iiint_\\Omega\\operatorname{div}\\boldsymbol F\\,dv.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <strong>操作顺序：</strong>画出被围体积 → 标出立体外侧 → 比较原方向 → 列上述关系 → 分别算体积项和补面项。</p>\n<p><strong>C．先判断补面是否自动为零。</strong></p>\n<p>水平补面<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=c</annotation></semantics></math>上<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dy dz=dz dx=0</annotation></semantics></math>，仅剩<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Rdxdy</annotation></semantics></math>；若<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math>也为零则补面零。竖直坐标面同理。<strong>补面是平面不等于补面积分为零。</strong></p>\n<p>H29补<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0</annotation></semantics></math>的圆盘，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=x</annotation></semantics></math>令补面零。H30补<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=0</annotation></semantics></math>的椭圆盘，留下<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3xy</annotation></semantics></math>项，经对称性为零。</p>\n<p><strong>D．先重后单常比直接三重积分省。</strong></p>\n<p>H30对固定<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>截面<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_z:x^2+y^2/4\\le1-z</annotation></semantics></math>，面积<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\pi(1-z)</annotation></semantics></math>；散度为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3z</annotation></semantics></math>，所以体积分为 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\int_0^1 3z\\cdot2\\pi(1-z)\\,dz=\\pi.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <strong>E．特殊提醒：</strong>B例15分母在原半球面上恒为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math>。可先用曲面条件换成无奇点的多项式场再补面；不要把原来在原点无定义的场不加检查地延伸到整个半球体。曲面上等价的表达式可用于该曲面的积分，但补面和散度必须始终使用同一个选定场。</p>"},{"id":16,"title":"斯托克斯：选面比求导更重要","module":"stokes","html":"<p><strong>定位：B例18；E例17；H32、H33。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>A．平面与曲面的交线：优先选平面片。</strong></p>\n<p>同一条边界可以张成很多曲面，选择使法向量恒定、投影域简单的面。若<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=g(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math>上侧，设旋度为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(A,B,C)</annotation></semantics></math>，则 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\oint_LPdx+Qdy+Rdz=\\iint_D(-Ag_x-Bg_y+C)\\,dxdy.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <strong>B例18完整演示</strong></p>\n<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L:x^2+y^2=1,z=x+y</annotation></semantics></math>，从上往下看逆时针。选<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=x+y</annotation></semantics></math>上的圆盘形平面片，上侧法向量<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-1,-1,1)</annotation></semantics></math>。<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=xz,Q=x,R=y^2/2</annotation></semantics></math>，故 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n(A,B,C)=(y,x,1).\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 因此 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nI=\\iint_{x^2+y^2\\le1}(1-x-y)\\,dxdy=\\pi.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <strong>备选法：</strong>直接取<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=\\cos t,y=\\sin t,z=\\cos t+\\sin t</annotation></semantics></math>也能算；本题旋度简单，因此斯托克斯更短。</p>\n<p><strong>B．开放空间曲线：补线后用斯托克斯。</strong></p>\n<p>E例17补<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B\\to A</annotation></semantics></math>的直线段<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=z=0</annotation></semantics></math>。该段积分为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></msubsup><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_{-\\sqrt2}^{\\sqrt2}y\\,dy=0</annotation></semantics></math>。闭合边界位于平面<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=x</annotation></semantics></math>，与给定走向匹配的法向是<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,0,-1)</annotation></semantics></math>，即<strong>下侧</strong>。本题不能机械套“看起来是上半球，所以取上侧”。</p>\n<p><strong>C．边界不在一个平面：可选原曲面片。</strong></p>\n<p>H32为上半球与偏心柱面的交线，可选上半球被柱面截下的面片，投影<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D:x^2+y^2\\le2y</annotation></semantics></math>。求旋度后合一投影；若<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>在投影边界趋于零导致导数发散，按分片/极限处理，最终检查可积性。</p>\n<p><strong>D．菱形、矩形边界：投影＋奇偶性。</strong></p>\n<p>H33平面<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x+y+z=2</annotation></semantics></math>与<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|x|+|y|=1</annotation></semantics></math>相交。选上侧<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,1,1)</annotation></semantics></math>，旋度为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-2y-4z,-2z-6x,-2x-2y)</annotation></semantics></math>，合并并代<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=2-x-y</annotation></semantics></math>后为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-2x+2y-12</annotation></semantics></math>。菱形面积2，奇项为零，结果<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-24</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>"},{"id":17,"title":"质量、形心与重心：先确定积分对象","module":"applications","html":"<p><strong>定位：B例12；E例10、18；H34—H37。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>统一形式：</strong>密度乘几何微元得到质量，坐标乘质量微元得到一阶矩。 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>μ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>ρ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mi>M</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>ρ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mi>M</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>ρ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mi>M</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nM=\\int\\rho\\,d\\mu,qquad\n\\bar x=\\frac{\\int x\\rho\\,d\\mu}{M},\\quad\n\\bar y=\\frac{\\int y\\rho\\,d\\mu}{M},\\quad\n\\bar z=\\frac{\\int z\\rho\\,d\\mu}{M}.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 线状物<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d\\mu=ds</annotation></semantics></math>，面壳<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d\\mu=dS</annotation></semantics></math>，立体<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d\\mu=dv</annotation></semantics></math>。均匀密度可约去，得到形心。<strong>几何形状对称而密度不对称，重心未必在对称面上。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>A．面壳重心：分子分母分开检查奇偶性。</strong></p>\n<p>E例18面<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|x|+|y|+|z|=1</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho=|x|+|z|+z/3</annotation></semantics></math>。<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar x=\\bar y=0</annotation></semantics></math>，但<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar z</annotation></semantics></math>一般不为零，因为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\rho</annotation></semantics></math>中有<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z^2/3</annotation></semantics></math>偶项。</p>\n<p>在第一卦限<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=1-x-y</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS=\\sqrt3dxdy</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D:x,y\\ge0,x+y\\le1</annotation></semantics></math>： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\iint_D x\\,dxdy=\\frac16,\\qquad\\iint_Dz\\,dxdy=\\frac16,\\qquad\n\\iint_Dz^2\\,dxdy=\\frac1{12}.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 于是<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M=8\\sqrt3/3</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>S</mi></msub><mi>z</mi><mi>ρ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_Sz\\rho\\,dS=(1/3)\\cdot8\\sqrt3/12=2\\sqrt3/9</annotation></semantics></math>，所以<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar z=1/12</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>\n<p><strong>B．立体截面法：不必逐点做三重积分。</strong></p>\n<p>若每一水平截面的面积为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(z)</annotation></semantics></math>，截面形心为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x_c(z),y_c(z))</annotation></semantics></math>，均匀立体有 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><mi>V</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><mi>V</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nV=\\int A(z)dz,\\quad\n\\bar y=\\frac{\\int y_c(z)A(z)dz}{V},\\quad\n\\bar z=\\frac{\\int zA(z)dz}{V}.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> H36的截面圆盘中心<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,z)</annotation></semantics></math>，半径<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-z</annotation></semantics></math>，故<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(z)=\\pi(1-z)^2</annotation></semantics></math>；<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V=\\pi/3</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>z</mi><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_0^1zA(z)dz=\\pi/12</annotation></semantics></math>，形心<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,1/4,1/4)</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>\n<p><strong>C．旋转曲面围成立体：先找每个高度的半径。</strong></p>\n<p>H37直线可写成<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=1-z,y=z</annotation></semantics></math>。绕<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>轴旋转后<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^2=(1-z)^2+z^2</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le z\\le2</annotation></semantics></math>。由旋转对称<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar x=\\bar y=0</annotation></semantics></math>； <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\bar z=\\frac{\\int_0^2z[(1-z)^2+z^2]dz}{\\int_0^2[(1-z)^2+z^2]dz}=\\frac75.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>"},{"id":18,"title":"变力做功与最值：先把力写对","module":"applications","html":"<p><strong>定位：B例6；E例19；H38。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>A．大小＋方向：先单位化，再乘大小。</strong></p>\n<p>E例19中吸引点<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math>，运动点<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M=(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=\\sqrt{x^2+(y-1)^2}</annotation></semantics></math>。从<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math>指向<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math>的单位向量为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-x,1-y)/r</annotation></semantics></math>，故 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\boldsymbol F=\\frac{k}{r^3}(-x,1-y).\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 不能写成<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k(-x,1-y)/r^2</annotation></semantics></math>，那样向量的长度不再是<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k/r^2</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>\n<p><strong>B．保守力做功：凑出原函数只算端点。</strong> <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nd\\!\\left(\\frac{k}{r}\\right)\n=\\frac{-kx}{r^3}dx+\\frac{k(1-y)}{r^3}dy.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 因此从<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(2,0)</annotation></semantics></math>到<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(0,0)</annotation></semantics></math>的功 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>O</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nW=\\frac{k}{r_O}-\\frac{k}{r_B}=k\\left(1-\\frac1{\\sqrt5}\\right).\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 路径不经过引力中心<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math>；若经过奇点，不能原样套用。原函数在避开<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math>的区域有定义即可，不必为了算端点再参数化半圆。</p>\n<p><strong>C．切向力或垂直径向的力：坐标分量按方向确定。</strong></p>\n<p>B例6的力大小为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|OP|</annotation></semantics></math>且垂直<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OP</annotation></semantics></math>，候选分量为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-y,x)</annotation></semantics></math>或<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(y,-x)</annotation></semantics></math>。必须用题给夹角/箭头选符号，再写<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W=\\int Pdx+Qdy</annotation></semantics></math>。仅知道“垂直”不足以唯一确定方向。</p>\n<p><strong>D．做功最值：先把积分问题变成普通约束最值。</strong></p>\n<p>H38中<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol F=(yz,zx,xy)</annotation></semantics></math>，微分式为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d(xyz)</annotation></semantics></math>，从原点到<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>η</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>ζ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M(\\xi,\\eta,\\zeta)</annotation></semantics></math>的功为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mi>η</mi><mi>ζ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W=\\xi\\eta\\zeta</annotation></semantics></math>。令 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>ξ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>η</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>ζ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nu=\\frac{\\xi^2}{a^2},\\quad v=\\frac{\\eta^2}{b^2},\\quad w=\\frac{\\zeta^2}{c^2},\n\\qquad u+v+w=1.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 第一卦限下<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><msqrt><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W=abc\\sqrt{uvw}</annotation></semantics></math>，由均值不等式<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>w</mi><mo>≤</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">uvw\\le(1/3)^3</annotation></semantics></math>： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>η</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>ζ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nW_{\\max}=\\frac{abc}{3\\sqrt3},\\qquad\n(\\xi,\\eta,\\zeta)=\\left(\\frac a{\\sqrt3},\\frac b{\\sqrt3},\\frac c{\\sqrt3}\\right).\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 也可用拉格朗日乘数法；本题换成三个非负平方量后用均值不等式更短。</p>"},{"id":19,"title":"原资料核对提醒：不要把这些背错","module":"review","html":"<p><strong>以下是整理过程中已核实的具体问题，并非宣称原文件只有这些错误。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>1．E例13：题干和解式不一致，结果不同。</strong></p>\n<p>p.30题干第一系数为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xf(xy)+2xy-y</annotation></semantics></math>；p.32解式改为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xf(xy)+2x-y</annotation></semantics></math>，手写计算按后者进行。按题干原样，用下侧合一投影并消去<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math>，得到 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi></mrow><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nI=\\iint_{1\\le x^2+y^2\\le4}\\left[\\frac{2x^2y}{r}+\\frac{y^2-x^2}{r}\\right]dxdy=0.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 第一项关于<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math>奇对称，第二项交换<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y</annotation></semantics></math>变号。若改用解式中的<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2x</annotation></semantics></math>，被积函数为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math>，则 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>14</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nI=\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\int_1^2r^2drd\\theta=\\frac{14\\pi}{3}.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <strong>结论：原题版为0；把<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2xy</annotation></semantics></math>改成<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2x</annotation></semantics></math>的版本为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>14</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">14\\pi/3</annotation></semantics></math>。不能混写。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>2．E例16：仅有<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math>连续可导，不保证原场处处有定义。</strong></p>\n<p>p.37—39有<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R=f(y/z)/y+z^3</annotation></semantics></math>，而所围区域经过<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=0</annotation></semantics></math>。例如<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>≡</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f\\equiv1</annotation></semantics></math>满足连续可导，但<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/y</annotation></semantics></math>在该处无定义，因此不能无条件直接用经典高斯公式。</p>\n<p>在<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y\\ne0</annotation></semantics></math>处确有<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_y+R_z=3y^2+3z^2</annotation></semantics></math>，但<strong>局部代数抵消不能代替全区域适用条件</strong>。若额外说明奇点可消去，并且相应系数延拓后具有连续一阶偏导，才能按讲义路线算得 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>93</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nI=\\frac{93\\pi}{5}(2-\\sqrt2).\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 这只是满足额外正则条件时的结果；题干原条件不足，不能将其作为无条件答案。若另定义广义积分，还须另外检查收敛性。</p>\n<p><strong>3．E例18：体积分模板不能用于面壳重心。</strong></p>\n<p>p.44展示的是体密度的三重积分模板，而本题对象是曲面；p.45实际已经改用曲面积分。p.46还出现积分区域/微元混排。应统一为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>S</mi></msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M=\\iint_S\\rho dS</annotation></semantics></math>及<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>S</mi></msub><mi>z</mi><mi>ρ</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar z=\\iint_Sz\\rho dS/M</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>\n<p><strong>4．H28：投影域的文字式漏掉坐标非负限制。</strong></p>\n<p>p.38的<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D=\\{2x+y\\le2\\}</annotation></semantics></math>必须结合题意补全为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\ge0,y\\ge0,2x+y\\le2</annotation></semantics></math>，否则不是有限三角形。</p>\n<p><strong>5．E例12：边界上的分母和投影退化要说明。</strong></p>\n<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=(x^2+y^2)/x</annotation></semantics></math>在投影圆盘与<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0</annotation></semantics></math>相切的点按原式无定义，但在曲面参数化/通量组合中可作极限处理；另有<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=0</annotation></semantics></math>处投影导数退化。可按删去邻域后取极限计算，不能声称原系数在整个闭曲面片上光滑。</p>"},{"id":20,"title":"考前速查：方向、范围、微元","module":"review","html":"<p><strong>一、每道题的四行草稿模板</strong> </p><ol><li>对象：第几类积分；曲线/曲面是否封闭；积分对象是否分片。</li><li>范围：参数区间或投影域，写全上下限与非负约束。</li><li>方向：起终点/顺逆时针/法向量；原方向是否等于外侧。</li><li>方法：先写一般公式，再代入本题表达式；最后进行积分。</li></ol>\n<p><strong>二、最容易丢分的12件事</strong> </p><ol><li>第一类积分不随方向变号；第二类反向变号。</li><li>第一类微元有长度/面积因子；第二类投影式不能多乘一次面积因子。</li><li><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds</annotation></semantics></math>中的平方根是非负的，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{h^2}=|h|</annotation></semantics></math>。</li><li>极坐标/柱坐标的雅可比<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math>不能漏；球坐标是<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^2\\sin\\varphi</annotation></semantics></math>。</li><li>投影曲线只是边界，投影区域还要确定内部、不等式和范围。</li><li>补线从终点回起点，补面方向必须和封闭外侧一致。</li><li>下半球上侧、上开口抛物面上侧，常常是立体的内侧。</li><li>使用格林/高斯前，扫一遍分母为零点和不可导处。</li><li>曲线或曲面关于坐标对称，不等于每个被积项都可缩域。</li><li>只有连续的<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math>，不能为了套高斯随意求<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f'</annotation></semantics></math>。</li><li>重心公式中分子和分母使用同一种几何微元。</li><li>求原函数时，对<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math>积分后补<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(y)</annotation></semantics></math>；不要漏未知函数。</li></ol>\n<p><strong>三、三个快速验算</strong> </p><ul><li>非负函数的第一类积分应非负；若算出负值，先查上下限和微元。</li><li>通量题改变侧，结果应整体反号；不能只有某一项换号。</li><li>缩放检查：长度尺度放大<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math>倍，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds</annotation></semantics></math>多<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS</annotation></semantics></math>多<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a^2</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dv</annotation></semantics></math>多<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a^3</annotation></semantics></math>。再乘被积函数的次数，检验最终幂次。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>四、只剩30分钟时复习什么</strong></p>\n<p>先看第02—03节公式和方向；再看第09节奇点、第14—16节投影/高斯/斯托克斯；最后把本页四行模板默写一次。不要在最后时刻硬背大量零散数值答案。</p>"},{"id":21,"title":"复盘安排：用“会选法”检验掌握","module":"review","html":"<p><strong>第一轮：只练识别与列式，不急着算到底。</strong></p>\n<p>每题给自己60—90秒，写出类型、方向、投影/参数、方法和定理条件。建议按下列代表题走一遍；遇到选不出方法的题，回相应方法卡。</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><tr><th>模块</th><th>代表题</th><th>过关标准</th></tr><tr><td>三重积分</td><td>H02、H04、H05</td><td>会用平均值、设常数、截面积</td></tr><tr><td>第一类曲线</td><td>B例1、E例3、E例4</td><td>会先化简、选参数、轮换凑恒等式</td></tr><tr><td>第二类曲线</td><td>E例5、E例6</td><td>会分段、写有向上下限、消全微分</td></tr><tr><td>格林与奇点</td><td>B例7、B例8、H14</td><td>会补线、挖洞、比较正负区域</td></tr><tr><td>路径无关</td><td>B例11、H18、E例8</td><td>会求原函数、建立微分方程、拼接证明</td></tr><tr><td>第一类曲面</td><td>E例10、E例11、H21</td><td>会投影、隐函数面积元、柱面参数</td></tr><tr><td>第二类曲面</td><td>B例14、E例13、H27</td><td>会法向点乘、消抽象项、合一投影</td></tr><tr><td>高斯</td><td>H29、H30、H31</td><td>会补面、识别内外侧、截面法</td></tr><tr><td>斯托克斯</td><td>B例18、E例17、H33</td><td>会选面、补线、核对右手规则</td></tr><tr><td>应用</td><td>E例18、H36、H38</td><td>会区分面/体、用截面形心、做功转最值</td></tr></table></div>\n<p><strong>第二轮：每模块完整做1—2题，强制记录错误类别。</strong></p>\n<p>用四个标签即可：<strong>选法错、条件漏、方向错、计算错</strong>。复盘不能只写“粗心”，要写出下次的具体动作，例如“补面后先画封闭外法线，再列原面关系”。</p>\n<p><strong>第三轮：闭卷回答下面8问。</strong> </p><ol><li>为什么<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_L fds</annotation></semantics></math>不随方向改变，而<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_LPdx</annotation></semantics></math>会变号？</li><li>哪两个条件共同保证奇函数项积分为零？</li><li>为什么<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_y=Q_x</annotation></semantics></math>不总能保证绕原点的积分为零？</li><li>第一类曲面积分的面积因子为何在通量合一投影中消失？</li><li>“上侧”与“外侧”有什么区别？举一个不相同的例子。</li><li>为什么连续抽象函数题应先尝试法向点乘消项？</li><li>斯托克斯为什么可以换面，但不能随意换方向？</li><li>形状对称而密度不对称时，重心为什么未必对称？</li></ol> 判断真正会不会：能独立写出正确的第一行列式，并解释该方法为什么适用。"},{"id":22,"title":"几何辅助工具：投影、参数与自动消项","module":"foundation","html":"<p><strong>A．球面与平面交圆：先求圆心、半径，再选两个平面内方向。</strong></p>\n<p>若球心为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O</annotation></semantics></math>，半径为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math>，球心到平面距离为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d&lt;R</annotation></semantics></math>，交圆圆心<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math>为球心在平面上的垂足，半径为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=\\sqrt{R^2-d^2}</annotation></semantics></math>。选平面内两个互相垂直的单位向量<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">e</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol e_1,\\boldsymbol e_2</annotation></semantics></math>，可写 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">e</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\boldsymbol r(t)=\\boldsymbol C+a\\cos t\\,\\boldsymbol e_1+a\\sin t\\,\\boldsymbol e_2,\n\\qquad ds=a\\,dt\\quad(0\\le t\\le2\\pi).\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 这是把平面内的圆按“横、纵两个互相垂直的方向”描出，不需要超出数一的知识。第二类积分还须检查参数递增的走向。</p>\n<p>例如<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x+y+z=0</annotation></semantics></math>内可取 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">e</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\boldsymbol e_1=\\frac{(1,-1,0)}{\\sqrt2},\\qquad\n\\boldsymbol e_2=\\frac{(1,1,-2)}{\\sqrt6}.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 先验算它们的分量和均为0、长度均为1、数量积为0。轮换对称无法简化的交圆题，这一参数法是可靠备选。</p>\n<p><strong>B．空间交线的投影：消元之后还要检查是否有实解。</strong></p>\n<p>消去<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>得到<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(x,y)=0</annotation></semantics></math>只是候选投影曲线；还要保留原式的<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math>、根号非负、卦限等条件。曲面片投影域通常由该边界围成，但仍需由原几何关系判断取内侧还是外侧。</p>\n<p><strong>C．曲面与平面“垂直/平行”：转成法向关系。</strong></p>\n<p>曲面<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F=0</annotation></semantics></math>的法向量为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(F_x,F_y,F_z)</annotation></semantics></math>。切平面垂直于<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xOy</annotation></semantics></math>面时<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_z=0</annotation></semantics></math>；切平面平行于<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xOy</annotation></semantics></math>面时<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_x=F_y=0</annotation></semantics></math>且<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_z\\ne0</annotation></semantics></math>。两种条件不要混淆。</p>\n<p><strong>D．第二类曲面积分自动为零的情形。</strong></p>\n<p>曲面垂直于<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xOy</annotation></semantics></math>面时，法向量的<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>分量为零，所以<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Rdxdy=0</annotation></semantics></math>；同理，垂直于<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">yOz</annotation></semantics></math>面时<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Pdy dz=0</annotation></semantics></math>，垂直于<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">zOx</annotation></semantics></math>面时<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Qdz dx=0</annotation></semantics></math>。判断的是<strong>对应项</strong>，不是整个通量一定为零。第一类积分<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS</annotation></semantics></math>并不因此为零。</p>\n<p><strong>E．基础性质：分段、分片和估计都从这里来。</strong></p>\n<p>四类积分均有线性与可加性；有向积分在分段拼接时要保持一致方向。第一类积分满足 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\left|\\int_L fds\\right|\\le\\int_L|f|ds,\\qquad\n\\left|\\iint_\\Sigma fdS\\right|\\le\\iint_\\Sigma|f|dS.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 积分函数恒为1时，第一类曲线积分为长度，第一类曲面积分为面积。第二类积分即使系数全非负，也未必非负。</p>"}],"nodes":[{"id":"s1","section":1,"module":"foundation","title":"先判断是什么，再决定怎么算","html":"<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><tr><th>看到什么</th><th>首先想到</th><th>必须核查</th></tr><tr><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds</annotation></semantics></math></td><td>第一类曲线积分；先对称/曲线上恒等式，再参数化</td><td>无方向；弧长微元非负</td></tr><tr><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Pdx+Qdy+Rdz</annotation></semantics></math></td><td>第二类曲线积分；先凑微分、化简，再选参数或定理</td><td>起终点、闭合与否、系数奇点</td></tr><tr><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS</annotation></semantics></math></td><td>第一类曲面积分；先对称，再投影或参数化</td><td>是否需要分片；面积因子</td></tr><tr><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Pdy dz+Qdz dx+Rdx dy</annotation></semantics></math></td><td>第二类曲面积分；先法向，再合一投影/高斯</td><td>上下/内外侧；是否封闭</td></tr><tr><td>平面闭曲线</td><td>格林：<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x-P_y</annotation></semantics></math>是否很简单？</td><td>整个内部及边界的光滑性</td></tr><tr><td>空间闭曲线</td><td>斯托克斯：旋度是否简单？</td><td>选择同边界曲面；右手规则</td></tr><tr><td>闭曲面的通量</td><td>高斯：<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_x+Q_y+R_z</annotation></semantics></math></td><td>内部是否有奇点；外侧</td></tr><tr><td>开放曲线/曲面</td><td>直接计算，或补线/补面后减去</td><td>辅助部分的方向和积分</td></tr><tr><td>抽象函数</td><td>先看能否代数消去；再看求导能否抵消</td><td>仅连续不能擅自求偏导</td></tr><tr><td>奇点在内部</td><td>挖洞/挖球后用定理</td><td>不能直接由“导数为零”判积分零</td></tr></table></div>\n<p><strong>考场的五步主线</strong> </p><ol><li><strong>看微元：</strong>先判是哪一类积分，避免把<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds,dS</annotation></semantics></math>和有向微元混用。</li><li><strong>画范围：</strong>封闭吗？投影是什么？有几片？起终点在哪？</li><li><strong>先化简：</strong>奇偶、轮换、曲线曲面方程、全微分，能省掉大量运算。</li><li><strong>比方法：</strong>直接参数/投影，与格林/高斯/斯托克斯，哪一种运算更少？</li><li><strong>再检条件：</strong>方向、奇点、光滑性、上下限全部确定后再积分。</li></ol>\n<p><strong>最优先掌握：</strong>四类积分直接法；第一类积分对称性；补线格林；全微分；合一投影；补面高斯；平面型边界的斯托克斯。</p>\n<p><strong>第二层提升：</strong>轮换对称＋约束恒等式；挖洞/挖球；积分恒定反求函数；齐次关系证明；法向导数积分；隐函数曲面约分；重心与做功最值。</p>\n<p><strong>重要判断：</strong>“出现空间曲线”不等于必须用斯托克斯；“出现封闭曲面”也不等于必须用高斯。若曲面上分母成为常数，或抽象函数与法向量点乘后消失，直接法往往更好。</p>","exerciseIds":["B1","B2","B3","B4","B5","B6","B7","B8","B9","B10","B11","B12","B13","B14","B15","B16","B17","B18","B19","E3","E4","E5","E6","E7","E8","E9","E10","E11","E12","E13","E14","E15","E16","E17","E18","E19","H01","H02","H03","H04","H05","H06","H07","H08","H09","H10","H11","H12","H13","H14","H15","H16","H17","H18","H19","H20","H21","H22","H23","H24","H25","H26","H27","H28","H29","H30","H31","H32","H33","H34","H35","H36","H37","H38"]},{"id":"s2","section":2,"module":"foundation","title":"四类积分：公式与本质","html":"<p><strong>第一类曲线积分：沿曲线累计标量，微元是长度。</strong></p>\n<p>设<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=x(t),y=y(t),z=z(t)</annotation></semantics></math>，按不重复描绘曲线的参数区间<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a\\le t\\le b</annotation></semantics></math>积分： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\int_L f\\,ds=\\int_a^b f(x(t),y(t),z(t))\\sqrt{x'(t)^2+y'(t)^2+z'(t)^2}\\,dt.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 平面曲线删去<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z'</annotation></semantics></math>项；<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=x(y)</annotation></semantics></math>时取<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds=\\sqrt{1+(dx/dy)^2}\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math>，这里<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math>按从小到大积分。极坐标<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=r(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math>： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mtext>按递增区间积分</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nds=\\sqrt{r^2+(r')^2}\\,d\\theta\\qquad(\\theta\\text{按递增区间积分}).\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <strong>第二类曲线积分：沿指定方向累计切向作用。</strong> <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><msup><mi>z</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\int_L Pdx+Qdy+Rdz=\\int_{t_A}^{t_B}(Px'+Qy'+Rz')\\,dt.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 这里<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P,Q,R</annotation></semantics></math>都先代入参数方程；<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_A,t_B</annotation></semantics></math>按起终点取，允许<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_A&gt;t_B</annotation></semantics></math>。反向积分变号。</p>\n<p><strong>第一类曲面积分：沿曲面累计标量，微元是面积。</strong></p>\n<p>若<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=g(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math>，投影为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math>，则 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\iint_\\Sigma f\\,dS=\\iint_D f(x,y,g(x,y))\\sqrt{1+g_x^2+g_y^2}\\,dxdy.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <strong>第二类曲面积分：累计穿过指定侧的通量。</strong></p>\n<p>若<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=g(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math>且取上侧，法向量可取<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-g_x,-g_y,1)</annotation></semantics></math>，则 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>Q</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\iint_\\Sigma Pdy dz+Qdz dx+Rdx dy=\\iint_D(-Pg_x-Qg_y+R)\\,dxdy.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 下侧整体加负号；系数中的<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>必须替换为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>\n<p><strong>两组联系，别混用切向与法向</strong> <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nPdx+Qdy+Rdz=(P\\cos\\alpha+Q\\cos\\beta+R\\cos\\gamma)\\,ds.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 上式的方向余弦属于<strong>单位切向量</strong>；下式属于<strong>单位法向量</strong>： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nPdy dz+Qdz dx+Rdx dy=(P\\cos\\alpha+Q\\cos\\beta+R\\cos\\gamma)\\,dS.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <strong>本质：</strong>第一类的微元始终非负；第二类的符号由方向决定。非单位法向量不能直接当方向余弦，但可用“非单位法向量×投影面积”计算通量。</p>","exerciseIds":["B1","B2","B3","B4","B5","B6","B7","B8","B9","B10","B11","B12","B13","B14","B15","B16","B17","B18","B19","E3","E4","E5","E6","E7","E8","E9","E10","E11","E12","E13","E14","E15","E16","E17","E18","E19","H06","H07","H08","H09","H10","H11","H12","H13","H14","H15","H16","H17","H18","H19","H20","H21","H22","H23","H24","H25","H26","H27","H28","H29","H30","H31","H32","H33","H34","H35","H36","H37","H38"]},{"id":"s3","section":3,"module":"foundation","title":"三个大公式：适用条件与方向","html":"<p><strong>格林：平面边界积分变平面区域积分</strong> <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\oint_{\\partial D}Pdx+Qdy=\\iint_D(Q_x-P_y)\\,dxdy.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 要求<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P,Q</annotation></semantics></math>在包含区域及边界的适当邻域内有连续一阶偏导；边界分段光滑。正向为<strong>沿边界走，区域在左手边</strong>：外边界逆时针，内孔边界顺时针。</p>\n<p><strong>高斯：封闭曲面通量变体积分</strong> <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\iint_{\\partial\\Omega}Pdy dz+Qdz dx+Rdx dy\n=\\iiint_\\Omega(P_x+Q_y+R_z)\\,dv.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 曲面取<strong>整个边界的外侧</strong>；<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P,Q,R</annotation></semantics></math>在区域及边界有连续一阶偏导。若有内腔，“外侧”在内腔边界上指向空腔内部。</p>\n<p><strong>斯托克斯：空间边界积分变曲面通量</strong> 记<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=R_y-Q_z</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B=P_z-R_x</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C=Q_x-P_y</annotation></semantics></math>，则 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mi>A</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\oint_{\\partial\\Sigma}Pdx+Qdy+Rdz\n=\\iint_\\Sigma A\\,dy dz+B\\,dz dx+C\\,dx dy.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P,Q,R</annotation></semantics></math>须在所选曲面附近有连续一阶偏导。边界和法向满足<strong>右手规则</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>方向快速检查</strong> </p><ul><li>从<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>轴正向向原点看为逆时针：相应法向的<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>分量为正。</li><li>“上侧”只表示<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_z&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>，不保证是某立体的外侧。</li><li>下半球的上侧指向球内；抛物面<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=x^2+y^2</annotation></semantics></math>与上盖围成立体时，抛物面的上侧也指向内部。</li><li>圆孔挖掉后，孔的正向与外边界相反。不能让所有边界都逆时针再直接相加。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>散度是标量，旋度是向量</strong> <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">rot</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\operatorname{div}\\boldsymbol F=P_x+Q_y+R_z,\n\\qquad\\operatorname{rot}\\boldsymbol F=(R_y-Q_z,\\ P_z-R_x,\\ Q_x-P_y).\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 格林是平面情形；高斯看散度；斯托克斯看旋度。计算之前先把<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P,Q,R</annotation></semantics></math>逐项抄对。</p>","exerciseIds":["B7","B8","B9","B16","B17","B18","B19","E7","E8","E9","E15","E16","E17","H14","H16","H18","H28","H29","H30","H32","H33"]},{"id":"s22-0","section":22,"module":"foundation","title":"球面与平面交圆：先求圆心、半径，再选两个平面内方向","html":"<p>若球心为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O</annotation></semantics></math>，半径为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math>，球心到平面距离为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d&lt;R</annotation></semantics></math>，交圆圆心<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math>为球心在平面上的垂足，半径为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=\\sqrt{R^2-d^2}</annotation></semantics></math>。选平面内两个互相垂直的单位向量<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">e</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol e_1,\\boldsymbol e_2</annotation></semantics></math>，可写 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">e</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\boldsymbol r(t)=\\boldsymbol C+a\\cos t\\,\\boldsymbol e_1+a\\sin t\\,\\boldsymbol e_2,\n\\qquad ds=a\\,dt\\quad(0\\le t\\le2\\pi).\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 这是把平面内的圆按“横、纵两个互相垂直的方向”描出，不需要超出数一的知识。第二类积分还须检查参数递增的走向。</p>\n<p>例如<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x+y+z=0</annotation></semantics></math>内可取 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">e</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\boldsymbol e_1=\\frac{(1,-1,0)}{\\sqrt2},\\qquad\n\\boldsymbol e_2=\\frac{(1,1,-2)}{\\sqrt6}.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 先验算它们的分量和均为0、长度均为1、数量积为0。轮换对称无法简化的交圆题，这一参数法是可靠备选。</p>","exerciseIds":["B3","E4","H07","H09"]},{"id":"s22-1","section":22,"module":"foundation","title":"空间交线的投影：消元之后还要检查是否有实解","html":"<p>消去<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>得到<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(x,y)=0</annotation></semantics></math>只是候选投影曲线；还要保留原式的<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math>、根号非负、卦限等条件。曲面片投影域通常由该边界围成，但仍需由原几何关系判断取内侧还是外侧。</p>","exerciseIds":["E6","E10","E12","H12","H13","H32"]},{"id":"s22-2","section":22,"module":"foundation","title":"曲面与平面“垂直/平行”：转成法向关系","html":"<p>曲面<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F=0</annotation></semantics></math>的法向量为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(F_x,F_y,F_z)</annotation></semantics></math>。切平面垂直于<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xOy</annotation></semantics></math>面时<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_z=0</annotation></semantics></math>；切平面平行于<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xOy</annotation></semantics></math>面时<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_x=F_y=0</annotation></semantics></math>且<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_z\\ne0</annotation></semantics></math>。两种条件不要混淆。</p>","exerciseIds":["E11"]},{"id":"s22-3","section":22,"module":"foundation","title":"第二类曲面积分自动为零的情形","html":"<p>曲面垂直于<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xOy</annotation></semantics></math>面时，法向量的<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>分量为零，所以<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Rdxdy=0</annotation></semantics></math>；同理，垂直于<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">yOz</annotation></semantics></math>面时<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Pdy dz=0</annotation></semantics></math>，垂直于<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">zOx</annotation></semantics></math>面时<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Qdz dx=0</annotation></semantics></math>。判断的是<strong>对应项</strong>，不是整个通量一定为零。第一类积分<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS</annotation></semantics></math>并不因此为零。</p>","exerciseIds":["B14","E13","H29","H30"]},{"id":"s22-4","section":22,"module":"foundation","title":"基础性质：分段、分片和估计都从这里来","html":"<p>四类积分均有线性与可加性；有向积分在分段拼接时要保持一致方向。第一类积分满足 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\left|\\int_L fds\\right|\\le\\int_L|f|ds,\\qquad\n\\left|\\iint_\\Sigma fdS\\right|\\le\\iint_\\Sigma|f|dS.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 积分函数恒为1时，第一类曲线积分为长度，第一类曲面积分为面积。第二类积分即使系数全非负，也未必非负。</p>","exerciseIds":["B13","H10","E18"]},{"id":"s4-0","section":4,"module":"triple","title":"球体、球壳、圆锥配球：球坐标","html":"<p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>φ</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>φ</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>φ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>φ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nx=r\\sin\\varphi\\cos\\theta,\\quad y=r\\sin\\varphi\\sin\\theta,\\quad z=r\\cos\\varphi,\n\\qquad dv=r^2\\sin\\varphi\\,dr\\,d\\varphi\\,d\\theta.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 先由球面确定<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math>，由圆锥确定<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varphi</annotation></semantics></math>，再由卦限/半平面确定<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>。例如上圆锥内部<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≥</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\ge\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}</annotation></semantics></math>对应<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le\\varphi\\le\\pi/4</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>","exerciseIds":["H01","E16"]},{"id":"s4-1","section":4,"module":"triple","title":"上下曲面夹层：先单后重","html":"<p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\iiint_\\Omega f\\,dv=\\iint_D\\left[\\int_{z_1(x,y)}^{z_2(x,y)}f\\,dz\\right]dxdy.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 圆盘投影常转柱坐标<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=\\rho\\cos\\theta,y=\\rho\\sin\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>ρ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dv=\\rho\\,d\\rho\\,d\\theta\\,dz</annotation></semantics></math>。偏心圆<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2\\le2y</annotation></semantics></math>变为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le\\rho\\le2\\sin\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>，角度仍须结合区域确定。</p>","exerciseIds":["H03","H28","H31"]},{"id":"s4-2","section":4,"module":"triple","title":"截面简单：先重后单","html":"<p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\iiint_\\Omega f\\,dv=\\int_a^b\\left[\\iint_{D_z}f(x,y,z)\\,dxdy\\right]dz.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 若被积函数仅为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(z)</annotation></semantics></math>，就等于<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_a^b f(z)A(z)\\,dz</annotation></semantics></math>。单位球的截面面积<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(z)=\\pi(1-z^2)</annotation></semantics></math>，这正是H05的证明。</p>","exerciseIds":["H05","H29","H30","H35","H36"]},{"id":"s4-3","section":4,"module":"triple","title":"缩小区域的积分极限：连续函数近似为点值","html":"<p>H02中<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(0,0,0)=1</annotation></semantics></math>，球体积<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_r=4\\pi r^3/3</annotation></semantics></math>。由连续性， <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><msub><mo>∭</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><munder><mrow><mi>sup</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>⟶</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\left|\\frac1{\\pi r^3}\\iiint_{\\Omega_r}(f-1)\\,dv\\right|\n\\le\\frac43\\sup_{\\Omega_r}|f-1|\\longrightarrow0.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 故极限为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4/3</annotation></semantics></math>。注意分母是<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi r^3</annotation></semantics></math>，不是球体积，不能直接答1。</p>","exerciseIds":["H02"]},{"id":"s4-4","section":4,"module":"triple","title":"未知函数中含整个定积分：设常数再积分","html":"<p>H04设<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C=\\iiint_\\Omega f\\,dv</annotation></semantics></math>，原式成为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}+zC</annotation></semantics></math>。两边积分： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nC=A+BC,\\quad A=\\frac\\pi6,\\quad B=\\frac\\pi4,\n\\qquad C=\\frac{2\\pi}{12-3\\pi}.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 其中<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>z</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>ρ</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=\\int_0^1\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\int_0^z\\rho^2\\,d\\rho d\\theta dz</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>z</mi><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B=\\int_0^1z\\pi z^2\\,dz</annotation></semantics></math>。方法本质：积分变量积掉后，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math>是常数；若<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-B=0</annotation></semantics></math>须另判相容性。</p>","exerciseIds":["H04"]},{"id":"s5-0","section":5,"module":"line1","title":"抛物线优先选“没有根号的变量”","html":"<p>若<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y^2=2x</annotation></semantics></math>，选<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=y^2/2</annotation></semantics></math>，则<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx/dy=y</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds=\\sqrt{1+y^2}\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math>。 H06从<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(2,-2)</annotation></semantics></math>到<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(8,4)</annotation></semantics></math>的整段弧应取<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-2\\le y\\le4</annotation></semantics></math>，不能只取上半支。 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mi>y</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mn>17</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\int_L y\\,ds=\\int_{-2}^4y\\sqrt{1+y^2}\\,dy\n=\\frac13\\left(17^{3/2}-5^{3/2}\\right).\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 用<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math>积分也能做，但必须在顶点分段，并区分<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\pm\\sqrt{2x}</annotation></semantics></math>。这就是选<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math>更省事的原因。</p>","exerciseIds":["B2","H06"]},{"id":"s5-1","section":5,"module":"line1","title":"圆、椭圆用三角参数；星形线用三次幂参数","html":"<p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>椭圆：</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mtext>星形线：</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\text{椭圆：}\\quad x=a\\cos t,\\ y=b\\sin t;\n\\qquad\\text{星形线：}\\quad x=a\\cos^3t,\\ y=a\\sin^3t.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> H08中<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=1</annotation></semantics></math>。第一象限<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le t\\le\\pi/2</annotation></semantics></math>： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nds=3\\sin t\\cos t\\,dt,\\qquad\nL=4\\int_0^{\\pi/2}3\\sin t\\cos t\\,dt=6.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 全周期的<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds</annotation></semantics></math>要写成<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3|\\sin t\\cos t|dt</annotation></semantics></math>；缩到第一象限才可去掉绝对值。</p>","exerciseIds":["H07","H08"]},{"id":"s5-2","section":5,"module":"line1","title":"双纽线：对称缩域＋极坐标弧长","html":"<p>E例3中<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^2=a^2\\cos2\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>。第一象限那一段满足<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le\\theta\\le\\pi/4</annotation></semantics></math>，且 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n2rr'=-2a^2\\sin2\\theta,qquad\nr^2+(r')^2=\\frac{a^2}{\\cos2\\theta}.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 所以<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi></mrow></msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\,ds=(a\\sqrt{\\cos2\\theta}\\cos\\theta)\\cdot a/\\sqrt{\\cos2\\theta}\\,d\\theta\n=a^2\\cos\\theta\\,d\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>，从而 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\int_L|x|\\,ds=4a^2\\int_0^{\\pi/4}\\cos\\theta\\,d\\theta=2\\sqrt2\\,a^2.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <strong>易错点：</strong>端点参数导数可发散，但化简后的积分可收敛；按极限理解。不能因整个图形在四象限就任取<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le\\theta\\le\\pi/2</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>","exerciseIds":["E3"]},{"id":"s6-0","section":6,"module":"line1","title":"奇偶对称：积分对象和微元都要保持不变","html":"<p>对第一类积分，如果曲线/曲面关于<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0</annotation></semantics></math>对称，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math>关于<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math>为奇函数，则积分为零；若为偶函数，才能缩到<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math>并乘2。关于三个坐标面对称时，只有同时满足对应偶性才可乘8。</p>","exerciseIds":["B1","H09","H20","E14","H34"]},{"id":"s6-1","section":6,"module":"line1","title":"轮换对称：把相等的积分相加，凑已知条件","html":"<p>B例3与E例4有同一条曲线：<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2+z^2=1</annotation></semantics></math>与<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x+y+z=0</annotation></semantics></math>的交圆，长度<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\pi</annotation></semantics></math>。交换/轮换坐标保持曲线不变，因此 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\oint_Lx^2ds=\\oint_Ly^2ds=\\oint_Lz^2ds\n=\\frac13\\oint_L(x^2+y^2+z^2)ds=\\frac{2\\pi}3.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 同理三个交叉项积分相等。先把约束平方： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n(x+y+z)^2=x^2+y^2+z^2+2(xy+yz+zx)=0,\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nxy+yz+zx=-\\frac12,\n\\qquad\\oint_Lxy\\,ds=\\frac13\\oint_L\\left(-\\frac12\\right)ds=-\\frac\\pi3.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 这类题的关键是<strong>积分相等</strong>，不是断言曲线上每点都有<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2=y^2=z^2</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>","exerciseIds":["B3","E4","H01","H09","H20","H34"]},{"id":"s6-2","section":6,"module":"line1","title":"曲线上恒等式：直接凑常数","html":"<p>B例1椭圆<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2/4+y^2/3=1</annotation></semantics></math>上，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3x^2+4y^2=12</annotation></semantics></math>，而<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xy</annotation></semantics></math>项由奇偶性消去。因此若周长为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math>，原积分等于<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12a</annotation></semantics></math>，无需计算椭圆周长。</p>","exerciseIds":["B1","B3","E4","E6","H09"]},{"id":"s6-3","section":6,"module":"line1","title":"只有部分对称，不能硬凑三等份","html":"<p>H07曲线<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=y</annotation></semantics></math>与球面相交，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y,z</annotation></semantics></math>并不完全轮换对称。可取 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nx=\\frac a{\\sqrt2}\\cos t,\\quad y=\\frac a{\\sqrt2}\\cos t,\\quad z=a\\sin t,\n\\quad ds=a\\,dt.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 于是<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_Lx^2ds=\\pi a^3/2</annotation></semantics></math>，不是<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\pi a^3/3</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>\n<p><strong>第二类积分尤其小心：</strong>不能只看<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math>是奇函数就判<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Pdx</annotation></semantics></math>积分为零。先把方向和微元一起参数化，或转成第一类/投影积分，再检查完整被积函数的奇偶性。</p>","exerciseIds":["H07"]},{"id":"s7-0","section":7,"module":"line2","title":"折线或绝对值：在拐点/符号改变处分段","html":"<p>E例5的两段：<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(1,0)\\to B(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math>上<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=1-x</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx+dy=0</annotation></semantics></math>；<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B\\to C(-1,0)</annotation></semantics></math>上<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=x+1</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|x|+|y|=1</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx+dy=2dx</annotation></semantics></math>。故 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\int_L\\frac{dx+dy}{|x|+|y|}=0+\\int_0^{-1}2dx=-2.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 特别注意第二段的<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math>由0到<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1</annotation></semantics></math>，不能为“从小到大”擅自交换上下限。</p>","exerciseIds":["E5","H10","H13"]},{"id":"s7-1","section":7,"module":"line2","title":"空间交线：先消元，可能直接降成平面题","html":"<p>H12、H13均是两个球面的交线。方程相减得到<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>为常数，所以<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dz=0</annotation></semantics></math>；剩余为水平圆。H13里的<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|y-x|</annotation></semantics></math>可用三角参数分段，或利用中心对称检查整项，不能直接把绝对值去掉。</p>","exerciseIds":["E6","H12","H13"]},{"id":"s7-2","section":7,"module":"line2","title":"沿曲线先代入恒等式，再考虑用定理","html":"<p>E例6中<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4x^2+y^2=1</annotation></semantics></math>，故原积分分解为 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\oint_L(-y\\,dx+x\\,dy)+\\oint_Lz\\,dz.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 第二项为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oint_Ld(z^2/2)=0</annotation></semantics></math>。取<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=\\tfrac12\\cos t,y=\\sin t</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le t\\le2\\pi</annotation></semantics></math>： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n-yx'+xy'=\\frac12\\sin^2t+\\frac12\\cos^2t=\\frac12,\n\\qquad I=\\pi.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 不必对原来含分母的表达式硬用斯托克斯。</p>","exerciseIds":["E6","H12","H13"]},{"id":"s7-3","section":7,"module":"line2","title":"常见全微分直接拆出","html":"<p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nxdx+ydy=d\\!\\left(\\frac{x^2+y^2}{2}\\right),\\qquad\nz\\,dz=d(z^2/2),\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n3x^2y\\,dx+x^3dy=d(x^3y),\\qquad\n yz\\,dx+zx\\,dy+xy\\,dz=d(xyz).\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 闭曲线上这些项为零，开放曲线上等于终点值减起点值。H14以后也常用这一招。</p>\n<p><strong>曲线两类积分互化：</strong>若已知切向量<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x',y')</annotation></semantics></math>，先除以<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{x'^2+y'^2}</annotation></semantics></math>得到方向余弦；切向方向必须与题目行进方向一致。</p>","exerciseIds":["H11","H12","H15","E6"]},{"id":"s8-0","section":8,"module":"green","title":"闭曲线直接格林：先求Q_x-P_y","html":"<p>只要差变成常数、低次多项式或径向函数，通常比边界逐段算快。若等于1，积分就是有向面积；若等于<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math>，就是<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math>乘面积。</p>","exerciseIds":["E7","H10","H12","H14","H15"]},{"id":"s8-1","section":8,"module":"green","title":"开放曲线补线：必须把“减去辅助段”写出来","html":"<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L:A\\to B</annotation></semantics></math>，补<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_0:B\\to A</annotation></semantics></math>；若<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L+L_0</annotation></semantics></math>为正向，则 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\int_LPdx+Qdy=\\iint_D(Q_x-P_y)\\,dxdy-\\int_{L_0}Pdx+Qdy.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 优先补坐标轴、水平线、竖直线，使<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx=0</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dy=0</annotation></semantics></math>或系数消失。B例7补<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math>轴；H15补<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math>轴。闭合方向若为负向，面积积分整体变号。</p>\n<p><strong>H15的两种值得掌握的方法</strong></p>\n<p>原式<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3x^2y\\,dx+(x^3+x-2y)\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math>可拆为 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nd(x^3y-y^2)+x\\,dy.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 终点<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,2)</annotation></semantics></math>减起点<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0)</annotation></semantics></math>给出<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-4</annotation></semantics></math>，剩余<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_Lx\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math>可用补线求面积。等价地，原式直接求得<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x-P_y=1</annotation></semantics></math>，补线积分为4，因此同样是“所围面积<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-4</annotation></semantics></math>”。</p>","exerciseIds":["B7","H10","H15"]},{"id":"s8-2","section":8,"module":"green","title":"积分比较：比较“带符号的区域收益”，不能只比面积","html":"<p>H14四条边界的格林被积函数为 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nQ_x-P_y=1-x^2-\\frac{y^2}{2}.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 它在<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2/2&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math>内为正，在外部为负。H14的<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_4:2x^2+y^2=2</annotation></semantics></math>恰为零值边界，围出的区域包含全部正贡献且不含负贡献，因此<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_4</annotation></semantics></math>最大。无需四个积分逐一计算。</p>","exerciseIds":["H14"]},{"id":"s8-3","section":8,"module":"green","title":"等式与不等式：对称换元后取平均","html":"<p>E例7经格林变成两个二重积分。正方形区域交换<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y</annotation></semantics></math>不变，先证两式相等；将两式相加除以2，再用 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\ne^t+e^{-t}\\ge2\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 得到下界<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\pi^2</annotation></semantics></math>。不需要求<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int e^{\\sin x}dx</annotation></semantics></math>的原函数。</p>","exerciseIds":["E7"]},{"id":"s9-0","section":9,"module":"green","title":"平面挖洞：把难边界换成包住同一奇点的简单边界","html":"<p>设<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x-P_y=0</annotation></semantics></math>在两条逆时针曲线<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L,C</annotation></semantics></math>之间成立。对去掉小洞后的区域用格林，其正向边界是<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L-C</annotation></semantics></math>，所以 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>C</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\oint_LPdx+Qdy-\\oint_CPdx+Qdy=0.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 因此外圈积分等于小圈积分，<strong>不是等于零</strong>。</p>\n<p>B例8：<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=-y/(4x^2+y^2),Q=x/(4x^2+y^2)</annotation></semantics></math>。原圆包住原点，选足够小的椭圆<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>ε</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4x^2+y^2=\\varepsilon^2</annotation></semantics></math>，取 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>ε</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ε</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nx=\\frac\\varepsilon2\\cos t,\\quad y=\\varepsilon\\sin t.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 分子<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>ε</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xdy-ydx=\\varepsilon^2dt/2</annotation></semantics></math>，分母为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>ε</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon^2</annotation></semantics></math>，因此 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\oint_L\\frac{xdy-ydx}{4x^2+y^2}=\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\frac12dt=\\pi.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 若奇点不在内部且整个区域光滑，才可直接得零；奇点落在路径上需另查定义/收敛性。</p>","exerciseIds":["B8"]},{"id":"s10-0","section":10,"module":"path","title":"求参数：对偏导相等进行恒等比较","html":"<p>B例9的<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=x/(x^2+y^2-1)</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=-ay/(x^2+y^2-1)</annotation></semantics></math>。在单位圆内部无分母为零点： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nP_y=\\frac{-2xy}{(x^2+y^2-1)^2},\\qquad\nQ_x=\\frac{2axy}{(x^2+y^2-1)^2}.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 要在整个区域恒等，必须<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=-1</annotation></semantics></math>。不是只把某一个点代入。</p>","exerciseIds":["B9"]},{"id":"s10-1","section":10,"module":"path","title":"求原函数：先对一个变量积分，再补“另一变量的函数”","html":"<p>B例11中<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=y/x+x^2</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=\\ln x-2y</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>。先积<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math>： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nu=y\\ln x+\\frac{x^3}{3}+\\phi(y).\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 再令<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>ϕ</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_y=\\ln x+\\phi'(y)=Q</annotation></semantics></math>，得<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>ϕ</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi'=-2y</annotation></semantics></math>，从而 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nu=y\\ln x+\\frac{x^3}{3}-y^2+C.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <strong>易错：</strong>不能一开始只加常数<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math>；积分<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math>时未定部分可以是任意<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math>的函数。</p>","exerciseIds":["B11","H17"]},{"id":"s10-2","section":10,"module":"path","title":"三种实际方法怎样选","html":"<ul><li>凑微分：能看出乘积求导结构时最快。</li><li>积分法：先积<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math>补<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(y)</annotation></semantics></math>，最稳定。</li><li>折线法：坐标轴/水平竖直线让系数明显变简时更方便；折线必须始终在允许区域内。</li></ul>\nH17可凑出<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=x^2y^3-y^2\\sin x+y</annotation></semantics></math>，故积分为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u(\\pi/2,1)-u(0,0)=\\pi^2/4</annotation></semantics></math>。","exerciseIds":["B11","H17"]},{"id":"s10-3","section":10,"module":"path","title":"已知一个偏导和边界值：先恢复函数，再端点作差","html":"<p>B例10由<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_x=(2x+1)e^{2x-y}</annotation></semantics></math>得<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f=xe^{2x-y}+\\phi(y)</annotation></semantics></math>。用<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(0,y)=y+1</annotation></semantics></math>确定<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi=y+1</annotation></semantics></math>，所以<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I(t)=e^{2-t}+t</annotation></semantics></math>。求导<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>I</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I'=1-e^{2-t}</annotation></semantics></math>，在<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=2</annotation></semantics></math>取最小值3。</p>","exerciseIds":["B10"]},{"id":"s11-0","section":11,"module":"path","title":"未知函数进入系数：偏导相等产生微分方程","html":"<p>H18中 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nP=[xe^{2x}-6f(x)]\\sin y,\\qquad Q=[f'(x)-5f(x)]\\cos y.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 由<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_y=Q_x</annotation></semantics></math>，比较<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos y</annotation></semantics></math>的系数： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>f</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>f</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nxe^{2x}-6f=f''-5f',\\qquad f''-5f'+6f=xe^{2x}.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 齐次方程特征根为2、3。为避免重复繁算，设<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f=e^{2x}v</annotation></semantics></math>，代入后得到<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>v</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v''-v'=x</annotation></semantics></math>。取多项式特解<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_p=-x^2/2-x</annotation></semantics></math>，故 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nf=C_1e^{2x}+C_2e^{3x}-e^{2x}(x^2/2+x).\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(0)=0</annotation></semantics></math>给<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_1+C_2=0</annotation></semantics></math>；<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f'(0)=-1</annotation></semantics></math>给<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2C_1+3C_2-1=-1</annotation></semantics></math>，因此<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_1=C_2=0</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>","exerciseIds":["H18"]},{"id":"s11-1","section":11,"module":"path","title":"所有包围原点的闭曲线积分相同：拼接相减","html":"<p>E例8先给右半平面内的闭曲线接上同一条绕原点的辅助弧，构造两条包围原点的闭曲线。两积分相等，相减后公共弧抵消，得到右半平面内闭曲线积分为零，才可推出<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_y=Q_x</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>\n<p>令<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D=2x^2+y^4</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=\\phi(y)/D</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=2xy/D</annotation></semantics></math>，计算得 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>ϕ</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mi>D</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nP_y=\\frac{\\phi'D-4y^3\\phi}{D^2},\\qquad\nQ_x=\\frac{-4x^2y+2y^5}{D^2}.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 比较<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2</annotation></semantics></math>系数：<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>ϕ</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\phi'=-4y</annotation></semantics></math>，故<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi=-y^2+C</annotation></semantics></math>；再比较其余项，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C=0</annotation></semantics></math>。所以<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(y)=-y^2</annotation></semantics></math>。比较系数依赖于等式对任意<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>成立。</p>","exerciseIds":["E8"]},{"id":"s11-2","section":11,"module":"path","title":"齐次条件：对缩放参数求导","html":"<p>H16给<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(tx,ty)=t^{-2}f(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math>。两边对<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math>求导并令<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=1</annotation></semantics></math>： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nxf_x+yf_y=-2f.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 对<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=yf,Q=-xf</annotation></semantics></math>有<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x-P_y=-2f-xf_x-yf_y=0</annotation></semantics></math>。上半平面无孔、满足光滑条件，格林立即给闭曲线积分为零。</p>","exerciseIds":["H16"]},{"id":"s11-3","section":11,"module":"path","title":"外法向导数积分：由法向转切向，再格林","html":"<p>逆时针边界上外法向满足<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_xds=dy,n_yds=-dx</annotation></semantics></math>，故 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\oint_L\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial n}ds\n=\\oint_Lf_xdy-f_ydx=\\iint_D(f_{xx}+f_{yy})\\,dxdy.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> E例9中<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f=(x-2)^2+y^2</annotation></semantics></math>，两二阶偏导之和为4，单位圆盘上结果<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\pi</annotation></semantics></math>。这里要求相应二阶偏导连续。</p>","exerciseIds":["E9"]},{"id":"s12-0","section":12,"module":"surface1","title":"平面片：面积因子为常数","html":"<p>若<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=c-ax-by</annotation></semantics></math>，则<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS=\\sqrt{1+a^2+b^2}\\,dxdy</annotation></semantics></math>。H19中<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=1-x-y</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math>，投影为三角形<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x+y\\le1</annotation></semantics></math>： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msubsup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\iint_\\Sigma y^2dS=\\sqrt3\\int_0^1\\int_0^{1-y}y^2\\,dxdy=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{12}.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>","exerciseIds":["H19","E18"]},{"id":"s12-1","section":12,"module":"surface1","title":"圆锥面：先消元确定投影","html":"<p>E例10：<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}</annotation></semantics></math>，截界<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z^2=2x</annotation></semantics></math>。消去<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>得到<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2=2x</annotation></semantics></math>，投影区域为偏心圆盘 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nD:\\ x^2+y^2\\le2x,\\qquad -\\pi/2\\le\\theta\\le\\pi/2,\\quad0\\le r\\le2\\cos\\theta.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 锥面上<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS=\\sqrt2\\,dxdy</annotation></semantics></math>（顶点处按极限处理），密度<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9\\sqrt{x^2+y^2+z^2}=9\\sqrt2r</annotation></semantics></math>，所以 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></msubsup><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>64.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nM=18\\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}\\int_0^{2\\cos\\theta}r^2\\,drd\\theta=64.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>","exerciseIds":["E10","H22"]},{"id":"s12-2","section":12,"module":"surface1","title":"柱面不适合投到xOy：换投影或直接参数化","html":"<p>H21单位圆柱侧面取<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=\\cos\\theta,y=\\sin\\theta,z=z</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le z\\le1</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le\\theta\\le2\\pi</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS=d\\theta dz</annotation></semantics></math>： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\iint_\\Sigma\\frac{dS}{x^2+y^2+z^2}\n=2\\pi\\int_0^1\\frac{dz}{1+z^2}=\\frac{\\pi^2}{2}.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 柱面在<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xOy</annotation></semantics></math>上的投影是一条圆周，不能把它当普通二维区域套<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=g(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math>公式。</p>","exerciseIds":["H21"]},{"id":"s12-3","section":12,"module":"surface1","title":"球面优先对称","html":"<p>完整半径<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math>的球面上，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∬</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint x^2dS=\\frac13R^2\\cdot4\\pi R^2=4\\pi R^4/3</annotation></semantics></math>。第一卦限球面三角形上的偶函数积分可取全球的八分之一。</p>","exerciseIds":["H20","H34"]},{"id":"s12-4","section":12,"module":"surface1","title":"方向导数最大值反求参数，再求面积","html":"<p>H23中最大方向为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-3,-4)</annotation></semantics></math>，先单位化为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-3/5,-4/5)</annotation></semantics></math>，梯度长度为10，故<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(6a,8b)=(-6,-8)</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=b=-1</annotation></semantics></math>。再对<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=2-x^2-y^2\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math>投影求面积。</p>","exerciseIds":["H23"]},{"id":"s13","section":13,"module":"surface1","title":"隐函数曲面：几何条件与根式抵消","html":"<p><strong>定位：E例11，p.22—25。这是一道值得整题复盘的综合题。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>主线：切平面条件 → 轨迹 → 投影域 → 隐函数面积元。</strong></p>\n<p>设<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F=x^2+y^2+z^2-yz-1</annotation></semantics></math>，曲面法向量为 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n(F_x,F_y,F_z)=(2x,2y-z,2z-y).\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 切平面与<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xOy</annotation></semantics></math>面垂直，意味着两平面的法向量垂直，因此<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_z=2z-y=0</annotation></semantics></math>。代回曲面得轨迹 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nz=y/2,\\qquad x^2+3y^2/4=1.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 上方曲面为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\ge y/2</annotation></semantics></math>那一支，投影为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D:x^2+3y^2/4\\le1</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>\n<p><strong>不用先解复杂根式，直接隐函数求导：</strong> <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mrow><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></msqrt><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nz_x=-\\frac{F_x}{F_z},\\qquad z_y=-\\frac{F_y}{F_z},\\qquad\n dS=\\frac{\\sqrt{F_x^2+F_y^2+F_z^2}}{|F_z|}\\,dxdy.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 这里 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nF_x^2+F_y^2+F_z^2=4x^2+5y^2+5z^2-8yz.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 利用曲面关系<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4x^2+4y^2+4z^2-4yz=4</annotation></semantics></math>，化为 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nF_x^2+F_y^2+F_z^2=4+y^2+z^2-4yz.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 恰与原题分母相抵： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nI=\\iint_D(x+\\sqrt3)\\,dxdy.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math>项由对称性为零；椭圆半轴为1与<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2/\\sqrt3</annotation></semantics></math>，所以 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>⋅</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nI=\\sqrt3\\cdot\\pi\\cdot1\\cdot\\frac2{\\sqrt3}=2\\pi.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <strong>为什么这个方法高效：</strong>原题中的<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|y-2z|</annotation></semantics></math>和根式，正是在提示面积投影因子<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|F_z|/|\\nabla F|</annotation></semantics></math>。先识别这个结构，可避免显式解<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>后反复求导。</p>\n<p><strong>边界条件：</strong><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_z=0</annotation></semantics></math>恰出现在投影边界，不能说整个闭域上都能直接除以它；在内部推导，最后按极限延伸。原积分的几何对象与化简后的积分仍有正常意义。</p>","exerciseIds":["E11"]},{"id":"s14-0","section":14,"module":"surface2","title":"单项投影：先找这一项对应的法向分量","html":"<p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nRdxdy=Rn_z\\,dS.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 对于<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=g(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math>，上侧转成<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+Rdxdy</annotation></semantics></math>，下侧转成<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-Rdxdy</annotation></semantics></math>。不再额外乘<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{1+g_x^2+g_y^2}</annotation></semantics></math>。H24先用曲面方程将<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{4-x^2-4z^2}</annotation></semantics></math>化为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|y|</annotation></semantics></math>，不是<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>","exerciseIds":["H24","H25"]},{"id":"s14-1","section":14,"module":"surface2","title":"多项合一投影：全部统一到同一平面","html":"<p>上侧<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-g_x,-g_y,1)</annotation></semantics></math>给出 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>Q</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\iint_\\Sigma Pdy dz+Qdz dx+Rdx dy=\\iint_D(-Pg_x-Qg_y+R)\\,dxdy.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 下侧使用<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(g_x,g_y,-1)</annotation></semantics></math>，即<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_D(Pg_x+Qg_y-R)dxdy</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>\n<p>若<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=h(y,z)</annotation></semantics></math>且取<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_x&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>一侧，则改为 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>Q</mi><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>R</mi><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\iint_D(P-Qh_y-Rh_z)\\,dydz.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 不必死记“前后左右”名称，直接检查法向分量正负最稳。</p>","exerciseIds":["B13","B14","E12","E13","E14","H26","H27","H31"]},{"id":"s14-2","section":14,"module":"surface2","title":"抽象函数先消去：不一定需要可导","html":"<p>B例14的平面<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x-y+z=1</annotation></semantics></math>，上侧法向量<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,-1,1)</annotation></semantics></math>。抽象函数系数向量为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(f,2f,f)</annotation></semantics></math>，点乘为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f-2f+f=0</annotation></semantics></math>。剩下<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x-y+z=1</annotation></semantics></math>，故通量化为投影面积。</p>\n<p>E例13锥面下侧法向量可取<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x/z,y/z,-1)</annotation></semantics></math>，抽象部分为 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nf(xy)\\left(\\frac{x^2+y^2}{z}-z\\right)=0.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 因为锥面上<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2=z^2</annotation></semantics></math>。只需连续，不必求<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f'</annotation></semantics></math>。该例题干与解式不同，详见核对提醒。</p>","exerciseIds":["B14","E13"]},{"id":"s14-3","section":14,"module":"surface2","title":"有绝对值又有对称：必须先合并完整被积函数","html":"<p>E例14取抛物面下侧，合一投影后得到 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n2x|x|y^2z+2xy^4z-|y|xz^2,qquad z=x^2+y^2.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 三项均关于<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math>为奇函数，投影是单位圆盘，所以积分为0。不能在投影之前只凭<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|x|</annotation></semantics></math>或<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y^3</annotation></semantics></math>的奇偶性判断。</p>","exerciseIds":["E14","H24","H25"]},{"id":"s15-0","section":15,"module":"gauss","title":"封闭外侧：先算散度，再选体积分次序","html":"<p>E例15球心为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(a,b,c)</annotation></semantics></math>，半径<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math>，散度为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2(x+y+z)</annotation></semantics></math>。均匀球体形心在球心： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\iiint_\\Omega x\\,dv=aV,\\quad\\iiint_\\Omega y\\,dv=bV,\\quad\\iiint_\\Omega z\\,dv=cV.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 故<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=2(a+b+c)V=8\\pi r^3(a+b+c)/3</annotation></semantics></math>。这是<strong>先高斯、再用形心</strong>，无需展开球坐标。</p>","exerciseIds":["E15","H28"]},{"id":"s15-1","section":15,"module":"gauss","title":"开放曲面补面：先统一为封闭外侧","html":"<p>若原面<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math>就是外侧，补面<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma_0</annotation></semantics></math>也取外侧，则 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nI_\\Sigma=\\iiint_\\Omega\\operatorname{div}\\boldsymbol F\\,dv-I_{\\Sigma_0}.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 若原面是内侧，则 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nI_\\Sigma=I_{\\Sigma_0}-\\iiint_\\Omega\\operatorname{div}\\boldsymbol F\\,dv.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <strong>操作顺序：</strong>画出被围体积 → 标出立体外侧 → 比较原方向 → 列上述关系 → 分别算体积项和补面项。</p>","exerciseIds":["B15","H29","H30","H31"]},{"id":"s15-2","section":15,"module":"gauss","title":"先判断补面是否自动为零","html":"<p>水平补面<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=c</annotation></semantics></math>上<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dy dz=dz dx=0</annotation></semantics></math>，仅剩<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Rdxdy</annotation></semantics></math>；若<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math>也为零则补面零。竖直坐标面同理。<strong>补面是平面不等于补面积分为零。</strong></p>\n<p>H29补<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0</annotation></semantics></math>的圆盘，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=x</annotation></semantics></math>令补面零。H30补<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=0</annotation></semantics></math>的椭圆盘，留下<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3xy</annotation></semantics></math>项，经对称性为零。</p>","exerciseIds":["H29","H30"]},{"id":"s15-3","section":15,"module":"gauss","title":"先重后单常比直接三重积分省","html":"<p>H30对固定<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>截面<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_z:x^2+y^2/4\\le1-z</annotation></semantics></math>，面积<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\pi(1-z)</annotation></semantics></math>；散度为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3z</annotation></semantics></math>，所以体积分为 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\int_0^1 3z\\cdot2\\pi(1-z)\\,dz=\\pi.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>","exerciseIds":["E15","H29","H30"]},{"id":"s15-4","section":15,"module":"gauss","title":"球面分母先化为常数，再选择光滑场","html":"<p>B例15分母在原半球面上恒为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math>。可先用曲面条件换成无奇点的多项式场再补面；不要把原来在原点无定义的场不加检查地延伸到整个半球体。曲面上等价的表达式可用于该曲面的积分，但补面和散度必须始终使用同一个选定场。</p>","exerciseIds":["B15"]},{"id":"s9-1","section":9,"module":"gauss","title":"空间挖球：散度为零也可有非零通量","html":"<p>B例16的场为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol F=(x,y,z)/(x^2+y^2+z^2)^{3/2}</annotation></semantics></math>，原点外散度为零。挖掉半径<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math>的小球： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>ε</mi></msub></msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">n</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\iint_\\Sigma\\boldsymbol F\\cdot\\boldsymbol n\\,dS\n=\\iint_{S_\\varepsilon}\\boldsymbol F\\cdot\\boldsymbol n_{\\rm out}\\,dS.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 球面上<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">n</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol n_{\\rm out}=(x,y,z)/\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math>，故点乘为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>ε</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\varepsilon^2</annotation></semantics></math>，乘面积<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>ε</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\pi\\varepsilon^2</annotation></semantics></math>得到<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\pi</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>\n<p><strong>记忆条件：</strong>“<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\pi</annotation></semantics></math>”针对这个特定场、闭曲面包住原点一次、外侧且不穿过奇点的情形。改变方向变号；不包住原点则为零。</p>\n<p><strong>本质：</strong>定理可以在删掉奇点后的正常区域用；奇点的贡献通过新增加的内边界保留下来。不能把奇点偷偷忽略。</p>","exerciseIds":["B16","B13"]},{"id":"s16-0","section":16,"module":"stokes","title":"平面与曲面的交线：优先选平面片","html":"<p>同一条边界可以张成很多曲面，选择使法向量恒定、投影域简单的面。若<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=g(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math>上侧，设旋度为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(A,B,C)</annotation></semantics></math>，则 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\oint_LPdx+Qdy+Rdz=\\iint_D(-Ag_x-Bg_y+C)\\,dxdy.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <strong>B例18完整演示</strong></p>\n<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L:x^2+y^2=1,z=x+y</annotation></semantics></math>，从上往下看逆时针。选<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=x+y</annotation></semantics></math>上的圆盘形平面片，上侧法向量<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-1,-1,1)</annotation></semantics></math>。<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=xz,Q=x,R=y^2/2</annotation></semantics></math>，故 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n(A,B,C)=(y,x,1).\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 因此 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nI=\\iint_{x^2+y^2\\le1}(1-x-y)\\,dxdy=\\pi.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <strong>备选法：</strong>直接取<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=\\cos t,y=\\sin t,z=\\cos t+\\sin t</annotation></semantics></math>也能算；本题旋度简单，因此斯托克斯更短。</p>","exerciseIds":["B18","E17","H33"]},{"id":"s16-1","section":16,"module":"stokes","title":"开放空间曲线：补线后用斯托克斯","html":"<p>E例17补<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B\\to A</annotation></semantics></math>的直线段<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=z=0</annotation></semantics></math>。该段积分为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></msubsup><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_{-\\sqrt2}^{\\sqrt2}y\\,dy=0</annotation></semantics></math>。闭合边界位于平面<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=x</annotation></semantics></math>，与给定走向匹配的法向是<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,0,-1)</annotation></semantics></math>，即<strong>下侧</strong>。本题不能机械套“看起来是上半球，所以取上侧”。</p>","exerciseIds":["E17"]},{"id":"s16-2","section":16,"module":"stokes","title":"边界不在一个平面：可选原曲面片","html":"<p>H32为上半球与偏心柱面的交线，可选上半球被柱面截下的面片，投影<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D:x^2+y^2\\le2y</annotation></semantics></math>。求旋度后合一投影；若<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>在投影边界趋于零导致导数发散，按分片/极限处理，最终检查可积性。</p>","exerciseIds":["H32"]},{"id":"s16-3","section":16,"module":"stokes","title":"菱形、矩形边界：投影＋奇偶性","html":"<p>H33平面<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x+y+z=2</annotation></semantics></math>与<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|x|+|y|=1</annotation></semantics></math>相交。选上侧<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,1,1)</annotation></semantics></math>，旋度为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-2y-4z,-2z-6x,-2x-2y)</annotation></semantics></math>，合并并代<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=2-x-y</annotation></semantics></math>后为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-2x+2y-12</annotation></semantics></math>。菱形面积2，奇项为零，结果<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-24</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>","exerciseIds":["H33"]},{"id":"s17-0","section":17,"module":"applications","title":"面壳重心：分子分母分开检查奇偶性","html":"<p>E例18面<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|x|+|y|+|z|=1</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho=|x|+|z|+z/3</annotation></semantics></math>。<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar x=\\bar y=0</annotation></semantics></math>，但<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar z</annotation></semantics></math>一般不为零，因为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\rho</annotation></semantics></math>中有<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z^2/3</annotation></semantics></math>偶项。</p>\n<p>在第一卦限<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=1-x-y</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS=\\sqrt3dxdy</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D:x,y\\ge0,x+y\\le1</annotation></semantics></math>： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\iint_D x\\,dxdy=\\frac16,\\qquad\\iint_Dz\\,dxdy=\\frac16,\\qquad\n\\iint_Dz^2\\,dxdy=\\frac1{12}.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 于是<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M=8\\sqrt3/3</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>S</mi></msub><mi>z</mi><mi>ρ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_Sz\\rho\\,dS=(1/3)\\cdot8\\sqrt3/12=2\\sqrt3/9</annotation></semantics></math>，所以<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar z=1/12</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>","exerciseIds":["E18","B12","E10","H34"]},{"id":"s17-1","section":17,"module":"applications","title":"立体截面法：不必逐点做三重积分","html":"<p>若每一水平截面的面积为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(z)</annotation></semantics></math>，截面形心为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x_c(z),y_c(z))</annotation></semantics></math>，均匀立体有 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><mi>V</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><mi>V</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nV=\\int A(z)dz,\\quad\n\\bar y=\\frac{\\int y_c(z)A(z)dz}{V},\\quad\n\\bar z=\\frac{\\int zA(z)dz}{V}.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> H36的截面圆盘中心<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,z)</annotation></semantics></math>，半径<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-z</annotation></semantics></math>，故<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(z)=\\pi(1-z)^2</annotation></semantics></math>；<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V=\\pi/3</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>z</mi><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_0^1zA(z)dz=\\pi/12</annotation></semantics></math>，形心<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,1/4,1/4)</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>","exerciseIds":["H35","H36"]},{"id":"s17-2","section":17,"module":"applications","title":"旋转曲面围成立体：先找每个高度的半径","html":"<p>H37直线可写成<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=1-z,y=z</annotation></semantics></math>。绕<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>轴旋转后<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^2=(1-z)^2+z^2</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le z\\le2</annotation></semantics></math>。由旋转对称<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar x=\\bar y=0</annotation></semantics></math>； <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\bar z=\\frac{\\int_0^2z[(1-z)^2+z^2]dz}{\\int_0^2[(1-z)^2+z^2]dz}=\\frac75.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>","exerciseIds":["H37"]},{"id":"s18-0","section":18,"module":"applications","title":"大小＋方向：先单位化，再乘大小","html":"<p>E例19中吸引点<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math>，运动点<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M=(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=\\sqrt{x^2+(y-1)^2}</annotation></semantics></math>。从<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math>指向<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math>的单位向量为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-x,1-y)/r</annotation></semantics></math>，故 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\boldsymbol F=\\frac{k}{r^3}(-x,1-y).\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 不能写成<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k(-x,1-y)/r^2</annotation></semantics></math>，那样向量的长度不再是<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k/r^2</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>","exerciseIds":["B6","E19"]},{"id":"s18-1","section":18,"module":"applications","title":"保守力做功：凑出原函数只算端点","html":"<p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nd\\!\\left(\\frac{k}{r}\\right)\n=\\frac{-kx}{r^3}dx+\\frac{k(1-y)}{r^3}dy.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 因此从<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(2,0)</annotation></semantics></math>到<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(0,0)</annotation></semantics></math>的功 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>O</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nW=\\frac{k}{r_O}-\\frac{k}{r_B}=k\\left(1-\\frac1{\\sqrt5}\\right).\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 路径不经过引力中心<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math>；若经过奇点，不能原样套用。原函数在避开<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math>的区域有定义即可，不必为了算端点再参数化半圆。</p>","exerciseIds":["E19","H38"]},{"id":"s18-2","section":18,"module":"applications","title":"切向力或垂直径向的力：坐标分量按方向确定","html":"<p>B例6的力大小为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|OP|</annotation></semantics></math>且垂直<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OP</annotation></semantics></math>，候选分量为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-y,x)</annotation></semantics></math>或<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(y,-x)</annotation></semantics></math>。必须用题给夹角/箭头选符号，再写<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W=\\int Pdx+Qdy</annotation></semantics></math>。仅知道“垂直”不足以唯一确定方向。</p>","exerciseIds":["B6"]},{"id":"s18-3","section":18,"module":"applications","title":"做功最值：先把积分问题变成普通约束最值","html":"<p>H38中<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol F=(yz,zx,xy)</annotation></semantics></math>，微分式为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d(xyz)</annotation></semantics></math>，从原点到<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>η</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>ζ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M(\\xi,\\eta,\\zeta)</annotation></semantics></math>的功为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mi>η</mi><mi>ζ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W=\\xi\\eta\\zeta</annotation></semantics></math>。令 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>ξ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>η</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>ζ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nu=\\frac{\\xi^2}{a^2},\\quad v=\\frac{\\eta^2}{b^2},\\quad w=\\frac{\\zeta^2}{c^2},\n\\qquad u+v+w=1.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 第一卦限下<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><msqrt><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W=abc\\sqrt{uvw}</annotation></semantics></math>，由均值不等式<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>w</mi><mo>≤</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">uvw\\le(1/3)^3</annotation></semantics></math>： <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>η</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>ζ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nW_{\\max}=\\frac{abc}{3\\sqrt3},\\qquad\n(\\xi,\\eta,\\zeta)=\\left(\\frac a{\\sqrt3},\\frac b{\\sqrt3},\\frac c{\\sqrt3}\\right).\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 也可用拉格朗日乘数法；本题换成三个非负平方量后用均值不等式更短。</p>","exerciseIds":["H38"]},{"id":"s19","section":19,"module":"review","title":"原资料核对提醒：不要把这些背错","html":"<p><strong>以下是整理过程中已核实的具体问题，并非宣称原文件只有这些错误。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>1．E例13：题干和解式不一致，结果不同。</strong></p>\n<p>p.30题干第一系数为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xf(xy)+2xy-y</annotation></semantics></math>；p.32解式改为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xf(xy)+2x-y</annotation></semantics></math>，手写计算按后者进行。按题干原样，用下侧合一投影并消去<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math>，得到 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi></mrow><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nI=\\iint_{1\\le x^2+y^2\\le4}\\left[\\frac{2x^2y}{r}+\\frac{y^2-x^2}{r}\\right]dxdy=0.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 第一项关于<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math>奇对称，第二项交换<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y</annotation></semantics></math>变号。若改用解式中的<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2x</annotation></semantics></math>，被积函数为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math>，则 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>14</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nI=\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\int_1^2r^2drd\\theta=\\frac{14\\pi}{3}.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> <strong>结论：原题版为0；把<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2xy</annotation></semantics></math>改成<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2x</annotation></semantics></math>的版本为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>14</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">14\\pi/3</annotation></semantics></math>。不能混写。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>2．E例16：仅有<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math>连续可导，不保证原场处处有定义。</strong></p>\n<p>p.37—39有<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R=f(y/z)/y+z^3</annotation></semantics></math>，而所围区域经过<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=0</annotation></semantics></math>。例如<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>≡</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f\\equiv1</annotation></semantics></math>满足连续可导，但<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/y</annotation></semantics></math>在该处无定义，因此不能无条件直接用经典高斯公式。</p>\n<p>在<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y\\ne0</annotation></semantics></math>处确有<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_y+R_z=3y^2+3z^2</annotation></semantics></math>，但<strong>局部代数抵消不能代替全区域适用条件</strong>。若额外说明奇点可消去，并且相应系数延拓后具有连续一阶偏导，才能按讲义路线算得 <span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>93</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nI=\\frac{93\\pi}{5}(2-\\sqrt2).\n</annotation></semantics></math></span> 这只是满足额外正则条件时的结果；题干原条件不足，不能将其作为无条件答案。若另定义广义积分，还须另外检查收敛性。</p>\n<p><strong>3．E例18：体积分模板不能用于面壳重心。</strong></p>\n<p>p.44展示的是体密度的三重积分模板，而本题对象是曲面；p.45实际已经改用曲面积分。p.46还出现积分区域/微元混排。应统一为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>S</mi></msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M=\\iint_S\\rho dS</annotation></semantics></math>及<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>S</mi></msub><mi>z</mi><mi>ρ</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar z=\\iint_Sz\\rho dS/M</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>\n<p><strong>4．H28：投影域的文字式漏掉坐标非负限制。</strong></p>\n<p>p.38的<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D=\\{2x+y\\le2\\}</annotation></semantics></math>必须结合题意补全为<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\ge0,y\\ge0,2x+y\\le2</annotation></semantics></math>，否则不是有限三角形。</p>\n<p><strong>5．E例12：边界上的分母和投影退化要说明。</strong></p>\n<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=(x^2+y^2)/x</annotation></semantics></math>在投影圆盘与<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0</annotation></semantics></math>相切的点按原式无定义，但在曲面参数化/通量组合中可作极限处理；另有<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=0</annotation></semantics></math>处投影导数退化。可按删去邻域后取极限计算，不能声称原系数在整个闭曲面片上光滑。</p>","exerciseIds":["E13","E16","E18","H28"]},{"id":"s20","section":20,"module":"review","title":"考前速查：方向、范围、微元","html":"<p><strong>一、每道题的四行草稿模板</strong> </p><ol><li>对象：第几类积分；曲线/曲面是否封闭；积分对象是否分片。</li><li>范围：参数区间或投影域，写全上下限与非负约束。</li><li>方向：起终点/顺逆时针/法向量；原方向是否等于外侧。</li><li>方法：先写一般公式，再代入本题表达式；最后进行积分。</li></ol>\n<p><strong>二、最容易丢分的12件事</strong> </p><ol><li>第一类积分不随方向变号；第二类反向变号。</li><li>第一类微元有长度/面积因子；第二类投影式不能多乘一次面积因子。</li><li><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds</annotation></semantics></math>中的平方根是非负的，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{h^2}=|h|</annotation></semantics></math>。</li><li>极坐标/柱坐标的雅可比<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math>不能漏；球坐标是<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^2\\sin\\varphi</annotation></semantics></math>。</li><li>投影曲线只是边界，投影区域还要确定内部、不等式和范围。</li><li>补线从终点回起点，补面方向必须和封闭外侧一致。</li><li>下半球上侧、上开口抛物面上侧，常常是立体的内侧。</li><li>使用格林/高斯前，扫一遍分母为零点和不可导处。</li><li>曲线或曲面关于坐标对称，不等于每个被积项都可缩域。</li><li>只有连续的<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math>，不能为了套高斯随意求<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f'</annotation></semantics></math>。</li><li>重心公式中分子和分母使用同一种几何微元。</li><li>求原函数时，对<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math>积分后补<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(y)</annotation></semantics></math>；不要漏未知函数。</li></ol>\n<p><strong>三、三个快速验算</strong> </p><ul><li>非负函数的第一类积分应非负；若算出负值，先查上下限和微元。</li><li>通量题改变侧，结果应整体反号；不能只有某一项换号。</li><li>缩放检查：长度尺度放大<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math>倍，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds</annotation></semantics></math>多<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS</annotation></semantics></math>多<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a^2</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dv</annotation></semantics></math>多<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a^3</annotation></semantics></math>。再乘被积函数的次数，检验最终幂次。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>四、只剩30分钟时复习什么</strong></p>\n<p>先看第02—03节公式和方向；再看第09节奇点、第14—16节投影/高斯/斯托克斯；最后把本页四行模板默写一次。不要在最后时刻硬背大量零散数值答案。</p>","exerciseIds":["B1","B2","B3","B4","B5","B6","B7","B8","B9","B10","B11","B12","B13","B14","B15","B16","B17","B18","B19","E3","E4","E5","E6","E7","E8","E9","E10","E11","E12","E13","E14","E15","E16","E17","E18","E19","H01","H02","H03","H04","H05","H06","H07","H08","H09","H10","H11","H12","H13","H14","H15","H16","H17","H18","H19","H20","H21","H22","H23","H24","H25","H26","H27","H28","H29","H30","H31","H32","H33","H34","H35","H36","H37","H38"]},{"id":"s21","section":21,"module":"review","title":"复盘安排：用“会选法”检验掌握","html":"<p><strong>第一轮：只练识别与列式，不急着算到底。</strong></p>\n<p>每题给自己60—90秒，写出类型、方向、投影/参数、方法和定理条件。建议按下列代表题走一遍；遇到选不出方法的题，回相应方法卡。</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><tr><th>模块</th><th>代表题</th><th>过关标准</th></tr><tr><td>三重积分</td><td>H02、H04、H05</td><td>会用平均值、设常数、截面积</td></tr><tr><td>第一类曲线</td><td>B例1、E例3、E例4</td><td>会先化简、选参数、轮换凑恒等式</td></tr><tr><td>第二类曲线</td><td>E例5、E例6</td><td>会分段、写有向上下限、消全微分</td></tr><tr><td>格林与奇点</td><td>B例7、B例8、H14</td><td>会补线、挖洞、比较正负区域</td></tr><tr><td>路径无关</td><td>B例11、H18、E例8</td><td>会求原函数、建立微分方程、拼接证明</td></tr><tr><td>第一类曲面</td><td>E例10、E例11、H21</td><td>会投影、隐函数面积元、柱面参数</td></tr><tr><td>第二类曲面</td><td>B例14、E例13、H27</td><td>会法向点乘、消抽象项、合一投影</td></tr><tr><td>高斯</td><td>H29、H30、H31</td><td>会补面、识别内外侧、截面法</td></tr><tr><td>斯托克斯</td><td>B例18、E例17、H33</td><td>会选面、补线、核对右手规则</td></tr><tr><td>应用</td><td>E例18、H36、H38</td><td>会区分面/体、用截面形心、做功转最值</td></tr></table></div>\n<p><strong>第二轮：每模块完整做1—2题，强制记录错误类别。</strong></p>\n<p>用四个标签即可：<strong>选法错、条件漏、方向错、计算错</strong>。复盘不能只写“粗心”，要写出下次的具体动作，例如“补面后先画封闭外法线，再列原面关系”。</p>\n<p><strong>第三轮：闭卷回答下面8问。</strong> </p><ol><li>为什么<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_L fds</annotation></semantics></math>不随方向改变，而<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_LPdx</annotation></semantics></math>会变号？</li><li>哪两个条件共同保证奇函数项积分为零？</li><li>为什么<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_y=Q_x</annotation></semantics></math>不总能保证绕原点的积分为零？</li><li>第一类曲面积分的面积因子为何在通量合一投影中消失？</li><li>“上侧”与“外侧”有什么区别？举一个不相同的例子。</li><li>为什么连续抽象函数题应先尝试法向点乘消项？</li><li>斯托克斯为什么可以换面，但不能随意换方向？</li><li>形状对称而密度不对称时，重心为什么未必对称？</li></ol> 判断真正会不会：能独立写出正确的第一行列式，并解释该方法为什么适用。","exerciseIds":["B1","B2","B3","B4","B5","B6","B7","B8","B9","B10","B11","B12","B13","B14","B15","B16","B17","B18","B19","E3","E4","E5","E6","E7","E8","E9","E10","E11","E12","E13","E14","E15","E16","E17","E18","E19","H01","H02","H03","H04","H05","H06","H07","H08","H09","H10","H11","H12","H13","H14","H15","H16","H17","H18","H19","H20","H21","H22","H23","H24","H25","H26","H27","H28","H29","H30","H31","H32","H33","H34","H35","H36","H37","H38"]}],"exercises":[{"id":"B1","source":"B","page":8,"label":"例1｜p.8","title":"椭圆上的多项式与已知周长","method":"先消去xy项，再由椭圆方程凑常数；第06节。","module":"line1","nodeIds":["s6-0","s6-2"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["椭圆的左右对称：配对点的 xy 异号，弧长微元相同；横、纵半轴分别为 2、√3。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>设 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l</annotation></semantics></math> 为椭圆</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{x^2}{4}+\\frac{y^2}{3}=1,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其周长为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math>，求</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\oint_l(2xy+3x^2+4y^2)\\,ds.</annotation></semantics></math></span>","solutionHtml":"<h4>第一步：辨认积分类型，寻找不用求椭圆弧长的办法</h4><p>这是第一类曲线积分，微元为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds</annotation></semantics></math>。题目已经给出椭圆周长 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math>，通常是在提示我们：先设法把被积函数变成常数，再利用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>l</mi></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oint_l ds=a</annotation></semantics></math>。如果一开始就设椭圆的三角参数，会出现较复杂的弧长根式，反而掩盖题目结构。</p><h4>第二步：说明为什么混合项的积分为零</h4><p>椭圆关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 轴对称。把弧上的点 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math> 与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-x,y)</annotation></semantics></math> 配对，两点附近的小弧长相等，而混合项的取值相反：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2(-x)y=-2xy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因此它们对积分的贡献成对抵消，即</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>l</mi></msub><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oint_l2xy\\,ds=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>这里必须同时满足“积分弧段关于反射对称”和“弧长微元保持不变”，不能只看到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xy</annotation></semantics></math> 就孤立地说其积分为零。</p><h4>第三步：把剩余二次项凑成常数</h4><p>椭圆方程为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{x^2}{4}+\\frac{y^2}{3}=1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>两边乘以 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12</annotation></semantics></math>，得到沿整条椭圆都成立的恒等式</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>12.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3x^2+4y^2=12.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>于是</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\oint_l(3x^2+4y^2)\\,ds</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>l</mi></msub><mn>12</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>l</mi></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\oint_l12\\,ds=12\\oint_l ds=12a.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>结论与易错点</h4><p>所求积分为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12a</annotation></semantics></math>。本题的关键组合是“对称消项＋曲线方程凑常数”。不能把 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2=4</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y^2=3</annotation></semantics></math> 分别代入：椭圆方程只说明它们满足一个整体关系，不说明每个点都同时达到两个轴上的极值。也不能把 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math> 误当作椭圆半轴；本题明确把它定义为周长。第一类积分没有指定行进方向，反向走一圈也不变。</p><h4>特别辨别：这题不能把 x² 与 y² 的积分当作相等</h4><p>椭圆的两个半轴分别为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math> 和 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt3</annotation></semantics></math>，交换 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 后曲线方程会改变，所以它没有“交换两坐标的轮换对称”。若记</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>l</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>l</mi></msub><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=\\oint_lx^2\\,ds,\\qquad B=\\oint_ly^2\\,ds,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>本题能确定的是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3A+4B=12a</annotation></semantics></math>，不是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=B</annotation></semantics></math>。恰好题目的系数就是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math> 与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math>，因此无需单独求出 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math> 或 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math>。这能帮助你区分两类常用技巧：坐标轴反射对称用于消去奇项；坐标交换对称才能说明不同平方项的积分相等。</p>","figureImages":["assets/2e73f73d48f6169311.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/8972cbc3c60d962d6e.webp"]},{"id":"B2","source":"B","page":9,"label":"例2｜p.9","title":"抛物线弧上的第一类积分","method":"选y为参数，ds取正，负支不要误换成正支；第05节。","module":"line1","nodeIds":["s5-0"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["原题取抛物线下支 A(0,0) 到 B(1,−1)。第一类积分的 ds 始终为正，选 y 为参数时积分可改按 −1≤y≤0 排列。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>求 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_L y\\,ds</annotation></semantics></math>。其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 为抛物线 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y^2=x</annotation></semantics></math> 上连接 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(0,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(1,-1)</annotation></semantics></math> 的曲线弧。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>第一步：确认弧段在负支，并选择方便的参数</h4><p>由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y^2=x</annotation></semantics></math> 可知这是一条以 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 为自变量更方便的抛物线。题目端点 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(1,-1)</annotation></semantics></math> 在负支上，连接 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(0,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 的这一段满足 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y\\le0</annotation></semantics></math>。为了让参数从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math> 增加到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math>，令</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=t^2,\\qquad y=-t,\\qquad0\\le t\\le1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>当 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=0</annotation></semantics></math> 时到达 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math>，当 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=1</annotation></semantics></math> 时到达 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math>，所以参数范围与题目弧段完全对应。</p><h4>第二步：单独求弧长微元</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{dx}{dt}=2t,\\qquad\\frac{dy}{dt}=-1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>第一类曲线积分中的微元为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds=\\sqrt{\\left(\\frac{dx}{dt}\\right)^2+\\left(\\frac{dy}{dt}\\right)^2}\\,dt</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\sqrt{4t^2+1}\\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>注意：微元里的负号需要先平方，不能因为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 递减就给 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds</annotation></semantics></math> 加负号。</p><h4>第三步：代入并把换元的系数算清楚</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_0^1(-t)\\sqrt{1+4t^2}\\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=1+4t^2</annotation></semantics></math>，则 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">du=8t\\,dt</annotation></semantics></math>。上下限随之变为：<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=0</annotation></semantics></math> 时 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=1</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=1</annotation></semantics></math> 时 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=5</annotation></semantics></math>。所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=-\\frac18\\int_1^5u^{1/2}\\,du</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=-\\frac18\\cdot\\frac23\\left[u^{3/2}\\right]_1^5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=-\\frac1{12}(5\\sqrt5-1)=\\frac{1-5\\sqrt5}{12}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>另一种列式：用图形方程消掉根式</h4><p>也可写 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=-\\sqrt x</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le x\\le1</annotation></semantics></math>。在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> 上，</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds=\\sqrt{1+\\frac1{4x}}\\,dx,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y\\,ds=-\\frac12\\sqrt{1+4x}\\,dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因此 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=-\\frac12\\int_0^1\\sqrt{1+4x}\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math>，同样得到上述结果。端点处 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dy/dx</annotation></semantics></math> 发散，虽然化简后的积分没有问题，但考场上优先用前面的光滑参数更稳妥。</p><h4>检查与易错点</h4><p>整段弧上 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y\\le0</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>，答案必须为负。若得到正数，通常是选成了 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=+\\sqrt x</annotation></semantics></math>，或把弧长微元与有向微分 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dy</annotation></semantics></math> 混淆了。</p>","figureImages":["assets/8c0ee69ca6f031482c.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/d31b22deb85d473d4f.webp"]},{"id":"B3","source":"B","page":11,"label":"例3｜p.11","title":"球与平面交圆的平方项","method":"轮换对称；三平方相加等于1，再用交圆周长；第06节。","module":"line1","nodeIds":["s22-0","s6-1","s6-2"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["单位球与过球心平面的交线是半径 1 的大圆。浅蓝圆盘位于 x+y+z=0 内，法向为 (1,1,1)；曲线积分为第一类，无须选择绕行方向。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>设 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 为球面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2+z^2=1</annotation></semantics></math> 与平面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x+y+z=0</annotation></semantics></math> 的交线，求</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\oint_Lz^2\\,ds.</annotation></semantics></math></span>","solutionHtml":"<h4>第一步：先认清交线的几何形状</h4><p>球面半径为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math>，平面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x+y+z=0</annotation></semantics></math> 经过球心 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0,0)</annotation></semantics></math>。所以交线 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 是半径为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math> 的大圆，长度为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\pi</annotation></semantics></math>。它不是球面面积，也不是三个坐标面中的某一个单位圆。</p><h4>第二步：检查轮换对称能否使用</h4><p>把 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y,z</annotation></semantics></math> 循环交换，两个方程</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2+z^2=1,\\qquad x+y+z=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>仍保持原样。这种坐标交换保持空间距离和小弧长，因此三个积分相等：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oint_Lx^2\\,ds=\\oint_Ly^2\\,ds=\\oint_Lz^2\\,ds=I.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>这里相等的原因是“整条交线具有轮换对称”，而不是只因为被积函数都是平方。</p><h4>第三步：相加后利用球面方程</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3I=\\oint_L(x^2+y^2+z^2)\\,ds</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\oint_L1\\,ds=2\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\frac{2\\pi}{3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>有实际价值的备用方法：用平面内两条垂直方向参数化</h4><p>若交线失去轮换对称，就应回到参数法。这里可选平面内的两个单位方向</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol e_1=\\frac1{\\sqrt2}(1,-1,0),</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">e</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol e_2=\\frac1{\\sqrt6}(1,1,-2).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>它们都满足三个分量之和为零，长度都为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math>，点积为零。因此单位交圆可写成</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">e</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,y,z)=\\boldsymbol e_1\\cos t+\\boldsymbol e_2\\sin t,\\qquad0\\le t\\le2\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>于是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></msqrt><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=-\\sqrt{2/3}\\sin t</annotation></semantics></math>，参数速度长度为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math>，即 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds=dt</annotation></semantics></math>。故</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\frac23\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\sin^2t\\,dt</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\frac23\\cdot\\frac12\\int_0^{2\\pi}(1-\\cos2t)\\,dt=\\frac{2\\pi}{3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>易错点</h4><p>不能直接写 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=\\cos t,y=\\sin t,z=0</annotation></semantics></math>，因为那只描述水平单位圆，并不满足本题的平面约束。考场优先用轮换法，计算短且不易出错；参数法用于对称性不够时兜底。</p>","figureImages":["assets/e2d144285ef4ed679c.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/ce2ba4bd72837e8a10.webp"]},{"id":"B4","source":"B","page":16,"label":"例4｜p.16","title":"抛物线上的第二类积分","method":"x=y²，dx=2y dy；上下限按A到B，跨顶点不必拆支；第07节。","module":"line2","nodeIds":["s2"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["同一抛物线弧跨过顶点：A→O→B。用 y 参数一次写完，y 从 −1 增至 1，dx=2y dy；用 x 参数则必须区分上下两支。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>计算 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_Lxy\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math>。其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 为抛物线 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y^2=x</annotation></semantics></math> 上从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(1,-1)</annotation></semantics></math> 到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(1,1)</annotation></semantics></math> 的一段弧。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>第一步：为什么不能直接以起终点的 x 坐标作上下限</h4><p>这是第二类曲线积分，含有向微分 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx</annotation></semantics></math>。从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(1,-1)</annotation></semantics></math> 沿抛物线走到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(1,1)</annotation></semantics></math>，必须先经过顶点 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(0,0)</annotation></semantics></math>：前半段 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math> 减到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math>，后半段再从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math> 增到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math>。所以整个过程中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 并不单调，不能因为起终点横坐标相同就把积分写成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_1^1</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><h4>第二步：选择沿整段弧单调变化的 y</h4><p>由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=y^2</annotation></semantics></math>，沿指定方向有 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y:-1\\to1</annotation></semantics></math>，且</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx=2y\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>把被积函数与微分同时代入：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xy\\,dx=(y^2)y(2y\\,dy)=2y^4\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>特别注意前半段 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math> 时，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xy&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math>，两个负号相乘仍给出正贡献。</p><h4>第三步：把幂积分完整算出</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=2\\int_{-1}^{1}y^4\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=4\\int_0^1y^4\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=4\\left[\\frac{y^5}{5}\\right]_0^1=\\frac45.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>第二步之后的被积函数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y^4</annotation></semantics></math> 为偶函数，所以这里才可以将区间折半并乘 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><h4>备用方法：坚持用 x 时，必须在顶点分成两支</h4><p>前半段 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A\\to O</annotation></semantics></math> 满足 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=-\\sqrt x</annotation></semantics></math>，后半段 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O\\to B</annotation></semantics></math> 满足 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\sqrt x</annotation></semantics></math>。因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_1^0-x^{3/2}\\,dx+\\int_0^1x^{3/2}\\,dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>把第一项倒换上下限，变为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=2\\int_0^1x^{3/2}\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=2\\left[\\frac25x^{5/2}\\right]_0^1=\\frac45.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>方法总结与易错点</h4><p>对 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y^2=x</annotation></semantics></math> 一类曲线，若路径跨过顶点，优先用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 作参数，通常能够避免分支。第二类积分反向后应变号；若本题从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math> 到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math>，结果为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-4/5</annotation></semantics></math>。这一点与第一类曲线积分的方向无关性必须区分。</p><p>也不要因为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xy</annotation></semantics></math> 关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 为奇函数，就把答案判为零：本题积分包含有向微分 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx</annotation></semantics></math>。上、下两支在指定行进方向下，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx</annotation></semantics></math> 的符号也相反，所以两支的贡献相加。使用对称性以前，必须把被积函数与有向微分作为整体检查。</p>","figureImages":["assets/37cd597f6d82c98635.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/87304c0df222f0940f.webp"]},{"id":"B5","source":"B","page":18,"label":"例5｜p.18","title":"第二类曲线积分转第一类","method":"求指定方向的单位切向量；圆心在(1,0)，勿当原点圆；第02、07节。","module":"line2","nodeIds":["s2"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["原弧以 (1,0) 为圆心，由左端点走向最高点；指定方向的单位切向量是 (y,1−x)，并非原点圆的切向量。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>将第二类曲线积分</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_LP(x,y)\\,dx+Q(x,y)\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>化成第一类曲线积分。其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 为沿上半圆周 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2=2x</annotation></semantics></math>，从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,1)</annotation></semantics></math> 的曲线弧。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>第一步：先确定圆心和实际走过的弧</h4><p>圆方程应先配方：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x-1)^2+y^2=1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>所以圆心是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,0)</annotation></semantics></math>，半径为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math>。沿上半圆从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 走到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,1)</annotation></semantics></math>，其方向先向上，逐渐转向右。题目不是以原点为圆心的圆，不能直接套原点圆的切向量。</p><h4>第二步：第二类转第一类的本质是单位切向量</h4><p>若 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math> 表示沿指定方向累积的弧长，则</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx=\\frac{dx}{ds}\\,ds,\\qquad dy=\\frac{dy}{ds}\\,ds.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(dx/ds,dy/ds)</annotation></semantics></math> 是沿运动方向的单位切向量。因此需要求的是单位切向量，不只是任意一个与曲线相切的向量。</p><h4>第三步：用三角参数把方向符号算清楚</h4><p>令</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=1+\\cos t,\\qquad y=\\sin t.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>起点对应 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=\\pi</annotation></semantics></math>，终点对应 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=\\pi/2</annotation></semantics></math>，即 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math> 是递减的。微分为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx=-\\sin t\\,dt,\\qquad dy=\\cos t\\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>参数速度的长度是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math>。但沿指定方向累积的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds</annotation></semantics></math> 为正，而 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dt&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math>，因此应写 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds=-dt</annotation></semantics></math>，从而</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{dx}{ds}=\\sin t=y,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{dy}{ds}=-\\cos t=1-x.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>也可检查 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y^2+(1-x)^2=1</annotation></semantics></math>，确认这个切向量已经单位化。</p><h4>第四步：将微分关系代回原式</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx=y\\,ds,\\qquad dy=(1-x)\\,ds.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>于是</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_LP(x,y)\\,dx+Q(x,y)\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\" maxsize=\"1.2em\" minsize=\"1.2em\" stretchy=\"true\">[</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\" maxsize=\"1.2em\" minsize=\"1.2em\" stretchy=\"true\">]</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\int_L\\bigl[yP(x,y)+(1-x)Q(x,y)\\bigr]\\,ds.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>不用参数的快速检查</h4><p>圆的法向量为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x-1,y)</annotation></semantics></math>。与它垂直的向量 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(y,1-x)</annotation></semantics></math> 长度恰为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math>；起点处取值为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math>，终点处为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,0)</annotation></semantics></math>，与实际运动方向相符。因此也能直接确认上式。</p><h4>易错点</h4><p>若改成从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,1)</annotation></semantics></math> 返回 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0)</annotation></semantics></math>，单位切向量整体变号，转化后的被积函数也要整体变号。不能把“<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds</annotation></semantics></math> 总为正”误解成第二类积分不受方向影响。</p>","figureImages":["assets/bec0a690d35e2649da.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/b4bc48c9220011f7ac.webp"]},{"id":"B6","source":"B","page":19,"label":"例6｜p.19—21","title":"垂直径向变力沿半圆做功","method":"力大小×单位方向；先由方向条件确定分量符号；第18节。","module":"applications","nodeIds":["s18-0","s18-2"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["重画原图指定的右下半圆 A→B；虚线是补线 B→A。合成闭路逆时针，红箭头表示 F=(−y,x)，与 OP 垂直且 y 分量为正。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>质点 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math> 沿以 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math> 为直径的半圆周，从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(1,2)</annotation></semantics></math> 运动到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(3,4)</annotation></semantics></math>。变力 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol F</annotation></semantics></math> 的大小等于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math> 到原点 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O</annotation></semantics></math> 的距离，方向垂直于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OP</annotation></semantics></math>，且与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 轴正向的夹角小于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi/2</annotation></semantics></math>。求其所做的功。</p><p>运动弧取原图右下侧的半圆弧，见答案区示意。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>第一步：由力的大小和方向，确定坐标分量</h4><p>质点位于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math> 时，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OP</annotation></semantics></math> 的方向向量是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math>。与它垂直、长度同为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}</annotation></semantics></math> 的两个向量为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-y,x)</annotation></semantics></math> 和 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(y,-x)</annotation></semantics></math>。本题半圆的圆心为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(2,3)</annotation></semantics></math>，半径为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt2</annotation></semantics></math>，所以整段弧上 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>。力与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 轴正向的夹角小于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi/2</annotation></semantics></math>，等价于力的第二分量为正。因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol F=(-y,x).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>功应写成力与位移的点积：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W=\\int_L-y\\,dx+x\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>注意力垂直于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OP</annotation></semantics></math>，并不说明它处处沿着以 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math> 为直径的圆周切向；两个圆心不同，不能直接用“力的大小乘半圆弧长”。</p><h4>第二步：按原图补直径，判断闭合方向</h4><p>原图取 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math> 右下侧的半圆弧，方向为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A\\to B</annotation></semantics></math>。补线段 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_0</annotation></semantics></math>，方向必须是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B\\to A</annotation></semantics></math>。两段组成逆时针边界；沿边界行进时，半圆区域始终位于左侧。</p><p>由端点算半径：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|AB|=\\sqrt{(3-1)^2+(4-2)^2}=2\\sqrt2,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=\\sqrt2,\\qquad S_D=\\frac12\\pi r^2=\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第三步：格林公式计算闭合后的功</h4><p>这里 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=-y</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=x</annotation></semantics></math>，两个系数在整个平面内都有连续偏导，故可直接用格林公式：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x-P_y=1-(-1)=2,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W+\\int_{L_0}-y\\,dx+x\\,dy=\\iint_D2\\,dx\\,dy=2\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第四步：计算补线，并明确减去它</h4><p>线段 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math> 的方程为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=x+1</annotation></semantics></math>。在补线 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B\\to A</annotation></semantics></math> 上，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dy=dx</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x:3\\to1</annotation></semantics></math>，因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>3</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_{L_0}-y\\,dx+x\\,dy=\\int_3^1[-(x+1)+x]\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>3</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\int_3^1(-1)\\,dx=2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W=2\\pi-2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>备用方法：三角参数直接积分</h4><p>取 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=2+\\sqrt2\\cos t</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=3+\\sqrt2\\sin t</annotation></semantics></math>，原图右下弧对应 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-3\\pi/4\\le t\\le\\pi/4</annotation></semantics></math>。代入后</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-y\\,dx+x\\,dy=[2+\\sqrt2(3\\sin t+2\\cos t)]\\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>于是</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W=2\\pi+\\sqrt2[-3\\cos t+2\\sin t]_{-3\\pi/4}^{\\pi/4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=2\\pi+\\sqrt2\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}-\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}\\right)=2\\pi-2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>易错点</h4><p>半圆有两条，原图选择不能省略；补线方向与原运动方向应首尾相接；算完闭合积分以后，还必须减去补线贡献。原讲义的计算续页一直到 PDF 第 21 页。</p>","figureImages":["assets/bcb128f45cae4cb7fa.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/0007b6d0d5f3b213ad.webp","assets/ff8fbc4cf69c32102a.webp","assets/37901e195692650c82.webp"]},{"id":"B7","source":"B","page":23,"label":"例7｜p.23—24","title":"正弦曲线上开放积分","method":"补x轴使闭合，格林后减补线项；第08节。","module":"green","nodeIds":["s8-1"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["正弦弧从左向右，补 x 轴从右返回原点，围成的闭路为顺时针；使用格林公式时要在面积积分前加负号。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>计算</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_L\\sin2x\\,dx+2(x^2-1)y\\,dy,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 为曲线 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\sin x</annotation></semantics></math> 上从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\pi,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 的一段。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>第一步：先比较直接代入和补线两条路</h4><p>题目已经给出显式曲线 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\sin x</annotation></semantics></math>，且 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math> 单调增加到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math>，直接代入就能将积分化为一重积分。另一方面，曲线两端都在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 轴上，也很适合补 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 轴用格林公式。两种方法都值得掌握。</p><h4>方法一：代入曲线方程，先化简再分部积分</h4><p>沿 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 有</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\sin x,\\qquad dy=\\cos x\\,dx,\\qquad0\\le x\\le\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2(x^2-1)y\\,dy=2(x^2-1)\\sin x\\cos x\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=(x^2-1)\\sin2x\\,dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>与第一项合并：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>π</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_0^\\pi[1+(x^2-1)]\\sin2x\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>π</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\int_0^\\pi x^2\\sin2x\\,dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>取 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=x^2</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dv=\\sin2x\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math>，则 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">du=2x\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v=-\\cos2x/2</annotation></semantics></math>。分部积分得到</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>π</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>π</mi></msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\left[-\\frac{x^2}{2}\\cos2x\\right]_0^\\pi+\\int_0^\\pi x\\cos2x\\,dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>剩余一项再分部积分：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>π</mi></msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>π</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>π</mi></msubsup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_0^\\pi x\\cos2x\\,dx=\\left[\\frac x2\\sin2x\\right]_0^\\pi-\\frac12\\int_0^\\pi\\sin2x\\,dx=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=-\\frac{\\pi^2}{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>方法二：补 x 轴，格林公式结合对称性</h4><p>补线 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_0</annotation></semantics></math> 从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\pi,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 回到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0)</annotation></semantics></math>。原弧在上方从左到右走，因此闭合边界是顺时针。补线上 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=0</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dy=0</annotation></semantics></math>，且 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>π</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_\\pi^0\\sin2x\\,dx=0</annotation></semantics></math>。记 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>π</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D:0\\le x\\le\\pi,0\\le y\\le\\sin x</annotation></semantics></math>，则</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x-P_y=4xy,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>π</mi></msubsup><mi>x</mi><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=-\\iint_D4xy\\,dx\\,dy=-2\\int_0^\\pi x\\sin^2x\\,dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>π</mi></msubsup><mi>x</mi><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J=\\int_0^\\pi x\\sin^2x\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math>。用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>↦</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\mapsto\\pi-x</annotation></semantics></math> 换元，得到</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>π</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J=\\int_0^\\pi(\\pi-x)\\sin^2x\\,dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>两式相加：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>π</mi></msubsup><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2J=\\pi\\int_0^\\pi\\sin^2x\\,dx=\\frac{\\pi^2}{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>故 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J=\\pi^2/4</annotation></semantics></math>，仍有 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=-2J=-\\pi^2/2</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><h4>易错点</h4><p>补线后不是自动得到正向边界。必须先看区域在行进方向的哪一侧，再决定格林公式前是否加负号；另外补线贡献要实际核对为零，不能凭“补的是坐标轴”就一概省略。</p>","figureImages":["assets/3ad48e42b235ccb9dc.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/333e56c84b8c56dd85.webp","assets/955a36d24ab6228bbb.webp"]},{"id":"B8","source":"B","page":25,"label":"例8｜p.25—26","title":"包围奇点的有理式环流","method":"原点不能纳入格林区域；挖小椭圆，转到简单边界；第09节。","module":"green","nodeIds":["s9-0"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["以 R=1.8 示意原外圆（只要求 R>1）。原点是奇点，挖去小椭圆后才能用格林公式；图中两条比较曲线均按逆时针标出，环域内边界的正向应反向。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>计算</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\oint_L\\frac{x\\,dy-y\\,dx}{4x^2+y^2},</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 为以 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 为圆心、半径为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math> 的圆周，取逆时针方向。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>第一步：检查奇点，解释为什么不能直接算成零</h4><p>令</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=-\\frac{y}{4x^2+y^2},\\qquad Q=\\frac{x}{4x^2+y^2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>分母只在原点为零。由于圆心到原点的距离为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math>，而 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math>，所以原点在圆 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 内部。即使在原点外算出 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x-P_y=0</annotation></semantics></math>，也不能对整个圆盘直接用格林公式，因为系数在内部不连续。</p><h4>第二步：把偏导求清楚，确定挖洞后可换边界</h4><p>记 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h=4x^2+y^2</annotation></semantics></math>。在原点外，由商的求导法则：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x=\\frac{h-x\\cdot8x}{h^2}=\\frac{y^2-4x^2}{h^2},</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_y=\\frac{-h+y\\cdot2y}{h^2}=\\frac{y^2-4x^2}{h^2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>所以 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x-P_y=0</annotation></semantics></math>。选择足够小的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>，使椭圆</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>ε</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4x^2+y^2=\\varepsilon^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>及其内部完全位于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 内。挖去小椭圆后，所有系数在剩余区域及边界上都有连续偏导。</p><h4>第三步：特别处理内外边界的方向</h4><p>把外边界 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 和小椭圆 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>ε</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math> 都按逆时针计。环形区域的正向边界应是“外边界逆时针＋内边界顺时针”，因此格林公式给出</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>ε</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oint_L(P\\,dx+Q\\,dy)-\\oint_{C_\\varepsilon}(P\\,dx+Q\\,dy)=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>从而原积分等于小椭圆上的逆时针积分。不是二者互为相反数。</p><h4>第四步：按分母的形状选椭圆参数</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>ε</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ε</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=\\frac\\varepsilon2\\cos t,\\qquad y=\\varepsilon\\sin t,\\qquad0\\le t\\le2\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>求微分：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>ε</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ε</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx=-\\frac\\varepsilon2\\sin t\\,dt,\\qquad dy=\\varepsilon\\cos t\\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因此分子为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>ε</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>ε</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\,dy-y\\,dx=\\frac{\\varepsilon^2}{2}(\\cos^2t+\\sin^2t)\\,dt=\\frac{\\varepsilon^2}{2}\\,dt,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>分母为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>ε</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon^2</annotation></semantics></math>，所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\frac12\\,dt=\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>为何这比直接参数化偏心圆更省</h4><p>小椭圆不必贴近原边界，只要包住同一奇点并位于原边界内即可。选择它的目的，是把分母变成常数。若直接参数化偏心圆 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=1+R\\cos t,y=R\\sin t</annotation></semantics></math>，会得到较复杂的三角有理式，而挖洞法把主要计算化成一个常数积分。</p><h4>易错点</h4><p>“旋度在原点外为零”不等于“任何闭路积分都为零”；挖掉的内边界不能漏记；小椭圆的两个半轴分别是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon/2</annotation></semantics></math> 与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math>，若错取成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math> 与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math>，分母就不会恒定。</p>","figureImages":["assets/5854e83a00ac3bee48.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/e6f74a45bf69793d6a.webp","assets/c2bd91753ec622c072.webp"]},{"id":"B9","source":"B","page":28,"label":"例9｜p.28","title":"路径无关求常数a","method":"先检查单位圆内部无奇点，再令P_y=Q_x恒等；第10节。","module":"path","nodeIds":["s10-0"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["示意单位开圆盘内两条同端点路径。分母在圆盘内不为零，区域单连通；只有偏导恒等条件满足时，两条路径的积分才相等。图中 A、B 仅为说明路径无关的示意点。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>若曲线积分</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_L\\frac{x\\,dx-a y\\,dy}{x^2+y^2-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>在区域 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D=\\{(x,y):x^2+y^2&lt;1\\}</annotation></semantics></math> 内与路径无关，求常数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>第一步：把微分式拆成两个系数，并检查区域条件</h4><p>记</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>h</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h=x^2+y^2-1,\\qquad P=\\frac xh,\\qquad Q=-\\frac{ay}{h}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>题目区域是单位圆的内部，那里 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math>，所以 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math> 而不为零。<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P,Q</annotation></semantics></math> 在整个区域内都有连续偏导。单位圆盘内部没有洞，是单连通区域。因此这里可以用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_y=Q_x</annotation></semantics></math> 判断路径无关。</p><h4>第二步：分别求偏导，保留分子中的符号</h4><p>求 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_y</annotation></semantics></math> 时，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 对 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 是常数：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>h</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_y=x\\left(-h^{-2}\\right)\\cdot2y=-\\frac{2xy}{h^2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>求 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x</annotation></semantics></math> 时，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-ay</annotation></semantics></math> 对 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 是常数：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>h</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x=(-ay)\\left(-h^{-2}\\right)\\cdot2x=\\frac{2axy}{h^2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>题目要求路径无关，所以在整个区域内恒有</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\frac{2xy}{h^2}=\\frac{2axy}{h^2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第三步：按恒等式求参数，不在特殊点上比较</h4><p>区域内既有 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xy=0</annotation></semantics></math> 的点，也有 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xy\\ne0</annotation></semantics></math> 的点。等式须对所有点成立，因而可选任意 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xy\\ne0</annotation></semantics></math> 的点约去公共因子，得到</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1=a.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>如果只把 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0</annotation></semantics></math> 或 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=0</annotation></semantics></math> 代入，会得到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0=0</annotation></semantics></math>，无法确定参数。</p><h4>第四步：给出原函数，核对结果确实充分</h4><p>当 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=-1</annotation></semantics></math> 时，原微分式变为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{x\\,dx+y\\,dy}{x^2+y^2-1}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>设</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u(x,y)=\\frac12\\ln(1-x^2-y^2).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>由于单位圆内 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-x^2-y^2&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>，该函数处处有定义。分别求导：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_x=\\frac12\\frac{-2x}{1-x^2-y^2}=\\frac{x}{x^2+y^2-1},</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_y=\\frac12\\frac{-2y}{1-x^2-y^2}=\\frac{y}{x^2+y^2-1}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因此原式确为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">du</annotation></semantics></math>，积分只依赖起终点，确认</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=-1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>易错点</h4><p>一是对分母求导时漏掉链式法则的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2x</annotation></semantics></math> 或 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2y</annotation></semantics></math>；二是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x</annotation></semantics></math> 中有两个负号；三是在区域内直接写 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ln(x^2+y^2-1)</annotation></semantics></math>，对实函数而言其真数为负。若用统一写法应是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tfrac12\\ln|x^2+y^2-1|</annotation></semantics></math>，在本区域内等价于上面的原函数。</p>","figureImages":["assets/e78354417e089424f0.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/7b235c3d0fe88e6396.webp"]},{"id":"B10","source":"B","page":30,"label":"例10｜p.30—31","title":"已知偏导与边界值，积分最值","method":"先恢复原函数，端点作差得到一元函数；第10节。","module":"path","nodeIds":["s10-3"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["做功先化为端点函数 I(t)=e^(2−t)+t。曲线在 t=2 处达到最小值 3；这张图辅助核对导数变号，不代替求导证明。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>设函数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math> 满足</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}=(2x+1)e^{2x-y},\\qquad f(0,y)=y+1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_t</annotation></semantics></math> 是从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,t)</annotation></semantics></math> 的光滑曲线。计算</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I(t)=\\int_{L_t}\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}\\,dx+\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial y}\\,dy,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>并求 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I(t)</annotation></semantics></math> 的最小值。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>第一步：认出积分是 df，不必追踪具体曲线</h4><p>题目给出的微分式恰好为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">df=f_x\\,dx+f_y\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因此无论 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_t</annotation></semantics></math> 具体怎样弯曲，只要满足题目的光滑和定义条件，都有</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I(t)=f(1,t)-f(0,0).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>现在的问题是已知一个偏导与一条边界上的函数值，如何把 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math> 恢复出来。</p><h4>第二步：对 x 积分，保留任意的 y 函数</h4><p>观察乘积求导：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial x}\\left(xe^{2x-y}\\right)=e^{2x-y}+2xe^{2x-y}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=(2x+1)e^{2x-y}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x,y)=xe^{2x-y}+\\varphi(y).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>这里“积分常数”不能直接写成数值常数，因为对 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 求偏导会把任意只依赖 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 的函数都消掉。</p><h4>第三步：代入边界条件，确定那个任意函数</h4><p>令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0</annotation></semantics></math>，得到</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(0,y)=0\\cdot e^{-y}+\\varphi(y)=\\varphi(y).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>与已知条件比较：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varphi(y)=y+1,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x,y)=xe^{2x-y}+y+1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>单独计算起终点的值：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(1,t)=e^{2-t}+t+1,\\qquad f(0,0)=1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I(t)=e^{2-t}+t.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第四步：用导数求全局最小值</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>I</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I'(t)=1-e^{2-t}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>令导数为零，得 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{2-t}=1</annotation></semantics></math>，所以 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=2</annotation></semantics></math>。进一步：当 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t&lt;2</annotation></semantics></math> 时，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{2-t}&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math>，故 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>I</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I'(t)&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math>；当 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t&gt;2</annotation></semantics></math> 时，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{2-t}&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math>，故 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>I</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I'(t)&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>。函数先减后增，故这是整个实数范围内的最小值点。</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min I(t)=I(2)=1+2=3.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>更短的最值验证：指数函数的基本不等式</h4><p>利用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>u</mi></msup><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^u\\ge1+u</annotation></semantics></math>，取 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=2-t</annotation></semantics></math>，有</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{2-t}\\ge1+(2-t)=3-t.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>所以 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I(t)=e^{2-t}+t\\ge3</annotation></semantics></math>，等号当且仅当 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2-t=0</annotation></semantics></math>，也就是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=2</annotation></semantics></math>。此法适合在已经求出 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I(t)</annotation></semantics></math> 后快速验算最小值。</p><h4>易错点</h4><p>恢复原函数时不能漏掉 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varphi(y)</annotation></semantics></math>；端点作差不能漏减起点处的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math>；对 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{2-t}</annotation></semantics></math> 求导要带负号。本题求最值的是端点参数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math>，不是在曲线上寻找某个“最优路径”。</p>","figureImages":["assets/1782e782c7ebc3ace0.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/e4bf907e56ee31440f.webp","assets/3224954927c51365f6.webp"]},{"id":"B11","source":"B","page":33,"label":"例11｜p.33—34","title":"验证全微分并求原函数","method":"x>0区域检查；对x积分补φ(y)，再比较y偏导；第10节。","module":"path","nodeIds":["s10-1","s10-2"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["右半平面 x>0 内可比较直线与折线路径。原函数中的 ln x 要求 x>0；灰红虚线 x=0 为不可跨越的定义域边界，A、B 是说明用点。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>验证</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left(\\frac yx+x^2\\right)dx+(\\ln x-2y)dy</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>在右半平面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> 内是某个函数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math> 的全微分，并求一个这样的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>第一步：验证恰当微分的条件</h4><p>记</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(x,y)=\\frac yx+x^2,\\qquad Q(x,y)=\\ln x-2y.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>由于题目限定 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>，分母 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 不为零，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ln x</annotation></semantics></math> 有定义，两个系数及其一阶偏导在右半平面内连续。分别计算：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_y=\\frac1x,\\qquad Q_x=\\frac1x.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>右半平面是单连通区域，所以 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_y=Q_x</annotation></semantics></math> 可保证这个微分式存在原函数。接下来还要实际求出一个 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math>，不能只验证偏导相等就结束。</p><h4>第二步：从 u 的 x 偏导出发积分</h4><p>由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_x=y/x+x^2</annotation></semantics></math>，对 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 积分，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 在这个过程中看成常数：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u(x,y)=y\\ln x+\\frac{x^3}{3}+\\varphi(y).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>必须保留 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varphi(y)</annotation></semantics></math>。若过早把它当成一个数值常数，就无法再调节 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_y</annotation></semantics></math> 中所需的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-2y</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><h4>第三步：比较另一个偏导，确定遗漏的部分</h4><p>对上式关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 求偏导：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>φ</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_y=\\ln x+\\varphi'(y).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>它必须等于题目第二个系数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=\\ln x-2y</annotation></semantics></math>，所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>φ</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varphi'(y)=-2y,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varphi(y)=\\int(-2y)\\,dy=-y^2+C.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>从而得到</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u(x,y)=y\\ln x+\\frac{x^3}{3}-y^2+C.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第四步：把两个偏导都代回检查</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_x=\\frac yx+x^2,\\qquad u_y=\\ln x-2y.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>两项都与题目完全相符，因此原式确为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">du</annotation></semantics></math>。题目只要求一个这样的函数，可以取 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C=0</annotation></semantics></math>；写上任意常数则给出所有原函数。</p><h4>考场更快的方法：直接配成乘积的微分</h4><p>按乘积求微分：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d(y\\ln x)=\\frac yx\\,dx+\\ln x\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>余下的两项分别为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2dx=d\\left(\\frac{x^3}{3}\\right),\\qquad -2y\\,dy=d(-y^2).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>三部分相加，立即得到同一个 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math>。这不是另背一个公式，而是将乘积法则反过来使用：见到“一个变量乘另一个函数”与其导数成对出现时，优先尝试凑全微分。</p><h4>易错点</h4><p>若题目要求“验证”，应交代定义域和偏导相等；若要求“求原函数”，还要给出完整的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math>。<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> 已由题目给定，所以这里用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ln x</annotation></semantics></math>，不需要额外讨论跨越 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0</annotation></semantics></math> 的路径。</p>","figureImages":["assets/c461c2b91cc03c60d3.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/52714ed713bce8987d.webp","assets/8bd0487bb3663b44b7.webp"]},{"id":"B12","source":"B","page":38,"label":"例12｜p.38","title":"抛物面薄壳质量","method":"面密度乘dS；投影圆盘后转极坐标；第12、17节。","module":"surface1","nodeIds":["s17-0"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["抛物面薄壳在 z=1 截出半径 √2 的圆。积分只遍历曲面，不包括底面；投影圆盘 r≤√2，面密度 μ=z 随高度增大。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>求抛物面壳</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=\\frac12(x^2+y^2),\\qquad0\\le z\\le1</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>的质量。其面密度为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu=z</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>第一步：确认这是面壳质量，而不是立体质量</h4><p>题目给出的是抛物面“壳”和面密度 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu=z</annotation></semantics></math>，所以质量公式是</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M=\\iint_\\Sigma\\mu\\,dS.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>不能把它写成在抛物面围成立体内的三重积分。第一类曲面积分也不涉及上侧、下侧的正负号。</p><h4>第二步：投影到 xOy 平面，写全范围与面积因子</h4><p>曲面为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=(x^2+y^2)/2</annotation></semantics></math>。条件 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le z\\le1</annotation></semantics></math> 转化为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>2.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le x^2+y^2\\le2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因此投影区域是半径 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt2</annotation></semantics></math> 的圆盘 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math>。曲面偏导为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_x=x,\\qquad z_y=y,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS=\\sqrt{1+z_x^2+z_y^2}\\,dx\\,dy=\\sqrt{1+x^2+y^2}\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>同时，密度本身也要代入曲面方程：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu=z=\\frac{x^2+y^2}{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第三步：利用圆盘对称性改用极坐标</h4><p>取 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=r\\cos\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=r\\sin\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>。范围为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>≤</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le r\\le\\sqrt2,\\qquad0\\le\\theta\\le2\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>平面面积微元还要乘 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math>：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></msubsup><mfrac><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M=\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\int_0^{\\sqrt2}\\frac{r^2}{2}\\sqrt{1+r^2}\\,r\\,dr\\,d\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></msubsup><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\pi\\int_0^{\\sqrt2}r^3\\sqrt{1+r^2}\\,dr.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第四步：换元并逐项算出根式积分</h4><p>令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=1+r^2</annotation></semantics></math>，则 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">du=2r\\,dr</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^2=u-1</annotation></semantics></math>，所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^3dr=r^2(r\\,dr)=\\frac{u-1}{2}\\,du.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>当 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=0</annotation></semantics></math> 时 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=1</annotation></semantics></math>，当 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=\\sqrt2</annotation></semantics></math> 时 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=3</annotation></semantics></math>。于是</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M=\\frac\\pi2\\int_1^3(u-1)u^{1/2}\\,du</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\frac\\pi2\\int_1^3(u^{3/2}-u^{1/2})\\,du</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\pi\\left[\\frac{u^{5/2}}5-\\frac{u^{3/2}}3\\right]_1^3.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>上限处为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5</mn><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9\\sqrt3/5-\\sqrt3=4\\sqrt3/5</annotation></semantics></math>，下限处为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/5-1/3=-2/15</annotation></semantics></math>。相减后</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M=\\pi\\left(\\frac{4\\sqrt3}{5}+\\frac2{15}\\right)=\\frac{2\\pi}{15}(6\\sqrt3+1).</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>易错点</h4><p>本题有三个因子都不能漏：密度 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^2/2</annotation></semantics></math>、曲面面积因子 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{1+r^2}</annotation></semantics></math>、极坐标雅可比 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math>。此外，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le z\\le1</annotation></semantics></math> 对应的最大半径是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt2</annotation></semantics></math>，不是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math>。质量必须为正，可据此检查最后代入的减号。</p>","figureImages":["assets/37c8c61d860d2da7be.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/f33af87ae2f27831fd.webp"]},{"id":"B13","source":"B","page":43,"label":"例13｜p.43—45","title":"封闭柱面上的有理式通量","method":"分成侧面、上下底；各项按法向处理。内部有原点奇点，不直接套高斯；第14、09节。","module":"surface2","nodeIds":["s22-4","s14-1","s9-1"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["取 R=1 归一化示意封闭圆柱。侧面、上底、下底的外法向分别如红箭头；上下底的 z² 项贡献抵消，内部原点是向量场奇点。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>计算曲面积分</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>S</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_S\\frac{x\\,dy\\,dz+z^2\\,dx\\,dy}{x^2+y^2+z^2},</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math> 是圆柱面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2=R^2</annotation></semantics></math> 与两平面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=R</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=-R</annotation></semantics></math> 围成立体整个表面的外侧，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>第一步：先检查是否适合直接用高斯公式</h4><p>向量场为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol F=\\left(\\frac{x}{x^2+y^2+z^2},0,\\frac{z^2}{x^2+y^2+z^2}\\right).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>整个圆柱体内部含原点，而这个场在原点不满足连续可微条件。不能只看到“整个表面的外侧”就无条件套高斯公式。本题圆柱的侧面与两个底面都容易处理，直接分片更稳。</p><h4>第二步：把上下两底的贡献分别写出，再相消</h4><p>上底 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mo>+</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_+</annotation></semantics></math> 为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=R</annotation></semantics></math>，外法向朝上；下底 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mo>−</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_-</annotation></semantics></math> 为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=-R</annotation></semantics></math>，外法向朝下。在两底面上法向的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 分量都为零，所以 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\,dy\\,dz</annotation></semantics></math> 项没有贡献。记平面圆盘 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D:x^2+y^2\\le R^2</annotation></semantics></math>，则</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mfrac><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_+=\\iint_D\\frac{R^2}{x^2+y^2+R^2}\\,dx\\,dy,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mo>−</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mfrac><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_-=-\\iint_D\\frac{R^2}{x^2+y^2+R^2}\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>下底的负号来自朝下的法向，不是因为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=-R</annotation></semantics></math>。由于分子是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z^2</annotation></semantics></math>，它本身并不变号。因此 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mo>−</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_++I_-=0</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><h4>第三步：参数化侧面，明确外向面积向量</h4><p>侧面取</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=R\\cos\\theta,\\qquad y=R\\sin\\theta,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mo>−</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le\\theta\\le2\\pi,\\qquad -R\\le z\\le R.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>记位置向量为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol r(\\theta,z)</annotation></semantics></math>，则</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">r</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol r_\\theta=(-R\\sin\\theta,R\\cos\\theta,0),</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">r</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol r_z=(0,0,1),</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">r</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">r</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol r_\\theta\\times\\boldsymbol r_z=(R\\cos\\theta,R\\sin\\theta,0).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>这个向量从圆柱轴指向外侧，方向正确。于是侧面的有向微元为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(dy\\,dz,dz\\,dx,dx\\,dy)=(R\\cos\\theta,R\\sin\\theta,0)\\,d\\theta\\,dz.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其第三分量为零，所以 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z^2dxdy</annotation></semantics></math> 项在侧面也没有贡献。</p><h4>第四步：按先角度、后高度的顺序计算</h4><p>侧面上 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2=R^2</annotation></semantics></math>，因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><mi>R</mi></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_{-R}^R\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\frac{R^2\\cos^2\\theta}{R^2+z^2}\\,d\\theta\\,dz.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>利用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos^2\\theta=(1+\\cos2\\theta)/2</annotation></semantics></math>，有</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\cos^2\\theta\\,d\\theta=\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><mi>R</mi></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\pi R^2\\int_{-R}^R\\frac{dz}{R^2+z^2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=z/R</annotation></semantics></math>，则 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dz=R\\,dt</annotation></semantics></math>，上下限为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1</annotation></semantics></math> 与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math>：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi>R</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\pi R\\int_{-1}^1\\frac{dt}{1+t^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\pi R[\\arctan t]_{-1}^1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi>R</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>R</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\pi R\\left(\\frac\\pi4+\\frac\\pi4\\right)=\\frac{\\pi^2R}{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>易错点</h4><p>分片后要分别检查“哪一个微元为零”和“方向导致什么符号”，不能把两个底面都当作上侧。另一个常见错误是求侧面时漏掉面积向量中的一个 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math>，最后会导致答案少一个 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math> 的因子。若用投影法，也必须将侧面前后两片分开处理。</p>","figureImages":["assets/f386fd2173958b9029.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/6cad81ad41961d897a.webp","assets/c7a9f1f23ddf617e5a.webp","assets/9dbacc49e1d19066ff.webp"]},{"id":"B14","source":"B","page":46,"label":"例14｜p.46","title":"平面片含连续抽象函数","method":"法向(1,-1,1)与抽象部分点乘为零；第四卦限对应x,z≥0,y≤0；第14节。","module":"surface2","nodeIds":["s22-3","s14-1","s14-2"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["第四卦限采用 x≥0、y≤0、z≥0。三角面截距为 (1,0,0)、(0,−1,0)、(0,0,1)，上侧面积向量方向 (1,−1,1)；浅灰三角形为 xOy 投影。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>计算</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_\\Sigma[f(x,y,z)+x]\\,dy\\,dz</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mo>+</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\quad+\\iint_\\Sigma[2f(x,y,z)+y]\\,dz\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mo>+</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\quad+\\iint_\\Sigma[f(x,y,z)+z]\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math> 为连续函数，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math> 是平面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x-y+z=1</annotation></semantics></math> 在第四卦限部分的上侧。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>第一步：为什么优先用合一投影</h4><p>三个积分系数都含同一个抽象函数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math>，题目只保证它连续，没有保证它可导。因此不应先对 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math> 求偏导，也不宜强行补面套高斯公式。曲面是一个平面片，法向量为常向量；先把三个有向微元统一到一个平面上，很可能直接消掉 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><h4>第二步：把曲面写成 z 的显函数，并按上侧选符号</h4><p>由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x-y+z=1</annotation></semantics></math>，得到</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=1-x+y,\\qquad z_x=-1,\\qquad z_y=1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>对于取上侧的曲面，有</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(dy\\,dz,dz\\,dx,dx\\,dy)=(-z_x,-z_y,1)\\,dx\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=(1,-1,1)\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>这里的向量已经包含了面积因子，不需要再额外乘 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt3</annotation></semantics></math>。若先用单位法向量，则应同时使用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS</annotation></semantics></math>，不能混用两种写法。</p><h4>第三步：将三项合并，观察抽象函数如何抵消</h4><p>投影后的被积函数为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(f+x)\\cdot1+(2f+y)\\cdot(-1)+(f+z)\\cdot1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=f+x-2f-y+f+z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=x-y+z.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>在原平面上 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x-y+z=1</annotation></semantics></math>，所以整个被积函数恰好为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math>。这一步必须使用曲面方程，不能把 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y,z</annotation></semantics></math> 当作三个独立变量继续积分。</p><h4>第四步：由第四卦限写出准确的投影范围</h4><p>按本题的卦限约定，第四卦限满足 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\ge0,y\\le0,z\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math>。将 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=1-x+y\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math> 化为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y\\ge x-1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>结合 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y\\le0</annotation></semantics></math>，可得 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le x\\le1</annotation></semantics></math>。因此投影三角域为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D=\\{(x,y):0\\le x\\le1,\\ x-1\\le y\\le0\\}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>于是</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_0^1\\int_{x-1}^{0}1\\,dy\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\int_0^1[0-(x-1)]\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\left[x-\\frac{x^2}{2}\\right]_0^1=\\frac12.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>本质解释：被消掉的场只沿曲面切向</h4><p>抽象部分可以写成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(1,2,1)</annotation></semantics></math>，而平面的法向量为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,-1,1)</annotation></semantics></math>。二者点积为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(1,2,1)\\cdot(1,-1,1)=f(1-2+1)=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>所以这一部分没有穿过平面片的通量，无论连续函数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math> 的具体形式是什么，都不影响答案。这正是“先检查法向量，可能无需处理抽象函数”的典型情形。</p><h4>易错点</h4><p>第二个微元对应的符号是负号；第四卦限不应误写成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y,z</annotation></semantics></math> 全非负；投影是三角形而不是正方形；使用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-z_x,-z_y,1)dxdy</annotation></semantics></math> 后，不要再乘曲面面积因子。</p>","figureImages":["assets/37ef5e67c3e4800da1.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/606887aa6f6b98966c.webp"]},{"id":"B15","source":"B","page":49,"label":"例15｜p.49—50","title":"下半球上侧通量","method":"先在原球面上把分母化为常数；直接投影或换光滑场后补面，原侧是内侧；第15节。","module":"gauss","nodeIds":["s15-1","s15-4"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["取 a=1 归一化示意。原下半球面取上侧，因此法向指向球体内部；若补 z=0 圆盘并取下侧，两者组成整个下半球体边界的内侧。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>计算</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_\\Sigma\\frac{a x\\,dy\\,dz+(z+a)^2\\,dx\\,dy}{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2+z^2}},</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math> 为下半球面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=-\\sqrt{a^2-x^2-y^2}</annotation></semantics></math> 的上侧，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>第一步：先在原球面上化简，才能安全选用高斯公式</h4><p>原曲面的点满足 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2+z^2=a^2</annotation></semantics></math>，而 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>，因此分母在整个曲面上恒为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math>。令</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">G</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol G=(ax,0,(z+a)^2),</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">G</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>a</mi></mfrac><msub><mi>J</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J_\\Sigma=\\iint_\\Sigma\\boldsymbol G\\cdot\\boldsymbol n\\,dS,\\qquad I=\\frac1aJ_\\Sigma.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>我们现在对光滑的多项式场 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol G</annotation></semantics></math> 使用定理。并不是说原来含根式分母的场在球心也光滑；只是因为两个场在原积分曲面上的取值关系已经确定，可以换用更方便的光滑场。</p><h4>第二步：下半球的上侧是内侧，补面也要统一为内侧</h4><p>记下半球体为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega=\\{(x,y,z):x^2+y^2+z^2\\le a^2,\\ z\\le0\\}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>在下半球面上，朝上的法向量指向球体内部，所以题目所取的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math> 是下半球体边界的内侧。补圆盘 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_0:z=0,x^2+y^2\\le a^2</annotation></semantics></math>，并让它取下侧，才与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math> 一起组成整个边界的内侧。因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>J</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">G</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J_\\Sigma+J_0=-\\iiint_\\Omega\\operatorname{div}\\boldsymbol G\\,dv.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>负号只来自闭合面取内侧。散度为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">G</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{div}\\boldsymbol G=a+0+2(z+a)=2z+3a.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第三步：用水平截面计算体积和 z 的一阶矩</h4><p>固定 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\in[-a,0]</annotation></semantics></math> 时，截面是半径 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{a^2-z^2}</annotation></semantics></math> 的圆盘，面积为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi(a^2-z^2)</annotation></semantics></math>。所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V=\\pi\\int_{-a}^0(a^2-z^2)\\,dz</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\pi\\left[a^2z-\\frac{z^3}{3}\\right]_{-a}^{0}=\\frac{2\\pi a^3}{3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>同理</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_z=\\iiint_\\Omega z\\,dv=\\pi\\int_{-a}^0z(a^2-z^2)\\,dz</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\pi\\left[\\frac{a^2z^2}{2}-\\frac{z^4}{4}\\right]_{-a}^{0}=-\\frac{\\pi a^4}{4}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>这里的一阶矩为负，符合整个区域处于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\le0</annotation></semantics></math> 的事实。代回散度积分：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>J</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J_\\Sigma+J_0=-(2M_z+3aV)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=-\\left[-\\frac{\\pi a^4}{2}+2\\pi a^4\\right]=-\\frac{3\\pi a^4}{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第四步：算补面，再减去补面</h4><p>圆盘 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_0</annotation></semantics></math> 取下侧，故单位法向为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0,-1)</annotation></semantics></math>。当 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=0</annotation></semantics></math> 时，</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">G</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol G\\cdot\\boldsymbol n=-(z+a)^2=-a^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J_0=-a^2\\cdot\\pi a^2=-\\pi a^4,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J_\\Sigma=-\\frac{3\\pi a^4}{2}-(-\\pi a^4)=-\\frac{\\pi a^4}{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>最后别漏掉最初提取的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/a</annotation></semantics></math>：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>J</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\frac{J_\\Sigma}{a}=-\\frac{\\pi a^3}{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>备用方法：直接投影，独立核对方向</h4><p>下半球写成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=-\\sqrt{a^2-x^2-y^2}</annotation></semantics></math>，上侧面积向量为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-z_x,-z_y,1)dxdy</annotation></semantics></math>。因为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_x=-x/z</annotation></semantics></math>，原积分投影后为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_{x^2+y^2\\le a^2}\\left[\\frac{x^2}{z}+\\frac{(z+a)^2}{a}\\right]\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>极坐标下，第一部分的角积分为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math>。令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=a^2-r^2</annotation></semantics></math>，得到</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>a</mi></msubsup><mfrac><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_1=-\\pi\\int_0^a\\frac{r^3}{\\sqrt{a^2-r^2}}\\,dr</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=-\\frac\\pi2\\int_0^{a^2}(a^2-u)u^{-1/2}\\,du=-\\frac{2\\pi a^3}{3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>第二部分令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v=\\sqrt{a^2-r^2}</annotation></semantics></math>，则 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>v</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">rdr=-v\\,dv</annotation></semantics></math>，所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>a</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>v</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>v</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_2=\\frac{2\\pi}{a}\\int_0^a(a-v)^2v\\,dv</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>a</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\frac{2\\pi}{a}\\left[\\frac{a^2v^2}{2}-\\frac{2av^3}{3}+\\frac{v^4}{4}\\right]_0^a=\\frac{\\pi a^3}{6}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>两部分相加仍为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\pi a^3/2</annotation></semantics></math>。赤道处显函数的偏导发散，但该边界的投影积分可按上述收敛的广义积分处理；考场主方法仍推荐前面的补面法。</p><h4>易错点</h4><p>本题最重要的三个检查点是：下半球“上侧”是内侧；补圆盘也取下侧；算完封闭面要减去补面。若补面取上侧，却仍把整个闭合面当成同一侧，最后符号一定会出问题。</p>","figureImages":["assets/1583aad67c5054ee09.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/6a53348fbdb0c5ce3d.webp","assets/a7eb57b246ae6a43ea.webp"]},{"id":"B16","source":"B","page":51,"label":"例16｜p.51—52","title":"径向反平方场穿过椭球面","method":"原点奇点；挖小球，保留内边界通量；第09节。","module":"gauss","nodeIds":["s9-1"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["外椭球包围原点奇点，不能直接以“散度为零”写通量为零。挖去原点附近小球后比较两边界通量；内小球相对挖洞区域的外法向朝向球心。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>计算</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_\\Sigma\\frac{x\\,dy\\,dz+y\\,dz\\,dx+z\\,dx\\,dy}{(x^2+y^2+z^2)^{3/2}},</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math> 为椭球面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2x^2+2y^2+z^2=4</annotation></semantics></math> 的外侧。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>第一步：辨认径向场，先找出不能直接用定理的位置</h4><p>令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2+z^2}</annotation></semantics></math>，向量场为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol F=\\frac{(x,y,z)}{r^3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>这个场沿径向向外，大小为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/r^2</annotation></semantics></math>，但在原点没有定义。椭球内部包含原点，所以不能对整个椭球体直接套高斯公式。</p><h4>第二步：只在原点外求散度</h4><p>当 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> 时，用乘积法则与链式法则：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>r</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\partial(xr^{-3})}{\\partial x}=r^{-3}+x(-3r^{-4})\\frac{x}{r}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=r^{-3}-3x^2r^{-5}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>另外两个对应变量的偏导分别为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\partial(yr^{-3})}{\\partial y}=r^{-3}-3y^2r^{-5},</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\partial(zr^{-3})}{\\partial z}=r^{-3}-3z^2r^{-5}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>相加后</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{div}\\boldsymbol F=3r^{-3}-3(x^2+y^2+z^2)r^{-5}=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>这个“零”只对原点外成立，不能把原点的条件缺口略去。</p><h4>第三步：挖去小球，保留内边界的通量</h4><p>椭球方程可写成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2/2+y^2/2+z^2/4=1</annotation></semantics></math>，所以其最短半轴为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt2</annotation></semantics></math>。选 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>ε</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0&lt;\\varepsilon&lt;\\sqrt2</annotation></semantics></math>，小球 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r\\le\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math> 就完全位于椭球内部。记小球面按它自身外侧计为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>ε</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><p>对“椭球内、但小球外”的区域，高斯公式条件成立。它的外边界是原椭球外侧，内边界相对于小球自身外侧方向相反，因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>ε</mi></msub></msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mn>0</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I-\\iint_{S_\\varepsilon}\\boldsymbol F\\cdot\\boldsymbol n\\,dS=\\iiint_\\Omega0\\,dv=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>所以原积分等于小球面按自身外侧的通量。</p><h4>第四步：在球面上算常数通量</h4><p>小球面上 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math>，单位外法向为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>ε</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol n=\\frac{(x,y,z)}{\\varepsilon}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>点积为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi>ε</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>ε</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol F\\cdot\\boldsymbol n=\\frac{x^2+y^2+z^2}{\\varepsilon^4}=\\frac1{\\varepsilon^2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>球面面积是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>ε</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\pi\\varepsilon^2</annotation></semantics></math>，于是</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>ε</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><msub><mo>∬</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>ε</mi></msub></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\frac1{\\varepsilon^2}\\iint_{S_\\varepsilon}dS</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>ε</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>ε</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\frac1{\\varepsilon^2}\\cdot4\\pi\\varepsilon^2=4\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>为什么无需真的让小球半径趋于零</h4><p>上式对每个充分小的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math> 都成立，而且算出的通量已经与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math> 无关，所以不必再额外求极限。椭球换成任何满足相同光滑条件、包围原点一次的封闭曲面，这个换边界思路也适用；若封闭曲面不包围原点，则可以直接用高斯公式得到零。</p><h4>易错点</h4><p>挖球后不能把内边界漏掉；内边界相对于挖球后区域的外法向，是朝向球心的方向。若把它与小球自身外侧混为一谈，会把最终的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\pi</annotation></semantics></math> 算成负数。也不能将“散度为零”当作忽略奇点条件的理由。</p>","figureImages":["assets/292241647a9319599f.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/56c5be052a07725d5a.webp","assets/c963a1d6e180bae3e9.webp"]},{"id":"B17","source":"B","page":54,"label":"例17｜p.54","title":"给定点处散度","method":"对三个对应变量求偏导，再代入点；结果为2；第03节。","module":"foundation","nodeIds":["s3"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":[],"diagramType":"not-required","questionHtml":"<p>向量场</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">i</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>z</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">j</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol u(x,y,z)=xy^2\\boldsymbol i+ye^z\\boldsymbol j+x\\ln(1+z^2)\\boldsymbol k</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>在点 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(1,1,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 处的散度是多少？</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>第一步：先写清三个分量与散度的定义</h4><p>将向量场写成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">u</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol u=(P,Q,R)</annotation></semantics></math>，其中</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>z</mi></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=xy^2,\\qquad Q=ye^z,\\qquad R=x\\ln(1+z^2).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>散度是一个标量，其定义为三个“对应变量”的偏导之和：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">u</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{div}\\boldsymbol u=P_x+Q_y+R_z.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>不是把每个分量都分别对三个变量求导后全部相加，也不是求旋度。</p><h4>第二步：每项都按偏导规则计算</h4><p>对 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 求导时，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 看成常数，所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_x=\\frac{\\partial(xy^2)}{\\partial x}=y^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>对 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 求导时，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>z</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^z</annotation></semantics></math> 看成常数，所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>z</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>z</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_y=\\frac{\\partial(ye^z)}{\\partial y}=e^z.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>对最后一项关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 求导，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 看成常数，并使用复合函数求导：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_z=x\\cdot\\frac1{1+z^2}\\cdot2z=\\frac{2xz}{1+z^2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因此在一般点处</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">u</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>z</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{div}\\boldsymbol u=y^2+e^z+\\frac{2xz}{1+z^2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第三步：求完偏导之后，再代入指定点</h4><p>在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(1,1,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 处，各项分别是</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>z</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y^2=1,\\qquad e^z=e^0=1,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{2xz}{1+z^2}=\\frac{2\\cdot1\\cdot0}{1+0}=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>相加得到</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{div}\\boldsymbol u(1,1,0)=1+1+0=2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>易错点与辨认方法</h4><p>本题最常见的错误是先把 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=1,y=1,z=0</annotation></semantics></math> 代入场的各分量，再把所得常数求导，这会丢掉点附近的变化信息。正确顺序永远是“先求偏导，后代点”。另一个易错点是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\ln(1+z^2)</annotation></semantics></math> 关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 的导数：外层对数求导以后，还要乘内层的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2z</annotation></semantics></math>。散度最后只有一个数；若写成三个分量组成的向量，说明与旋度混淆了。</p>","figureImages":[],"answerImages":["assets/b28c22f8feb9f5c58c.webp"]},{"id":"B18","source":"B","page":57,"label":"例18｜p.57—58","title":"柱面与平面交线环流","method":"选平面片用斯托克斯；上视逆时针取上侧；第16节。","module":"stokes","nodeIds":["s16-0"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["交线位于倾斜平面 z=x+y 中；选择该平面圆盘用斯托克斯。上侧法向可取 (−1,−1,1)，与从 +z 看去的逆时针方向配合；下方虚线为单位圆投影。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>设 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 为柱面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2=1</annotation></semantics></math> 与平面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=x+y</annotation></semantics></math> 的交线，从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 轴正向往负向看去为逆时针方向。求</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\oint_Lxz\\,dx+x\\,dy+\\frac{y^2}{2}\\,dz.</annotation></semantics></math></span>","solutionHtml":"<h4>第一步：根据闭交线选择斯托克斯公式</h4><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 是圆柱面与平面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=x+y</annotation></semantics></math> 的闭交线。对同一条边界，斯托克斯公式允许我们选择更容易积分的跨面；这里应取交线围成的平面片，而不必去处理圆柱侧面。系数都是多项式，连续偏导条件没有问题。</p><p>记</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=xz,\\qquad Q=x,\\qquad R=\\frac{y^2}{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第二步：旋度分量逐项求出</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_y-Q_z=y-0=y,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_z-R_x=x-0=x,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x-P_y=1-0=1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">rot</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{rot}\\boldsymbol F=(y,x,1).</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第三步：用右手规则确定平面片上侧</h4><p>从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 轴正向往负向看去，边界是逆时针方向。右手四指沿此方向弯曲时，拇指指向 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 分量为正的一侧，所以应取平面片的上侧。写成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=x+y</annotation></semantics></math>，有</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_x=1,\\qquad z_y=1,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol n\\,dS=(-1,-1,1)\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>这里不必单位化。如果改写成单位法向 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-1,-1,1)/\\sqrt3</annotation></semantics></math>，就必须同时使用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS=\\sqrt3\\,dxdy</annotation></semantics></math>，两者的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt3</annotation></semantics></math> 会抵消。</p><h4>第四步：确定投影区域并计算</h4><p>交线投影满足 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2=1</annotation></semantics></math>，所以平面片在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xOy</annotation></semantics></math> 上的投影为单位圆盘 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D:x^2+y^2\\le1</annotation></semantics></math>。于是</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_D(y,x,1)\\cdot(-1,-1,1)\\,dx\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\iint_D(1-x-y)\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>圆盘关于两坐标轴对称，故 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_Dx\\,dxdy=\\iint_Dy\\,dxdy=0</annotation></semantics></math>。剩余一项为圆盘面积：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_D1\\,dx\\,dy=\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\int_0^1r\\,dr\\,d\\theta=\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>另一种真正不同的列式：先消去 z，再用平面格林公式</h4><p>在交线上，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=x+y</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dz=dx+dy</annotation></semantics></math>。将原微分式完整代入：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xz\\,dx+x\\,dy+\\frac{y^2}{2}\\,dz</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\left(x^2+xy+\\frac{y^2}{2}\\right)dx+\\left(x+\\frac{y^2}{2}\\right)dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>现在路径变成平面上的逆时针单位圆，设新系数为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">~</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">~</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\widetilde P,\\widetilde Q</annotation></semantics></math>，则</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">~</mo></mover><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">~</mo></mover><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\widetilde Q_x=1,\\qquad \\widetilde P_y=x+y.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>由格林公式又得到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_D(1-x-y)dxdy=\\pi</annotation></semantics></math>。这一方法说明：对位于图形平面上的空间闭曲线，消元后也能降成平面题。</p><h4>易错点</h4><p>边界从上看逆时针，应选 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 分量为正的法向；旋度的第二分量是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_z-R_x</annotation></semantics></math>，不要误写成相反数；法向量与面积因子不能重复相乘；用消元法时不能只代 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=x+y</annotation></semantics></math> 而漏掉 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dz=dx+dy</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>","figureImages":["assets/09d8212f60c9c66477.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/1fa937e9a2fee5d93a.webp","assets/ecc82ef80a1746d1ef.webp"]},{"id":"B19","source":"B","page":60,"label":"例19｜p.60","title":"向量场旋度","method":"逐项求旋度，结果(0,1,y-1)，不能当标量；第03节。","module":"foundation","nodeIds":["s3"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":[],"diagramType":"not-required","questionHtml":"<p>求向量场</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">i</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">j</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol A(x,y,z)=(x+y+z)\\boldsymbol i+xy\\boldsymbol j+z\\boldsymbol k</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>的旋度 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">rot</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{rot}\\boldsymbol A</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>第一步：认清旋度的结果类型与分量顺序</h4><p>记</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=x+y+z,\\qquad Q=xy,\\qquad R=z.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>旋度是向量，按三个坐标分量写为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">rot</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{rot}\\boldsymbol A=(R_y-Q_z,\\ P_z-R_x,\\ Q_x-P_y).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>与散度 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_x+Q_y+R_z</annotation></semantics></math> 不同，旋度使用的是交叉的偏导，而且不能把三项再相加成一个数。</p><h4>第二步：逐个计算所需的六个偏导</h4><p>第一个分量需要 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_y</annotation></semantics></math> 和 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_z</annotation></semantics></math>。<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R=z</annotation></semantics></math> 不含 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=xy</annotation></semantics></math> 不含 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>，因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_y=0,\\qquad Q_z=0,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_y-Q_z=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>第二个分量需要 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_z</annotation></semantics></math> 和 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_x</annotation></semantics></math>。对 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 求偏导时，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y</annotation></semantics></math> 都视为常数；<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R=z</annotation></semantics></math> 对 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 的偏导为零：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_z=1,\\qquad R_x=0,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_z-R_x=1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>第三个分量需要 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x</annotation></semantics></math> 和 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_y</annotation></semantics></math>。对 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 求 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xy</annotation></semantics></math> 的偏导时，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 是常数，所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x=y,\\qquad P_y=1,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x-P_y=y-1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第三步：按顺序组装最终向量</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">rot</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{rot}\\boldsymbol A=(0,1,y-1).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>也可以按基向量写成</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">rot</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">j</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{rot}\\boldsymbol A=\\boldsymbol j+(y-1)\\boldsymbol k.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>题目没有要求代入某一点，所以应保留变量 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math>，不要自行令它为零或任意取值。</p><h4>易错点与检查方式</h4><p>若采用行列式记法，展开中间一项时会带负号，因此常见错误是把第二分量写成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_x-P_z=-1</annotation></semantics></math>。直接按 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(R_y-Q_z,P_z-R_x,Q_x-P_y)</annotation></semantics></math> 的顺序计算更稳。还要区分 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x=y</annotation></semantics></math> 与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_y=x</annotation></semantics></math>：本题第三分量使用前者。最后检查答案确实有三个分量，并且第一分量为零、第二分量为常数、第三分量只含 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math>，就能有效排查大部分抄写和求导错误。</p>","figureImages":[],"answerImages":["assets/414c87f186c438cbb0.webp"]},{"id":"E3","source":"E","page":1,"label":"例3｜p.1—2","title":"双纽线上的|x|弧长积分","method":"四象限对称缩域，极坐标r²=a²cos2θ；第05节。","module":"line1","nodeIds":["s5-2"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["以 a=1 归一化重画双纽线。第一象限弧对应 0≤θ≤π/4；|x| 与 ds 在四象限对称，所以该弧积分乘 4。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>求曲线积分</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_L |x|\\,ds,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 为双纽线的全弧段，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x^2+y^2)^2=a^2(x^2-y^2).</annotation></semantics></math></span>","solutionHtml":"<h4>选法：对称缩域，把双纽线放进极坐标</h4>\n<p>这是第一类曲线积分，微元为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds</annotation></semantics></math>，没有方向符号。双纽线同时关于两坐标轴对称，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|x|</annotation></semantics></math> 在这些反射下保持不变，因此只计算第一象限的弧段 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_1</annotation></semantics></math>，最后乘 4。直接写成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=y(x)</annotation></semantics></math> 会出现多层根式，极坐标更合适。</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=4\\int_{L_1}x\\,ds.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>第一步：确定极坐标方程和角度范围</h4>\n<p>代入 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=r\\cos\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=r\\sin\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>，得到</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^4=a^2r^2\\cos2\\theta.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>除去原点后可约去 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^2</annotation></semantics></math>，原点作为端点仍保留。第一象限中需要 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos2\\theta\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math>，故</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=a\\sqrt{\\cos2\\theta},\\qquad0\\le\\theta\\le\\frac\\pi4.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>不能把第一象限的角度直接写成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le\\theta\\le\\pi/2</annotation></semantics></math>：后半段根式没有实数值。</p>\n<h4>第二步：逐项计算弧长微元</h4>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r'=-\\frac{a\\sin2\\theta}{\\sqrt{\\cos2\\theta}}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^2+(r')^2=a^2\\cos2\\theta+\\frac{a^2\\sin^22\\theta}{\\cos2\\theta}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>通分后，分子用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos^22\\theta+\\sin^22\\theta=1</annotation></semantics></math>：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^2+(r')^2=\\frac{a^2}{\\cos2\\theta},</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds=\\frac{a}{\\sqrt{\\cos2\\theta}}\\,d\\theta.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>第三步：把被积函数和微元同时代入</h4>\n<p>在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_1</annotation></semantics></math> 上 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math>，所以</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi></mrow></msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=a\\sqrt{\\cos2\\theta}\\cos\\theta.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>恰好与弧长微元中的根式相消：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\,ds=a^2\\cos\\theta\\,d\\theta.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=4a^2\\int_0^{\\pi/4}\\cos\\theta\\,d\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=4a^2\\left[\\sin\\theta\\right]_0^{\\pi/4}=2\\sqrt2\\,a^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>结论与复盘</h4>\n<p>答案为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\sqrt2\\,a^2</annotation></semantics></math>。<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta=\\pi/4</annotation></semantics></math> 处单独的弧长表达式趋于无穷，但乘积已经化成连续的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a^2\\cos\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>，可按端点极限积分。此题的关键不是硬算根式，而是同时代入 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|x|</annotation></semantics></math> 和 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds</annotation></semantics></math>，发现相消。对称缩域后必须记住乘回 4。</p>","figureImages":["assets/f0b6fb65aa6339eb5f.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/9b1e15c31bf7a178e1.webp","assets/d01c17c036f9a9e1e9.webp"]},{"id":"E4","source":"E","page":3,"label":"例4｜p.3—4","title":"交圆上的xy项","method":"轮换积分相等，平方平面约束凑xy+yz+zx；第06节。","module":"line1","nodeIds":["s22-0","s6-1","s6-2"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["单位球与 x+y+z=0 的交圆为大圆，且对 x、y、z 轮换对称。几何与 B3 相同，但被积函数是 xy，需利用三项相加恒等式，不能按单变量奇偶性误判为零。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>设 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 为球面与平面的交线：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2+z^2=1,\\qquad x+y+z=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>求</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\oint_L xy\\,ds.</annotation></semantics></math></span>","solutionHtml":"<h4>选法：利用轮换对称，避免写空间圆的参数方程</h4>\n<p>积分对象是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xy\\,ds</annotation></semantics></math>。虽然出现乘积 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xy</annotation></semantics></math>，这里不能只把 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 或 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 单独改号就判奇，因为平面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x+y+z=0</annotation></semantics></math> 在这种单独变号下未必保持不变。真正适用的是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y,z</annotation></semantics></math> 的轮换对称。</p>\n<h4>第一步：写出三个相等的积分</h4>\n<p>球面方程与平面方程在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,y,z)\\to(y,z,x)</annotation></semantics></math> 后均不变，长度微元 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds</annotation></semantics></math> 也不变。因此</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\oint_Lxy\\,ds=\\oint_Lyz\\,ds=\\oint_Lzx\\,ds.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>三式相加：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3I=\\oint_L(xy+yz+zx)\\,ds.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>第二步：用曲线上的两个约束凑出常数</h4>\n<p>在每个曲线点上，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x+y+z=0</annotation></semantics></math>。平方展开得到</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2+z^2+2xy+2yz+2zx=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>再代入球面关系 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2+z^2=1</annotation></semantics></math>：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1+2(xy+yz+zx)=0,</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xy+yz+zx=-\\frac12.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>第三步：判断交圆半径，求出长度</h4>\n<p>平面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x+y+z=0</annotation></semantics></math> 经过原点，原点又是单位球的球心，所以截得的是半径为 1 的大圆。其长度为</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oint_Lds=2\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>于是</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3I=-\\frac12\\oint_Lds=-\\frac12\\cdot2\\pi=-\\pi,</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=-\\frac\\pi3.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>考研中怎样识别这类题</h4>\n<p>看到“球面＋<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>常数</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x+y+z=\\text{常数}</annotation></semantics></math>”与“<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xy</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">yz</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">zx</annotation></semantics></math>”同时出现，先想轮换求和，并尝试平方平面方程。一般平面不经过球心时，还要先算球心到平面的距离，再求截圆半径；本题因平面过球心，这一步直接化简。第一类曲线积分不随方向改变，答案中的负号来自 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xy+yz+zx=-1/2</annotation></semantics></math>，不是曲线方向。</p>","figureImages":["assets/207a0ddcfbe9bbb44a.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/adaed93c5fe5f06f77.webp","assets/0169eef7088a44b7a5.webp"]},{"id":"E5","source":"E","page":5,"label":"例5｜p.5","title":"折线与绝对值分母","method":"分两段去绝对值，按行进方向确定上下限；第07节。","module":"line2","nodeIds":["s7-0"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["折线先在第一象限 A→B，再在第二象限 B→C。两段的 |x|+|y| 都等于 1，但 dy/dx 和 x 的行进上下限不同。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>折线 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 依次由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(1,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math>，再到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(-1,0)</annotation></semantics></math>。求</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_L\\frac{dx+dy}{|x|+|y|}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>","solutionHtml":"<h4>选法：折线分段，绝对值逐段处理</h4>\n<p>这是第二类曲线积分，既要看每段方程，也要看行进方向。折线在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math> 处转折，而且 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 在此处变号，正好应拆成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BC</annotation></semantics></math> 两段：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=I_{AB}+I_{BC}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>第一步：计算从 A 到 B 的积分</h4>\n<p>直线 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math> 过 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,0)</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math>，故</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>x</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>→</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=1-x,\\qquad dy=-dx,\\qquad x:1\\to0.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>这一段 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math>，因此分母为</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|x|+|y|=x+y=1.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>分子中的两个微分相消：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx+dy=dx-dx=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{AB}=\\int_1^0\\frac{0}{1}\\,dx=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>第二步：计算从 B 到 C 的积分</h4>\n<p>直线 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BC</annotation></semantics></math> 的方程是</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>x</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>→</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=x+1,\\qquad dy=dx,\\qquad x:0\\to-1.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>这一段 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\le0</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math>，所以</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|x|+|y|=-x+y=-x+x+1=1.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>此时分子为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx+dy=2dx</annotation></semantics></math>，故</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{BC}=\\int_0^{-1}2\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo fence=\"true\" maxsize=\"1.2em\" minsize=\"1.2em\" stretchy=\"true\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo fence=\"true\" maxsize=\"1.2em\" minsize=\"1.2em\" stretchy=\"true\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=2\\bigl((-1)-0\\bigr)=-2.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>第三步：合并并检查符号</h4>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=0+(-2)=-2.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>结果为负的原因是第二段沿 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 减小的方向行进，且 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx+dy</annotation></semantics></math> 在这一段整体为负。不要把第二段上下限改成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1\\to0</annotation></semantics></math> 后仍不加负号。</p>\n<h4>可迁移的做题步骤</h4>\n<p>同类题按“分段点—每段坐标符号—参数方程—起终点对应上下限”列一个小表，再代入积分。这里两段分母都等于 1，是分别利用各自的符号和直线方程得到的，不能在其他折线上直接照搬。由于两段从不同时满足 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=y=0</annotation></semantics></math>，原积分没有分母为零的问题。</p>","figureImages":["assets/ad5c5163544a701da6.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/7e5371a58bf09b074c.webp"]},{"id":"E6","source":"E","page":6,"label":"例6｜p.6—7","title":"空间椭圆与分母恒定","method":"曲线上先化简分母，全微分z dz积分为零，参数化余项；第07节。","module":"line2","nodeIds":["s22-1","s6-2","s7-1","s7-2","s7-3"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["空间交线的 xOy 投影是半轴 1/2 与 1 的椭圆。参数 t 递增对应从 +z 看去逆时针，平面法向 (2,1,1) 的 z 分量为正。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>计算</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\oint_L\\frac{-y\\,dx+x\\,dy+z(4x^2+y^2)\\,dz}{4x^2+y^2},</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中闭曲线 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 满足</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4x^2+y^2=1,\\qquad 2x+y+z=1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 轴正向看去，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 为逆时针方向。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>选法：曲线上先化简，分离全微分</h4>\n<p>题中分母 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4x^2+y^2</annotation></semantics></math> 恰好是曲线约束。先在曲线上代成 1，比一开始计算复杂偏导或直接套斯托克斯更简单。原向量场在空间中可能有分母为零的点，但本题只在满足 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4x^2+y^2=1</annotation></semantics></math> 的曲线上直接计算，分母始终非零。</p>\n<h4>第一步：用约束将原式拆开</h4>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\oint_L(-y\\,dx+x\\,dy+z\\,dz).</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\oint_L(-y\\,dx+x\\,dy)+\\oint_Lz\\,dz.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>后一项为全微分：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\,dz=d\\left(\\frac{z^2}{2}\\right).</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>曲线闭合，起终点相同，因此</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oint_Lz\\,dz=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>第二步：给投影椭圆选正确方向的参数</h4>\n<p>从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 轴正向看为逆时针，意味着在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xOy</annotation></semantics></math> 面上的椭圆投影也按逆时针绕行。可取</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=\\frac12\\cos t,\\qquad y=\\sin t,\\qquad0\\le t\\le2\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>平面约束会给出</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=1-2x-y=1-\\cos t-\\sin t.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>由于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\,dz</annotation></semantics></math> 已经处理完，实际不必再求 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dz</annotation></semantics></math>。其余微分为</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx=-\\frac12\\sin t\\,dt,\\qquad dy=\\cos t\\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>第三步：代入并逐项相加</h4>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-y\\,dx=\\frac12\\sin^2t\\,dt,</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\,dy=\\frac12\\cos^2t\\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-y\\,dx+x\\,dy=\\frac12\\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\frac12\\int_0^{2\\pi}dt=\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>另一种有价值的核对：投影上用格林</h4>\n<p>剩余积分不再含 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>，直接视为平面椭圆上的积分。取 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=-y</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=x</annotation></semantics></math>，有 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x-P_y=1-(-1)=2</annotation></semantics></math>。椭圆半轴长为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/2</annotation></semantics></math>、1，面积为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi/2</annotation></semantics></math>，所以</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=2\\cdot\\frac\\pi2=\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p><strong>复盘：</strong>三维曲线不代表每次都要用空间定理；约束化简后可能只剩一个平面面积。若绕行方向反过来，第一项变号，而闭路全微分仍为零。</p>","figureImages":["assets/fd6d4dca1ad9da0d7d.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/f53756d79be8862d99.webp","assets/1d9724f1eae4d4d09b.webp"]},{"id":"E7","source":"E","page":8,"label":"例7｜p.8—10","title":"闭曲线积分等式及下界","method":"格林＋交换x,y＋两式平均＋指数不等式；第08节。","module":"green","nodeIds":["s8-0","s8-3"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["正方形的正向边界是逆时针；交换 x、y 后积分区域不变。图示对角线反射帮助理解为何两种指数积分相等。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>已知区域</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>π</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D=\\{(x,y):0\\le x\\le\\pi,\\ 0\\le y\\le\\pi\\},</annotation></semantics></math></span><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math> 的正向边界。证明：</p><p>（1）下列两个闭曲线积分相等：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oint_L xe^{\\sin y}\\,dy-ye^{-\\sin x}\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\oint_L xe^{-\\sin y}\\,dy-ye^{\\sin x}\\,dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>（2）</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oint_L xe^{\\sin y}\\,dy-ye^{-\\sin x}\\,dx\\ge2\\pi^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span>","solutionHtml":"<h4>选法：先格林转区域，再利用对称与平均</h4>\n<p>边界 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 已明确是正向，所有系数均光滑，因此可直接用格林公式。题目要求的是等式和下界，不需要算出指数积分的具体数值。下面把两个闭路积分分别记为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_+</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mo>−</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_-</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>\n<h4>第一步：分别计算格林公式中的偏导</h4>\n<p>对第一个积分，按 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Pdx+Qdy</annotation></semantics></math> 的顺序写：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=-ye^{-\\sin x},\\qquad Q=xe^{\\sin y}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x=e^{\\sin y},\\qquad P_y=-e^{-\\sin x}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>减去 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_y</annotation></semantics></math> 时负号变正号，因此</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_+=\\iint_D(e^{\\sin y}+e^{-\\sin x})\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>同样，对第二个积分有</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mo>−</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_-=\\iint_D(e^{-\\sin y}+e^{\\sin x})\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>第二步：证明两个积分相等</h4>\n<p>正方形区域 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le x,y\\le\\pi</annotation></semantics></math> 交换 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y</annotation></semantics></math> 后保持不变，所以</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_De^{\\sin y}\\,dx\\,dy=\\iint_De^{\\sin x}\\,dx\\,dy,</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_De^{-\\sin x}\\,dx\\,dy=\\iint_De^{-\\sin y}\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>把这两个等式相加便得到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mo>−</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_+=I_-</annotation></semantics></math>，完成第（1）问。这里是整个区域与微元在交换变量后不变，不是在每个点把 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sin x</annotation></semantics></math> 当作 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sin y</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>\n<h4>第三步：利用等式进行平均，制造正负指数配对</h4>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mo>−</mo></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_+=\\frac{I_++I_-}{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_+=\\frac12\\iint_D(e^{\\sin x}+e^{-\\sin x})\\,dx\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\quad+\\frac12\\iint_D(e^{\\sin y}+e^{-\\sin y})\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>对任意实数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math>，令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>u</mi></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=e^u&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>，由均值不等式</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a+\\frac1a\\ge2</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>得到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>u</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow></msup><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^u+e^{-u}\\ge2</annotation></semantics></math>。因此上述两组分别不小于 2：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo></msub><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_+\\ge\\frac12\\iint_D2\\,dx\\,dy+\\frac12\\iint_D2\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">area</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_+\\ge2\\operatorname{area}(D)=2\\pi^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>复盘：第（1）问为何能帮助第（2）问</h4>\n<p>直接观察原式时，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{\\sin y}</annotation></semantics></math> 与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{-\\sin x}</annotation></semantics></math> 的自变量不同，不方便在每一点配成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a+1/a</annotation></semantics></math>。先利用等式取平均，就把同一自变量的正负指数配在一起。这是考研证明题常见的“对称换元—两式平均—使用基本不等式”链条。不能因为区域面积是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi^2</annotation></semantics></math> 就直接写下界，必须先说明平均后的完整被积函数至少为 2。</p>","figureImages":["assets/e848754e54f049ecee.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/296994018dba4e9a46.webp","assets/065c08f2b292add3a2.webp","assets/58954ab274338b6df3.webp"]},{"id":"E8","source":"E","page":11,"label":"例8｜p.11—14","title":"闭曲线积分恒定反求函数","method":"拼接相减得右半平面闭路积分零，再偏导恒等比较；第11节。","module":"path","nodeIds":["s11-1"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["拓扑示意图：外闭路围住原点，右半平面内小闭路 C 不围住奇点。把闭路拼接并抵消共有段，才能从“所有围原点闭路积分相同”推出 C 上积分为零；图为示意闭路，不指定额外题设曲线。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>函数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varphi(y)</annotation></semantics></math> 具有连续导数。在围绕原点的任意分段光滑简单闭曲线 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 上，按一致正向取向时，积分</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oint_L\\frac{\\varphi(y)\\,dx+2xy\\,dy}{2x^2+y^4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>恒为同一常数。</p><p>（Ⅰ）证明：对右半平面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> 内任意分段光滑简单闭曲线 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math>，有</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>C</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oint_C\\frac{\\varphi(y)\\,dx+2xy\\,dy}{2x^2+y^4}=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>（Ⅱ）求 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varphi(y)</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>选法：把“所有围原点的积分相同”转成局部闭路为零</h4>\n<p>分母 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2x^2+y^4</annotation></semantics></math> 只在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 为零。不能对含原点的区域直接使用格林公式。第（Ⅰ）问的右半平面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> 没有奇点，命题的作用正是先得到这里的路径无关条件，再反求 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varphi</annotation></semantics></math>。比较闭曲线积分时，所有边界按一致正向取向。</p>\n<h4>第一步：解释拼接相减的证明</h4>\n<p>先设 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math> 按正向绕行，记它围成的区域为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_C</annotation></semantics></math>。它完全位于右半平面，与原点有正距离。在原点附近取一个小圆，再用一条不穿过 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math> 内部的窄通道连接小圆区域与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_C</annotation></semantics></math>。把连接后区域的外边界记为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_1</annotation></semantics></math>，小圆边界记为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_0</annotation></semantics></math>。两条边界都围住原点，所以按题设有</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mi>P</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mi>P</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oint_{L_1}P\\,dx+Q\\,dy=\\oint_{L_0}P\\,dx+Q\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>令通道宽度趋于零，通道两侧反向重合，其积分相互抵消；连接处去掉的小弧积分也趋于零。这些极限只发生在离原点有正距离、系数连续的地方。剩下的差恰为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math> 上的积分，故</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>C</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oint_CP\\,dx+Q\\,dy=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>若 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math> 取反向，积分只是变号，仍为零。这里</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=\\frac{\\varphi(y)}{2x^2+y^4},\\qquad Q=\\frac{2xy}{2x^2+y^4}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>第二步：从任意局部闭路为零得到偏导相等</h4>\n<p>在右半平面任取足够小的矩形，格林公式给出</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_D(Q_x-P_y)\\,dx\\,dy=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>由于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x-P_y</annotation></semantics></math> 连续，若它在某点非零，则附近保持同号，取一个小矩形后积分就不可能为零。因此在右半平面处处有 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_y=Q_x</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>\n<h4>第三步：完整算出两个偏导</h4>\n<p>记 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H=2x^2+y^4</annotation></semantics></math>。商法则给出</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>φ</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_y=\\frac{\\varphi'(y)H-4y^3\\varphi(y)}{H^2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x=\\frac{2yH-(2xy)(4x)}{H^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi></mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\frac{2y^5-4x^2y}{H^2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>两边分母相同，且 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>，约去后整理为关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2</annotation></semantics></math> 的恒等式：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>φ</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mi>φ</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2x^2\\varphi'(y)+y^4\\varphi'(y)-4y^3\\varphi(y)</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=-4x^2y+2y^5.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>第四步：恒等比较，确定积分常数</h4>\n<p>对每一个固定的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math>，上式对所有 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> 都成立，故 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2</annotation></semantics></math> 的系数相等：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>φ</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msup><mi>φ</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\varphi'(y)=-4y,\\qquad\\varphi'(y)=-2y.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varphi(y)=-y^2+C.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>再代入不含 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 的部分：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y^4(-2y)-4y^3(-y^2+C)=2y^5,</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-2y^5+4y^5-4Cy^3=2y^5,</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mtext>对所有 </mtext><mi>y</mi><mtext>成立</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-4Cy^3=0\\quad\\text{对所有 }y\\text{成立}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>例如取 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=1</annotation></semantics></math> 即得 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C=0</annotation></semantics></math>。所以</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varphi(y)=-y^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>复盘与易错点</h4>\n<p>关键步骤是“任意围原点闭路同值”经过拼接，转成“不围奇点的任意局部闭路为零”。不能一上来就说整个去心平面内路径无关；有奇点时，这种说法一般不成立。恒等比较时也不能只求出 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>φ</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varphi'=-2y</annotation></semantics></math> 就停止，常数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math> 必须代回另一组系数确定。</p>","figureImages":["assets/e46c315576aabab4c5.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/c8847cd069f3c23178.webp","assets/06f9c9229f7ce05b0a.webp","assets/b2d6d1d5787ae22ad8.webp","assets/880e75dcbae5d2e00c.webp"]},{"id":"E9","source":"E","page":15,"label":"例9｜p.15—18","title":"外法向导数的曲线积分","method":"法向转切向，格林变为二阶偏导之和的面积积分；第11节。","module":"green","nodeIds":["s11-3"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["单位圆外单位法向为 (x,y)，红箭头均从圆盘向外。若边界按逆时针行进，外法向对应 (dy/ds,−dx/ds)，用于把法向导数积分转成格林公式。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>计算</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\oint_L\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial n}\\,ds,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>L</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x,y)=(x-2)^2+y^2,\\qquad L:x^2+y^2=1,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol n</annotation></semantics></math> 为单位圆周的外单位法向量。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>选法：法向导数先展开，圆周上可直接用对称</h4>\n<p>这里 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol n</annotation></semantics></math> 是外单位法向量，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\partial f/\\partial n=\\nabla f\\cdot\\boldsymbol n</annotation></semantics></math>。单位圆上外单位法向量就是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math>，所以直接展开很短；若题目换成一般闭曲线，则“法向转切向—格林公式”更有通用性。</p>\n<h4>方法一：单位法向量与奇偶对称</h4>\n<p>先求梯度：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_x=2(x-2),\\qquad f_y=2y.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>单位圆上 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2=1</annotation></semantics></math>，故</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial n}=2(x-2)x+2y\\cdot y</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=2(x^2+y^2)-4x=2-4x.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>曲线关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 轴对称，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds</annotation></semantics></math> 在反射下不变，所以</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oint_Lx\\,ds=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>单位圆周长为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\pi</annotation></semantics></math>，因此</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=2\\oint_Lds-4\\oint_Lx\\,ds</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=2\\cdot2\\pi-0=4\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>方法二：外法向导数转为面积积分</h4>\n<p>给 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 临时指定逆时针方向。沿正向边界，外单位法向量满足</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol n\\,ds=(dy,-dx).</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>例如在圆的最右点，逆时针切向朝上，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dy&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>，上式的法向朝右，确为外法向。因此</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\oint_Lf_x\\,dy-f_y\\,dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>按 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=-f_y</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=f_x</annotation></semantics></math> 套格林：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_{x^2+y^2\\le1}(f_{xx}+f_{yy})\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{xx}=2,\\qquad f_{yy}=2.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=4\\cdot\\pi=4\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>复盘：外法向与曲线方向的区别</h4>\n<p>题目本身是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds</annotation></semantics></math> 型积分，外法向已经给定，改变参数绕行方向不会改变原积分。使用第二种方法时，逆时针是为了配合 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol n ds=(dy,-dx)</annotation></semantics></math>；如果改成顺时针，这个关系需要相应改号。常见错误是把外法向写成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-dy,dx)</annotation></semantics></math>，导致整个答案变成负号。</p>","figureImages":["assets/04beab162a66dc47b0.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/bf62088696bc2e3cbf.webp","assets/9c7a4a9ae84c9b1f73.webp","assets/a9db6d0c6531387544.webp","assets/905d3170337ed9764e.webp"]},{"id":"E10","source":"E","page":19,"label":"例10｜p.19—21","title":"锥面薄片的投影与质量","method":"消去z得偏心圆；密度与面积元同时代入；第12节。","module":"surface1","nodeIds":["s22-1","s12-1","s17-0"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["圆锥有限面片的投影为 (x−1)²+y²≤1，极坐标上界 r=2cosθ，−π/2≤θ≤π/2。蓝线为真实空间交线，灰虚线为偏心圆投影。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>薄片型物体 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math> 是圆锥面</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>被柱面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z^2=2x</annotation></semantics></math> 割下的有限部分，面密度为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu(x,y,z)=9\\sqrt{x^2+y^2+z^2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>记圆锥面与柱面的交线为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><p>（Ⅰ）求 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math> 在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xOy</annotation></semantics></math> 面上的投影曲线方程；（Ⅱ）求 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math> 的质量 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>选法：先消元找偏心投影，再把面密度与面积元统一</h4>\n<p>曲面是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}</annotation></semantics></math>，投影到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xOy</annotation></semantics></math> 面后面积元只有一个常数因子，适合直接求质量。柱面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z^2=2x</annotation></semantics></math> 与锥面联立后，投影会变成偏心圆，不能套原点圆盘的极坐标上下限。</p>\n<h4>第一步：求交线的投影与积分区域</h4>\n<p>在交线上同时有 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z^2=x^2+y^2</annotation></semantics></math> 和 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z^2=2x</annotation></semantics></math>，所以</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2=2x,</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x-1)^2+y^2=1.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>这就是投影曲线方程。有限曲面片对应圆盘内部：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D=\\{(x,y):(x-1)^2+y^2\\le1\\}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>引入极坐标 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=r\\cos\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=r\\sin\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>，圆盘不等式变成</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^2\\le2r\\cos\\theta.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math> 下写为</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\frac\\pi2\\le\\theta\\le\\frac\\pi2,\\qquad0\\le r\\le2\\cos\\theta.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>第二步：计算曲面面积元</h4>\n<p>在锥面上 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=r</annotation></semantics></math>。除顶点外，</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_x=\\frac xr,\\qquad z_y=\\frac yr.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS=\\sqrt{1+z_x^2+z_y^2}\\,dx\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\sqrt{1+\\frac{x^2+y^2}{r^2}}\\,dx\\,dy=\\sqrt2\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>顶点是孤立点，可先删去小邻域再取极限，不影响下述有限质量积分。</p>\n<h4>第三步：把密度也用 r 表示</h4>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu=9\\sqrt{x^2+y^2+z^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=9\\sqrt{r^2+r^2}=9\\sqrt2\\,r.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>质量为面密度乘面积元，因此两个 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt2</annotation></semantics></math> 相乘：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>S</mi></msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M=\\iint_S\\mu\\,dS=18\\iint_Dr\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>第四步：计算径向和角向积分</h4>\n<p>再使用极坐标的平面面积微元 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx\\,dy=r\\,dr\\,d\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></msubsup><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M=18\\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}\\int_0^{2\\cos\\theta}r^2\\,dr\\,d\\theta.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></msubsup><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_0^{2\\cos\\theta}r^2\\,dr=\\frac{8}{3}\\cos^3\\theta.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M=48\\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}\\cos^3\\theta\\,d\\theta.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=\\sin\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>，则 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">du=\\cos\\theta\\,d\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>，上下限由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\pi/2,\\pi/2</annotation></semantics></math> 变为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1,1</annotation></semantics></math>：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}\\cos^3\\theta\\,d\\theta=\\int_{-1}^1(1-u^2)\\,du</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\left[u-\\frac{u^3}{3}\\right]_{-1}^1=\\frac43.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>64.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M=48\\cdot\\frac43=64.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>复盘与易错点</h4>\n<p>本题有三种不同来源的因子：面密度给 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9\\sqrt2r</annotation></semantics></math>，曲面面积元给 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt2</annotation></semantics></math>，极坐标平面面积元再给一个 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math>。最终径向被积函数是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>18</mn><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">18r^2</annotation></semantics></math>。另外，圆盘中心为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,0)</annotation></semantics></math>，其极径上限是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\cos\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>，不是常数 1。</p>","figureImages":["assets/5cbcaade363695f485.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/34fb12d4c23036cc96.webp","assets/4ea8ceceed96ca7da7.webp","assets/d7de9abd733f184a40.webp"]},{"id":"E11","source":"E","page":22,"label":"例11｜p.22—25","title":"切平面垂直条件与隐曲面积分","method":"F_z=0定轮廓；隐函数面积元与原根式抵消；第13节。","module":"surface1","nodeIds":["s22-2","s13"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["轨迹 C 满足 2z−y=0，是上、下两支图形的分界。图示上支 z=y/2+√(1−x²−3y²/4)，投影椭圆 x²+3y²/4≤1。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>点 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math> 在椭球面</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S:x^2+y^2+z^2-yz=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>上运动。若 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math> 在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math> 处的切平面与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xOy</annotation></semantics></math> 面垂直，求 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math> 的轨迹 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math>，并计算</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_\\Sigma\\frac{(x+\\sqrt3)|y-2z|}{\\sqrt{4+y^2+z^2-4yz}}\\,dS,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math> 是椭球面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math> 位于曲线 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math> 上方的部分。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>选法：切平面条件找轮廓，隐函数面积元消根式</h4>\n<p>题目把几何条件、隐函数曲面与根式放在一起，通常不是让我们显式求出复杂的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_x,z_y</annotation></semantics></math> 后硬算。先设水平集函数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math>，用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_z</annotation></semantics></math> 判断切平面，再利用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\nabla F|/|F_z|</annotation></semantics></math> 写面积元，恰能与题中分式抵消。</p>\n<h4>第一步：把“切平面垂直”变成法向量条件</h4>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(x,y,z)=x^2+y^2+z^2-yz-1.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla F=(2x,2y-z,2z-y).</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>椭球切平面的法向为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla F</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xOy</annotation></semantics></math> 面的法向为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0,1)</annotation></semantics></math>。两平面垂直意味着两法向量垂直，故</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla F\\cdot(0,0,1)=2z-y=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=\\frac y2.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>代回椭球：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2+\\frac{y^2}{4}-\\frac{y^2}{2}=1,</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+\\frac34y^2=1.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>因此轨迹是空间椭圆</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>:</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C:\\quad z=\\frac y2,\\qquad x^2+\\frac34y^2=1.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>第二步：确定“上方部分”的表达式与投影</h4>\n<p>把椭球方程视为关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 的二次方程：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z^2-yz+(x^2+y^2-1)=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>±</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=\\frac{y\\pm\\sqrt{4-4x^2-3y^2}}{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>上方部分取加号，满足 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2z-y\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math>。根式非负要求</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D:\\quad x^2+\\frac34y^2\\le1.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>注意这里“上方”是相对于轮廓 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=y/2</annotation></semantics></math>，不能简单改成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>\n<h4>第三步：计算隐函数曲面面积元</h4>\n<p>在投影内部 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_z\\ne0</annotation></semantics></math>，由隐函数求导</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_x=-\\frac{F_x}{F_z},\\qquad z_y=-\\frac{F_y}{F_z}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mrow><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></msqrt><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS=\\frac{\\sqrt{F_x^2+F_y^2+F_z^2}}{|F_z|}\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>展开分子平方：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_x^2+F_y^2+F_z^2</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=4x^2+(2y-z)^2+(2z-y)^2</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=4x^2+5y^2+5z^2-8yz.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>用椭球方程 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2=1-y^2-z^2+yz</annotation></semantics></math> 消去 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2</annotation></semantics></math>：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_x^2+F_y^2+F_z^2=4+y^2+z^2-4yz.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>所以</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></msqrt><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS=\\frac{\\sqrt{4+y^2+z^2-4yz}}{|2z-y|}\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>第四步：相消后计算椭圆上的普通二重积分</h4>\n<p>题中分子的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|y-2z|</annotation></semantics></math> 与面积元分母完全相同，两个根式也相同，故</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_D(x+\\sqrt3)\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>区域关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 轴对称，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 项积分为零。椭圆半轴长为 1、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2/\\sqrt3</annotation></semantics></math>，因此</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">area</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{area}(D)=\\frac{2\\pi}{\\sqrt3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\sqrt3\\cdot\\frac{2\\pi}{\\sqrt3}=2\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>条件与易错点</h4>\n<p>在轮廓边界 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_z=0</annotation></semantics></math>，上式的图形面积元不能直接逐点使用；可先在内部积分，再向边界取极限。抵消后的被积函数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x+\\sqrt3</annotation></semantics></math> 连续，所得积分有限。第一类曲面积分没有上下侧符号，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|F_z|</annotation></semantics></math> 不能凭“取上方”就随意去掉或添负号。</p>","figureImages":["assets/53ff1ec2901b958d08.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/be2f9c281aeff628d6.webp","assets/943bccfeb9ec1e8071.webp","assets/d61925109c4c418779.webp","assets/a8b5282e22f390186a.webp"]},{"id":"E12","source":"E","page":26,"label":"例12｜p.26—29","title":"球面片上的混合通量","method":"合一投影到偏心圆盘，先代球面关系；边界奇点/退化见第19节。","module":"surface2","nodeIds":["s22-1","s14-1"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["上半球面片投到偏心圆盘 (x−1)²+y²≤1；蓝线为交线，上侧即外侧。边界点 (2,0,0) 处投影退化，原点的系数也需按题后条件说明理解。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>计算</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_\\Sigma\\frac{x^2+y^2}{x}\\,dy\\,dz</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\quad+\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}\\,dz\\,dx+z\\,dx\\,dy,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math> 为上半球面</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>z</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2+z^2=4,\\qquad z\\ge0,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>被柱面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x-1)^2+y^2=1</annotation></semantics></math> 所截得部分的上侧。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>选法：上半球合一投影，先合并三项再用对称</h4>\n<p>三个微分项都出现在同一球面片上，投影到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xOy</annotation></semantics></math> 面最方便。球面恒等式会把 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^2+z^2</annotation></semantics></math> 合成常数 4。原系数在个别边界点未定义，下面按删去相应边界点后取极限的曲面积分理解，并在最后检查极限有限。</p>\n<h4>第一步：找曲面与投影区域</h4>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2},\\qquad z=\\sqrt{4-r^2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>柱面截得的内部部分投影为</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D:(x-1)^2+y^2\\le1.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>极坐标下 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^2\\le2r\\cos\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>，故</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\frac\\pi2\\le\\theta\\le\\frac\\pi2,\\qquad0\\le r\\le2\\cos\\theta.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>这是偏心圆盘，不是球的整个赤道圆盘。</p>\n<h4>第二步：由上侧方向确定三项有向面积元</h4>\n<p>在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> 处，</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_x=-\\frac xz,\\qquad z_y=-\\frac yz.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>对上侧，投影公式为</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dy\\,dz=-z_x\\,dx\\,dy=\\frac xz\\,dx\\,dy,</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dz\\,dx=-z_y\\,dx\\,dy=\\frac yz\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>最后一项 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math> 直接取正号。于是三项分别变为</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{r^2}{x}\\,dy\\,dz=\\frac{r^2}{z}\\,dx\\,dy,</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r\\,dz\\,dx=\\frac{ry}{z}\\,dx\\,dy,</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\,dx\\,dy=z\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>第三步：利用球面方程与奇偶性</h4>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_D\\left(\\frac{r^2}{z}+\\frac{ry}{z}+z\\right)dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>把第一项和第三项通分：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{r^2}{z}+z=\\frac{r^2+z^2}{z}=\\frac4z.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>而 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math> 关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 轴对称，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y\\to-y</annotation></semantics></math> 下不变，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ry/z</annotation></semantics></math> 变号，所以这部分积分为零：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=4\\iint_D\\frac{dx\\,dy}{\\sqrt{4-r^2}}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>第四步：先算径向积分</h4>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></msubsup><mfrac><mi>r</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=4\\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}\\int_0^{2\\cos\\theta}\\frac{r}{\\sqrt{4-r^2}}\\,dr\\,d\\theta.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=4-r^2</annotation></semantics></math>，则 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">du=-2r\\,dr</annotation></semantics></math>。因此</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mi>r</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int\\frac{r}{\\sqrt{4-r^2}}\\,dr=-\\sqrt{4-r^2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></msubsup><mfrac><mi>r</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_0^{2\\cos\\theta}\\frac{r}{\\sqrt{4-r^2}}\\,dr</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=2-\\sqrt{4-4\\cos^2\\theta}=2-2|\\sin\\theta|.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>根号给出的是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2|\\sin\\theta|</annotation></semantics></math>，不能在整个 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[-\\pi/2,\\pi/2]</annotation></semantics></math> 上直接写成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\sin\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>\n<h4>第五步：用偶性去掉绝对值并算出结果</h4>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=8\\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}(1-|\\sin\\theta|)\\,d\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=16\\int_0^{\\pi/2}(1-\\sin\\theta)\\,d\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=16\\left[\\theta+\\cos\\theta\\right]_0^{\\pi/2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>16.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=16\\left(\\frac\\pi2-1\\right)=8\\pi-16.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>边界条件的准确解释</h4>\n<p>投影原点对应的曲面点是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0,2)</annotation></semantics></math>，不是空间原点。在该点 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x^2+y^2)/x</annotation></semantics></math> 未定义；但在圆盘内部有 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^2\\le2x</annotation></semantics></math>，从而该系数在删点区域内有界。另一个特殊点是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(2,0,0)</annotation></semantics></math>：此处 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=0</annotation></semantics></math>，球面本身光滑，但投影表示的面积元退化。</p>\n<p>上述径向积分在上限趋近 2 时仍有限，说明 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\sqrt{4-r^2}</annotation></semantics></math> 在这个区域可积。含 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ry</annotation></semantics></math> 的项也可由常数倍的该函数控制，因此对称消去和极限计算有依据。答案 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8\\pi-16</annotation></semantics></math> 是这一删点取极限解释下的值，不应同时宣称原系数在整个闭曲面片上连续。</p>","figureImages":["assets/c3af1d0684382e58cc.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/781cb2a365e1c1ea99.webp","assets/6881a7c44b2388bc0c.webp","assets/9a6cdd010ccbc5d34a.webp","assets/d4fda29efaf99a15d5.webp"]},{"id":"E13","source":"E","page":30,"label":"例13｜p.30—32","title":"锥面环带与连续抽象函数","method":"下侧法向点乘消f；题干2xy与解式2x不一致，两版本分开；第14、19节。","module":"surface2","nodeIds":["s22-3","s14-1","s14-2"],"correction":"原题与原解不一致：题干含 2xy，而原解按 2x 计算。依题干版本结果为 0；按原解版本为 14π/3。请勿混记。","figureCaptions":["圆锥环带的上下边界分别为 r=z=1 与 r=z=2。下侧可取面积向量方向 (x/r,y/r,−1)；抽象项与该法向点乘后消去。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>设 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math> 为圆锥面环带的下侧：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>4.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2},\\qquad1\\le x^2+y^2\\le4.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math> 为连续函数。按原题题干计算</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_\\Sigma[xf(xy)+2xy-y]\\,dy\\,dz</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\quad+[yf(xy)+2y+x]\\,dz\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\quad+[zf(xy)+z]\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>","solutionHtml":"<h4>先核对题干：2xy 与 2x 是两个不同版本</h4>\n<p>原题的第一项是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xf(xy)+2xy-y</annotation></semantics></math>，而原讲义后续解式改用了 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xf(xy)+2x-y</annotation></semantics></math>。不能把后者的答案套到前者。本解析先严格按题干中的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2xy</annotation></semantics></math> 计算，再说明另一版本为何得到不同结果。</p>\n<h4>选法：下侧合一投影，直接消去连续抽象函数</h4>\n<p>题目只给 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math> 连续，不能擅自对它求导。锥面上的法向关系可以让含 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math> 的部分逐点消失，因此直接投影比补面用高斯更稳妥。</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2},\\qquad z=r,\\qquad1\\le r\\le2.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>因远离锥顶，曲面在本题区域内光滑。投影区域为整圆环</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>4.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D:\\quad1\\le x^2+y^2\\le4.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>第一步：写清下侧的三个有向面积元</h4>\n<p>上侧的向量面积元为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-z_x,-z_y,1)dx\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math>。题目取下侧，三项整体变号：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(dy\\,dz,dz\\,dx,dx\\,dy)</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\left(\\frac xr,\\frac yr,-1\\right)dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>特别是最后的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math> 项要带负号。</p>\n<h4>第二步：把各项完整代入，先消抽象部分</h4>\n<p>含 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(xy)</annotation></semantics></math> 的部分系数为</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{x^2}{r}+\\frac{y^2}{r}-z</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\frac{x^2+y^2}{r}-r=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>这是逐点恒等于零，不依赖对称性，也不要求 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math> 可导。</p>\n<p>剩余部分为</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_D\\left[\\frac{(2xy-y)x}{r}+\\frac{(2y+x)y}{r}-r\\right]dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>逐项展开：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi></mrow><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{(2xy-y)x}{r}=\\frac{2x^2y}{r}-\\frac{xy}{r},</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{(2y+x)y}{r}=\\frac{2y^2}{r}+\\frac{xy}{r}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>两项 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xy/r</annotation></semantics></math> 相消，得到</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi></mrow><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_D\\left(\\frac{2x^2y}{r}+\\frac{2y^2}{r}-r\\right)dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>第三步：分别处理奇项与轮换平均项</h4>\n<p>第一项关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 为奇函数，而圆环关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 轴对称，故</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi></mrow><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_D\\frac{2x^2y}{r}\\,dx\\,dy=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>由于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math> 在交换 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y</annotation></semantics></math> 后不变，</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_D\\frac{x^2}{r}\\,dx\\,dy=\\iint_D\\frac{y^2}{r}\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>两式相加，分子变为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2=r^2</annotation></semantics></math>，所以</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\iint_D\\frac{y^2}{r}\\,dx\\,dy=\\iint_Dr\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>最后两部分抵消：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>另一版本：如果原意确实是 2x</h4>\n<p>若第一项改为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xf(xy)+2x-y</annotation></semantics></math>，按同样的下侧投影，非抽象部分变成</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{2x^2-xy}{r}+\\frac{2y^2+xy}{r}-r</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\frac{2(x^2+y^2)}r-r=r.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>此时才有</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>r</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\int_1^2r\\cdot r\\,dr\\,d\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=2\\pi\\left[\\frac{r^3}{3}\\right]_1^2</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>14</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=2\\pi\\cdot\\frac{8-1}{3}=\\frac{14\\pi}{3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>复盘与易错点</h4>\n<p>本题先核对文字版本，再看方向，再合并完整被积函数，最后用对称。题干的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2xy</annotation></semantics></math> 版本答案是 0；原解的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2x</annotation></semantics></math> 版本答案是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>14</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">14\\pi/3</annotation></semantics></math>。不能省略 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math> 的下侧负号，也不能因为含有未知函数就把它当作常数或额外假设可导。</p>","figureImages":["assets/5367f773f9fb922576.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/8f3116c2c107f794a6.webp","assets/3c21874cf9f38a919a.webp","assets/935d399a5d791d958a.webp"]},{"id":"E14","source":"E","page":33,"label":"例14｜p.33—34","title":"含绝对值的抛物面通量","method":"合一投影或转第一类，完整被积函数关于x为奇；第14节。","module":"surface2","nodeIds":["s6-0","s14-1","s14-3"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["原抛物面取下侧，法向为 (2x,2y,−1)。将 z=x²+y² 连同法向因素一起代入后，再利用关于 x 的奇偶对称；不要只看原系数的绝对值。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>计算</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>S</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_S|x|y^2z\\,dy\\,dz</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\quad+xy^3z\\,dz\\,dx+|y|xz^2\\,dx\\,dy,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math> 为抛物面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=x^2+y^2</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\le1</annotation></semantics></math> 的下侧。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>选法：先统一为平面被积函数，再判奇偶</h4>\n<p>有绝对值时，单看 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|x|y^2z</annotation></semantics></math> 的奇偶性是不够的，因为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dy\\,dz</annotation></semantics></math> 投影时还会乘一个含 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 的法向分量。这里不需要把所有多项式积分算完，只要正确合一投影，就能发现完整被积函数关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 为奇。</p>\n<h4>第一步：明确投影区域与下侧方向</h4>\n<p>曲面为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=x^2+y^2</annotation></semantics></math>，且 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\le1</annotation></semantics></math>，所以</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D:\\quad x^2+y^2\\le1.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>求偏导：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_x=2x,\\qquad z_y=2y.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>上侧的向量面积元为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-2x,-2y,1)dx\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math>。题目取下侧，因此</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(dy\\,dz,dz\\,dx,dx\\,dy)</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=(2x,2y,-1)\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>第二步：分别代入三个微分项</h4>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|x|y^2z\\,dy\\,dz=2x|x|y^2z\\,dx\\,dy,</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xy^3z\\,dz\\,dx=2xy^4z\\,dx\\,dy,</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|y|xz^2\\,dx\\,dy=-|y|xz^2\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>合并得到</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\" maxsize=\"1.2em\" minsize=\"1.2em\" stretchy=\"true\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\" maxsize=\"1.2em\" minsize=\"1.2em\" stretchy=\"true\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_D\\bigl(2x|x|y^2z+2xy^4z-|y|xz^2\\bigr)dx\\,dy,</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>其中每个 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 都应理解为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2</annotation></semantics></math>，不是独立变量。</p>\n<h4>第三步：逐项检查 x 变号后的变化</h4>\n<p>当 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\to-x</annotation></semantics></math> 时，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|x|</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y^2</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y^4</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|y|</annotation></semantics></math> 和 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=x^2+y^2</annotation></semantics></math> 均不变；三个项中各自保留了一个变号的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math>。所以三项都变号，完整被积函数为关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 的奇函数。</p>\n<p>又因为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math> 关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 轴对称，左右两半圆盘的贡献成对抵消：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>本质与易错点</h4>\n<p>第二类曲面积分的对称性必须同时考虑场、法向和曲面。把它投影后，方向信息已经进入普通二重积分，此时再判断奇偶最安全。如果取成上侧，三个项整体反号，但本题结果仍为零；这种巧合不能用来掩盖方向处理错误，换一个不为零的被积函数就会出错。</p>","figureImages":["assets/ded77a822719f50f21.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/b546f79f0307ea437d.webp","assets/abef4b0ebe64c4c74b.webp"]},{"id":"E15","source":"E","page":35,"label":"例15｜p.35—36","title":"偏心球面多项式通量","method":"高斯后用球体形心算一阶矩；第15节。","module":"gauss","nodeIds":["s15-0","s15-3"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["偏心球体形心在球心 (a,b,c)。示意取半径 1、任意偏移球心；高斯公式后的 x、y、z 一阶体积矩分别等于球心坐标乘体积。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math> 是球面</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x-a)^2+(y-b)^2+(z-c)^2=r^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>的外侧。计算</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∯</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\oiint_\\Sigma x^2\\,dy\\,dz+y^2\\,dz\\,dx+z^2\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>","solutionHtml":"<h4>选法：封闭外侧先高斯，一阶矩用球体中心</h4>\n<p>曲面封闭且取外侧，场的三个分量 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2,y^2,z^2</annotation></semantics></math> 都是多项式，在球体及边界上连续可微，满足高斯公式条件。若直接对球面参数化，会增加三角函数运算；高斯后只剩三个一阶矩。</p>\n<h4>第一步：明确向量场并算散度</h4>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol F=(x^2,y^2,z^2).</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{div}\\boldsymbol F=\\frac{\\partial x^2}{\\partial x}+\\frac{\\partial y^2}{\\partial y}+\\frac{\\partial z^2}{\\partial z}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{div}\\boldsymbol F=2x+2y+2z.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>设 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math> 为球面围成的球体，高斯公式给出</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=2\\iiint_\\Omega(x+y+z)\\,dv.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>第二步：为什么 x 的积分等于球心坐标乘体积</h4>\n<p>引入平移后的变量</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X=x-a,\\qquad Y=y-b,\\qquad Z=z-c.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>区域变成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>Y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>Z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X^2+Y^2+Z^2\\le r^2</annotation></semantics></math>，关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X=0</annotation></semantics></math> 对称，因此 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∭</mo><mi>X</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iiint X\\,dV=0</annotation></semantics></math>。又 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=X+a</annotation></semantics></math>，故</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iiint_\\Omega x\\,dv=\\iiint_\\Omega(X+a)\\,dv</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Vol</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=0+a\\operatorname{Vol}(\\Omega).</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>同理，</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Vol</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iiint_\\Omega y\\,dv=b\\operatorname{Vol}(\\Omega),</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Vol</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iiint_\\Omega z\\,dv=c\\operatorname{Vol}(\\Omega).</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>这就是球体形心在球心的积分表达，不需要分别重算三个三重积分。</p>\n<h4>第三步：代入体积并整理系数</h4>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Vol</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{Vol}(\\Omega)=\\frac43\\pi r^3.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=2(a+b+c)\\cdot\\frac43\\pi r^3</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\frac{8\\pi r^3}{3}(a+b+c).</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>复盘与易错点</h4>\n<p>只有平移后的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X,Y,Z</annotation></semantics></math> 的积分因奇偶性为零；原坐标 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y,z</annotation></semantics></math> 的积分一般不为零。题目中的球心不是固定在原点，若直接说“球体对称，所以三个积分都是零”，就把对称中心弄错了。若曲面改取内侧，最终答案应整体变号。</p>","figureImages":["assets/82556deeafd9567b28.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/402d053e3b691a744a.webp","assets/73a69e1500404580c1.webp"]},{"id":"E16","source":"E","page":37,"label":"例16｜p.37—39","title":"球壳锥域与抽象函数抵消","method":"意图为高斯＋球坐标，但y=0处条件不足；不能无条件照搬答案；第19节。","module":"gauss","nodeIds":["s4-0"],"correction":"系数 f(y/z)/y 在 y=0 处可能无定义。题设“f 具有连续导数”不足以直接使用高斯公式。下方将原题条件不足与补足条件后的计算明确分开。","figureCaptions":["原讲义取两球面间、圆锥内部的壳状锥域：球坐标 1≤ρ≤2、0≤φ≤π/4。几何范围并不能消除 y=0 的系数问题，是否可用高斯公式还需阅读解答中的条件核对。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>设 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(u)</annotation></semantics></math> 具有连续导数，原题要求计算</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∯</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\oiint_\\Sigma x^3\\,dy\\,dz</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mi>f</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\quad+\\left[\\frac1z f\\!\\left(\\frac yz\\right)+y^3\\right]dz\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>y</mi></mfrac><mi>f</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\quad+\\left[\\frac1y f\\!\\left(\\frac yz\\right)+z^3\\right]dx\\,dy,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math> 是圆锥面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}</annotation></semantics></math> 与球面</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2+z^2=1,\\qquad x^2+y^2+z^2=4</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>所围成立体表面的外侧；原讲义取圆锥内部、两球面之间的部分。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>先判断题目条件：一般情况下不能直接给出一个定值</h4>\n<p>原题只给 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math> 有连续导数，但第三个系数含 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(y/z)/y</annotation></semantics></math>。区域中存在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=0</annotation></semantics></math> 的曲面点和内部点，仅有 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math> 可导并不能自动消除分母。高斯公式要求向量场在所用区域及边界附近满足相应光滑性条件，这一步不能跳过。</p>\n<h4>第一步：用一个具体函数看出问题</h4>\n<p>取 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≡</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(u)\\equiv1</annotation></semantics></math>。它当然具有连续导数，但此时</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>y</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=\\frac1z+y^3,\\qquad R=\\frac1y+z^3.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=0</annotation></semantics></math> 处，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math> 未定义。球面片上有一整段这样的点，附近的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/y</annotation></semantics></math> 项一般产生正、负两侧各自发散的积分。即使对称截断后可以讨论某种主值，也不能把它当作考研中通常意义的曲面积分，更不能无条件使用经典高斯公式。</p>\n<p><strong>所以，按原题现有条件，“任意这样的 f 都有同一个普通积分值”并不成立。</strong>以下计算只是解释原讲义的命题意图：额外假设该场能在闭区域上作满足高斯公式条件的光滑延拓。</p>\n<h4>第二步：在补足条件后逐项算散度</h4>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=x^3.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=\\frac1z f\\left(\\frac yz\\right)+y^3.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>y</mi></mfrac><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R=\\frac1y f\\left(\\frac yz\\right)+z^3.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y\\ne0</annotation></semantics></math> 的地方，</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_x=3x^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>对 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math> 求 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 偏导时，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 当常数：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><msup><mi>f</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_y=\\frac1{z^2}f'\\left(\\frac yz\\right)+3y^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>对 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math> 求 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 偏导时，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 当常数，链式法则给</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial z}\\left(\\frac yz\\right)=-\\frac y{z^2},</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><msup><mi>f</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_z=-\\frac1{z^2}f'\\left(\\frac yz\\right)+3z^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>抽象函数的两项严格相消，得到</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_x+Q_y+R_z=3(x^2+y^2+z^2).</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>若所假设的光滑延拓存在，散度在删点处也由连续性取上述表达式。</p>\n<h4>第三步：确定球坐标范围</h4>\n<p>按原讲义取圆锥内部、两球面之间的部分。球坐标中的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math> 是到原点的距离，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi</annotation></semantics></math> 是与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 轴正向的夹角：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=\\rho\\sin\\phi\\cos\\theta,</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\rho\\sin\\phi\\sin\\theta,\\qquad z=\\rho\\cos\\phi.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>两个球面给 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\le\\rho\\le2</annotation></semantics></math>。锥面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}</annotation></semantics></math> 给 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos\\phi=\\sin\\phi</annotation></semantics></math>，即 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi=\\pi/4</annotation></semantics></math>。锥内靠近正 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 轴的部分为</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le\\phi\\le\\frac\\pi4,\\qquad0\\le\\theta\\le2\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>第四步：在额外条件成立时计算通量</h4>\n<p>取外侧，高斯公式外不加负号。再用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>ρ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>ϕ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dv=\\rho^2\\sin\\phi\\,d\\rho\\,d\\phi\\,d\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>ρ</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>ϕ</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=3\\int_1^2\\rho^4\\,d\\rho\\int_0^{\\pi/4}\\sin\\phi\\,d\\phi\\int_0^{2\\pi}d\\theta.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>32</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>31</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_1^2\\rho^4\\,d\\rho=\\frac{32-1}{5}=\\frac{31}{5}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_0^{\\pi/4}\\sin\\phi\\,d\\phi=1-\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>31</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=3\\cdot\\frac{31}{5}\\cdot\\left(1-\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}\\right)\\cdot2\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>93</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\frac{93\\pi}{5}(2-\\sqrt2).</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>结论应怎样写才准确</h4>\n<p>原题条件不足，不能无条件得到此数值。若额外保证场在闭区域上光滑延拓，则通量等于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>93</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">93\\pi(2-\\sqrt2)/5</annotation></semantics></math>。例如 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(u)=u</annotation></semantics></math> 时，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(y/z)/y</annotation></semantics></math> 可延拓为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/z</annotation></semantics></math>，而本区域有 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\ge1/\\sqrt2&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>，此时原讲义的计算确实适用。考研中应保留这种条件检查，不能因形式上的导数相消就忽略场本身未定义。</p>","figureImages":["assets/ea28ba1f9a548f2fa9.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/48761eb8bbeb79f36b.webp","assets/628be54819bf4416d2.webp","assets/03dec4c04a71fa0d18.webp"]},{"id":"E17","source":"E","page":40,"label":"例17｜p.40—43","title":"开放空间半圆环流","method":"补直线段，选平面z=x，按右手规则取下侧；第16节。","module":"stokes","nodeIds":["s16-0","s16-1"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["原弧 A(0,√2,0)→B(0,−√2,0) 位于 x=z≥0。虚线补线为 B→A；配合边界方向的平面法向为 (1,0,−1)，即平面片的下侧。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>曲线 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 满足</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=\\sqrt{2-x^2-y^2},\\qquad z=x.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>起点为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(0,\\sqrt2,0)</annotation></semantics></math>，终点为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(0,-\\sqrt2,0)</annotation></semantics></math>。计算</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_L(y+z)\\,dx+(z^2-x^2+y)\\,dy+x^2y^2\\,dz.</annotation></semantics></math></span>","solutionHtml":"<h4>先看曲线：这是上半球和平面的交弧</h4>\n<p>由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=x</annotation></semantics></math> 和 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=\\sqrt{2-x^2-y^2}</annotation></semantics></math> 可得</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2x^2+y^2=2,\\qquad x=z\\ge0.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>所以曲线在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xOy</annotation></semantics></math> 面投影为椭圆右半弧，从上端 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,\\sqrt2)</annotation></semantics></math> 沿右侧走到下端 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,-\\sqrt2)</annotation></semantics></math>。先用曲线关系化简，直接计算会很短；斯托克斯法则适合复习“开放曲线补线与方向”。</p>\n<h4>方法一：先化简，拆掉两个全微分</h4>\n<p>在曲线上 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=x</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dz=dx</annotation></semantics></math>，且 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z^2-x^2=0</annotation></semantics></math>。原式变成</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_L(y+x)\\,dx+y\\,dy+x^2y^2\\,dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>分组：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_Ly\\,dx+\\int_L(x\\,dx+y\\,dy)+\\int_Lx^2y^2\\,dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>中间一项是全微分，两端均有 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2=2</annotation></semantics></math>，因此</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_L(x\\,dx+y\\,dy)=\\left[\\frac{x^2+y^2}{2}\\right]_A^B=1-1=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>最后一项利用椭圆关系 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y^2=2-2x^2</annotation></semantics></math>：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_Lx^2y^2\\,dx=\\int_L(2x^2-2x^4)\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\left[\\frac23x^3-\\frac25x^5\\right]_A^B=0-0=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>注意 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 在弧上先增后减，但全微分积分仍只取端点，不需要因此拆两段。</p>\n<p>剩下的积分取符合起终点的参数：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=\\sin t,\\quad y=\\sqrt2\\cos t,\\quad z=\\sin t,\\quad0\\le t\\le\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx=\\cos t\\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>π</mi></msubsup><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\sqrt2\\int_0^\\pi\\cos^2t\\,dt</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>π</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}\\int_0^\\pi(1+\\cos2t)\\,dt</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>π</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}\\left[t+\\frac12\\sin2t\\right]_0^\\pi=\\frac\\pi{\\sqrt2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>方法二：补直线段，完整使用斯托克斯</h4>\n<p>补上从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math> 到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math> 的直线段 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L'</annotation></semantics></math>：<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=z=0</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>→</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y:-\\sqrt2\\to\\sqrt2</annotation></semantics></math>。补线上的积分为</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><msup><mi>L</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></msub><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_{L'}y\\,dy=\\left[\\frac{y^2}{2}\\right]_{-\\sqrt2}^{\\sqrt2}=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>因此 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math> 等于闭路 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>L</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L+L'</annotation></semantics></math> 的积分。选平面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=x</annotation></semantics></math> 内的半椭圆片 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math>。投影边界为顺时针，按右手规则应取下侧：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d\\boldsymbol S=(1,0,-1)\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=y+z</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=z^2-x^2+y</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R=x^2y^2</annotation></semantics></math>。旋度三个分量为</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_y-Q_z=2x^2y-2z,</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_z-R_x=1-2xy^2,</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x-P_y=-2x-1.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>与下侧向量面积元点乘，并在平面上代入 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=x</annotation></semantics></math>：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(2x^2y-2x)\\cdot1+(-2x-1)(-1)=2x^2y+1.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>投影区域为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D:2x^2+y^2\\le2,\\ x\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math>，关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 轴对称，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2x^2y</annotation></semantics></math> 的积分为零。于是</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_D1\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>这是半轴长 1、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt2</annotation></semantics></math> 的椭圆的一半：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>π</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\frac12\\pi\\cdot1\\cdot\\sqrt2=\\frac\\pi{\\sqrt2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>复盘与易错点</h4>\n<p>直接法利用了曲线自身关系，通常最短。定理法必须交代补线、补线积分以及下侧法向，不能只因“从上往下看”就机械取上侧。最终 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\pi/\\sqrt2</annotation></semantics></math>，两种方法一致。</p>","figureImages":["assets/0b2059f594c3dd39d9.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/1d7f84248af2b877ac.webp","assets/aaadec871968f331a6.webp","assets/587117c86a30b99ef3.webp","assets/acb9d68e5a0fc43fd5.webp"]},{"id":"E18","source":"E","page":44,"label":"例18｜p.44—47","title":"八面体薄壳非均匀重心","method":"先判分子分母奇偶，再缩第一卦限三角面；面壳用dS；第17、19节。","module":"applications","nodeIds":["s22-4","s12-0","s17-0"],"correction":"原资料质量公式有笔误：这是面壳重心，质量与一阶矩都应使用面积微元 dS；请勿误用体积微元。","figureCaptions":["重画八面体薄壳，八个三角面几何全等。密度对 x、y 为偶但对 z 不完全对称，故重心在 z 轴正半轴；需要对曲面作质量与一阶矩积分。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>封闭曲面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math> 的方程为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|x|+|y|+|z|=1,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>面密度为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho=|x|+|z|+\\frac13z.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>求此曲面薄壳的重心。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>先纠正公式：这是薄壳重心，必须使用面积微元</h4>\n<p>原题给的是封闭曲面上的面密度，物体质量分布在八面体的表面。原讲义所列通用公式误用了体积分，本题应始终写 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS</annotation></semantics></math>：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>S</mi></msub><mi>ρ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>S</mi></msub><mi>z</mi><mi>ρ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><mi>M</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M=\\iint_S\\rho\\,dS,\\qquad\\bar z=\\frac{\\iint_Sz\\rho\\,dS}{M}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>同理计算 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar x,\\bar y</annotation></semantics></math>。密度 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|x|+|z|+z/3</annotation></semantics></math> 非负，且不是处处为零，因此质量为正。</p>\n<h4>第一步：分子、分母分别检查奇偶</h4>\n<p>八面体表面关于三个坐标面对称。密度关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 都为偶函数，所以 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\rho</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y\\rho</annotation></semantics></math> 分别为奇函数，得到</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar x=0,\\qquad\\bar y=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>质量分母中，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z/3</annotation></semantics></math> 为奇函数：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>S</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M=\\iint_S(|x|+|z|)\\,dS.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>重心的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 分子则为</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>S</mi></msub><mi>z</mi><mi>ρ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>S</mi></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_Sz\\rho\\,dS=\\iint_S\\left(z|x|+z|z|+\\frac13z^2\\right)dS.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>前两项关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 为奇，只有 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z^2/3</annotation></semantics></math> 留下：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>S</mi></msub><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_z=\\frac13\\iint_Sz^2\\,dS.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>不能因为密度含 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|z|</annotation></semantics></math> 就说整个密度关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 为偶；附加的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z/3</annotation></semantics></math> 正是重心向上偏移的来源。</p>\n<h4>第二步：缩到第一卦限的一个三角形面</h4>\n<p>令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math> 为第一卦限面片：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x+y+z=1,\\qquad x,y,z\\ge0.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>它是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=1-x-y</annotation></semantics></math> 的图形，投影三角域为</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D:\\quad0\\le x\\le1,\\qquad0\\le y\\le1-x.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS=\\sqrt{1+(-1)^2+(-1)^2}\\,dx\\,dy=\\sqrt3\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>另外七个面的绝对值积分与此面相同，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z^2</annotation></semantics></math> 积分也相同，故相关积分均可乘 8。</p>\n<h4>第三步：完整计算质量 M</h4>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>T</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_Tx\\,dS=\\sqrt3\\int_0^1\\int_0^{1-x}x\\,dy\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\sqrt3\\int_0^1x(1-x)\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\sqrt3\\left[\\frac{x^2}{2}-\\frac{x^3}{3}\\right]_0^1=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{6}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>同样，</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>T</mi></msub><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_Tz\\,dS=\\sqrt3\\int_0^1\\int_0^{1-x}(1-x-y)\\,dy\\,dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>内层积分为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1-x)^2/2</annotation></semantics></math>，所以</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>T</mi></msub><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_Tz\\,dS=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\int_0^1(1-x)^2\\,dx=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{6}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M=8\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt3}{6}+\\frac{\\sqrt3}{6}\\right)=\\frac{8\\sqrt3}{3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>第四步：计算 z 方向的一阶矩</h4>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>T</mi></msub><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_Tz^2\\,dS=\\sqrt3\\int_0^1\\int_0^{1-x}(1-x-y)^2\\,dy\\,dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>内层令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=1-x-y</annotation></semantics></math>，由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=0</annotation></semantics></math> 到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-x</annotation></semantics></math> 对应 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=1-x</annotation></semantics></math> 到 0，故</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msubsup><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_0^{1-x}(1-x-y)^2\\,dy=\\int_0^{1-x}u^2\\,du=\\frac{(1-x)^3}{3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>T</mi></msub><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_Tz^2\\,dS=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{3}\\int_0^1(1-x)^3\\,dx=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{12}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_z=\\frac13\\cdot8\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt3}{12}=\\frac{2\\sqrt3}{9}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>第五步：分子除以质量，得到重心</h4>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar z=\\frac{2\\sqrt3/9}{8\\sqrt3/3}=\\frac{2}{9}\\cdot\\frac38=\\frac1{12}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\bar x,\\bar y,\\bar z)=\\left(0,0,\\frac1{12}\\right).</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p><strong>复盘：</strong>质量分母的奇项消掉后，不代表它对重心毫无影响；乘上 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 后该奇项变成偶项 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z^2/3</annotation></semantics></math>，会贡献一阶矩。所有“乘 8”的地方都应先确认剩余被积函数关于各坐标面的反射不变。</p>","figureImages":["assets/ef7ca1eeb47b3b57d5.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/4be590822b693f9d1f.webp","assets/76475e17a591eba56e.webp","assets/23ac56f9d1e2c90162.webp","assets/d7dc419cf1f0c47bf8.webp"]},{"id":"E19","source":"E","page":48,"label":"例19｜p.48—49","title":"点引力沿曲线做功","method":"力大小乘单位方向，凑d(k/r)，端点差；第18节。","module":"applications","nodeIds":["s18-0","s18-1"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["半圆从 B(2,0) 走向 O(0,0)，引力始终朝固定点 A(0,1)。灰虚线为距离 r，红箭头为力的方向；做功可由势函数 k/r 的端点差计算。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>位于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math> 的质点对质点 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math> 的引力大小为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>k</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>k</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{k}{r^2},\\qquad k&gt;0,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math> 为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math> 与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math> 的距离。质点 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math> 沿曲线</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\sqrt{2x-x^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(2,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 运动到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(0,0)</annotation></semantics></math>。求引力所作的功。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>选法：把“大小＋方向”写成力向量，再找全微分</h4>\n<p>题目给的是引力大小，不是坐标分量。必须先写从运动点 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math> 指向固定点 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math> 的单位向量。由于是指向同一固定点的反平方引力，随后可凑出 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k/r</annotation></semantics></math> 的微分，只算端点。</p>\n<h4>第一步：确定距离与单位方向</h4>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overrightarrow{MA}=(-x,1-y).</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=|MA|=\\sqrt{x^2+(y-1)^2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>单位方向为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-x,1-y)/r</annotation></semantics></math>，再乘力的大小 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k/r^2</annotation></semantics></math>：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol F=\\frac{k}{r^3}(-x,1-y).</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>故两个分量是</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=-\\frac{kx}{r^3},\\qquad Q=\\frac{k(1-y)}{r^3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>不要直接写成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(k/r^2)(-x,1-y)</annotation></semantics></math>，那样遗漏了方向向量的单位化。</p>\n<h4>第二步：写出做功积分</h4>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi></msubsup><mi>P</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W=\\int_{B}^{O}P\\,dx+Q\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\int_B^O\\frac{-kx\\,dx-k(y-1)\\,dy}{r^3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>这里的上下标表示沿指定曲线从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math> 到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O</annotation></semantics></math>。力在这条曲线上连续，因为固定引力点 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math> 不在该圆弧上。</p>\n<h4>第三步：逐步验证全微分</h4>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^2=x^2+(y-1)^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>两边微分：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2r\\,dr=2x\\,dx+2(y-1)\\,dy,</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dr=\\frac{x\\,dx+(y-1)\\,dy}{r}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>因此</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d\\left(\\frac{k}{r}\\right)=-\\frac{k}{r^2}\\,dr</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\frac{-kx\\,dx-k(y-1)\\,dy}{r^3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>这正好是做功积分中的微分式，所以</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W=\\left[\\frac{k}{r}\\right]_B^O.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>第四步：先算端点距离，再代入</h4>\n<p>起点 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(2,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math> 的距离为</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_B=\\sqrt{(2-0)^2+(0-1)^2}=\\sqrt5.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<p>终点 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(0,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math> 的距离为</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>O</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_O=\\sqrt{0^2+(-1)^2}=1.</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W=\\frac{k}{1}-\\frac{k}{\\sqrt5}=k\\left(1-\\frac1{\\sqrt5}\\right).</annotation></semantics></math></span>\n<h4>复盘与符号检查</h4>\n<p>终点离引力中心更近，引力做功应为正，所得结果符合这一检查。用作做功原函数的是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k/r</annotation></semantics></math>；若另谈物理势能则是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-k/r</annotation></semantics></math>，两者符号不能混在一起。题目给出的具体圆弧保证运动路径明确，但在不穿过引力点的前提下，功的数值由端点决定，因此无需把 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\sqrt{2x-x^2}</annotation></semantics></math> 代入进行根式积分。</p>","figureImages":["assets/853e5c95f59358a0b1.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/c479eefdf336719a64.webp","assets/7adb83366c3d87d290.webp"]},{"id":"H01","source":"H","page":1,"label":"H01｜p.1","title":"单位球内z²的三重积分","method":"轮换对称或球坐标；先由三项相等凑r²；第04、06节。","module":"triple","nodeIds":["s4-0","s6-1"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["单位球体与半径方向。球坐标中 r 从 0 到 1，球体对 x、y、z 轮换对称。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>设区域</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega=\\{(x,y,z):x^2+y^2+z^2\\le1\\},</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>求三重积分</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iiint_\\Omega z^2\\,dx\\,dy\\,dz.</annotation></semantics></math></span>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：先利用轮换对称，再用球坐标</h4><p>区域是完整单位球。交换三个坐标后，区域不变，体积微元也不变；因此三个平方项的积分相等。这里的对称性同时涉及区域和积分对象，不能只看球面方程就随意替换其他被积函数。</p><h4>第一步：把三个相等的积分相加</h4><p>记所求积分为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math>，则</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iiint_\\Omega x^2\\,dV=\\iiint_\\Omega y^2\\,dV=\\iiint_\\Omega z^2\\,dV.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3I=\\iiint_\\Omega(x^2+y^2+z^2)\\,dV.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第二步：对平方和使用球坐标</h4><p>令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math> 为到原点的距离，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varphi</annotation></semantics></math> 为与正 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 轴的夹角，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math> 为方位角。单位球给出</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>π</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le r\\le1,\\quad0\\le\\varphi\\le\\pi,\\quad0\\le\\theta\\le2\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>平方和等于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^2</annotation></semantics></math>，而体积微元为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>φ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>φ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dV=r^2\\sin\\varphi\\,dr\\,d\\varphi\\,d\\theta.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>被积函数中的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^2</annotation></semantics></math> 还要乘微元中的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^2</annotation></semantics></math>：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>π</mi></msubsup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>φ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>φ</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3I=\\int_0^{2\\pi}d\\theta\\int_0^\\pi\\sin\\varphi\\,d\\varphi\\int_0^1r^4\\,dr.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>π</mi></msubsup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>φ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>φ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_0^1r^4\\,dr=\\frac15,\\qquad\\int_0^\\pi\\sin\\varphi\\,d\\varphi=2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3I=2\\pi\\cdot2\\cdot\\frac15=\\frac{4\\pi}{5}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><menclose notation=\"box\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>15</mn></mfrac></mrow></mstyle></mstyle></mstyle></menclose></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boxed{I=\\frac{4\\pi}{15}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>另一种常用方法：直接球坐标</h4><p>直接使用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=r\\cos\\varphi</annotation></semantics></math>，则</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>π</mi></msubsup><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>φ</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>φ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>φ</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_0^{2\\pi}d\\theta\\int_0^\\pi\\cos^2\\varphi\\sin\\varphi\\,d\\varphi\\int_0^1r^4\\,dr.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=\\cos\\varphi</annotation></semantics></math>，当 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varphi</annotation></semantics></math> 从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math> 到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math> 时，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math> 从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math> 到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1</annotation></semantics></math>，且 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>φ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">du=-\\sin\\varphi\\,d\\varphi</annotation></semantics></math>，所以角积分为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_{-1}^1u^2\\,du=\\frac23.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=2\\pi\\cdot\\frac23\\cdot\\frac15=\\frac{4\\pi}{15}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p><strong>易错点：</strong>球坐标的雅可比不能漏；轮换平均的系数是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/3</annotation></semantics></math>，不是直接把 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z^2</annotation></semantics></math> 换成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^2</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>","figureImages":["assets/0439dafed7d08dd33a.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/8516bc051438620c33.webp"]},{"id":"H02","source":"H","page":2,"label":"H02｜p.2","title":"缩小球体的积分极限","method":"连续性＋体积量级；归一化系数不是球体积；第04节。","module":"triple","nodeIds":["s4-3"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":[],"diagramType":"not-required","questionHtml":"<p>设 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math> 为连续函数，且 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(0,0,0)=1</annotation></semantics></math>。<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega_r</annotation></semantics></math> 为球心在原点、半径为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math> 的球体。求极限</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><msub><mo>∭</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{r\\to0^+}\\frac1{\\pi r^3}\\iiint_{\\Omega_r}f(x,y,z)\\,dV.</annotation></semantics></math></span>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：连续性给出小球内的统一估计</h4><p>小球不断缩向原点，而 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(0,0,0)=1</annotation></semantics></math>。直观上，积分近似为“中心点函数值乘小球体积”。本题真正需要注意的是：分母 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi r^3</annotation></semantics></math> 并不是球的体积，所以最终答案不会自动等于中心点值。</p><h4>第一步：写出误差的控制条件</h4><p>任取 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>。由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math> 在原点连续，存在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>，当</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mi>δ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2+z^2&lt;\\delta^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>时，有</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>ε</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|f(x,y,z)-1|&lt;\\varepsilon.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因此只要 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0&lt;r&lt;\\delta</annotation></semantics></math>，这个估计就在整个小球 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega_r</annotation></semantics></math> 上成立，而不是只在球心成立。</p><h4>第二步：把误差积分，再除以题目分母</h4><p>半径为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math> 的球体积为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(\\Omega_r)=\\frac{4\\pi r^3}{3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>由积分估计不等式，得到</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><msub><mo>∭</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></msub><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>ε</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left|\\iiint_{\\Omega_r}f\\,dV-\\frac{4\\pi r^3}{3}\\right|\\le\\varepsilon\\frac{4\\pi r^3}{3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>两边除以正数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi r^3</annotation></semantics></math>：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><msub><mo>∭</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></msub><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>ε</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left|\\frac1{\\pi r^3}\\iiint_{\\Omega_r}f\\,dV-\\frac43\\right|\\le\\frac43\\varepsilon.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math> 任意，所求极限就是</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><menclose notation=\"box\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mstyle></mstyle></menclose><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boxed{\\frac43}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>考场上的简洁写法</h4><p>记小球上的最大误差为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta(r)</annotation></semantics></math>，连续性保证 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta(r)\\to0</annotation></semantics></math>。于是可写成</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∭</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></msub><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iiint_{\\Omega_r}f\\,dV=\\frac{4\\pi r^3}{3}+o(r^3).</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><msub><mo>∭</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></msub><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac1{\\pi r^3}\\iiint_{\\Omega_r}f\\,dV=\\frac43+o(1).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p><strong>方法适用条件：</strong>区域要确实缩向给定点，函数要在该点连续；不需要先把 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math> 的具体表达式求出来。</p><p><strong>易错点：</strong>若分母是球体积 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\pi r^3/3</annotation></semantics></math>，极限才是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math>。本题少了 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4/3</annotation></semantics></math> 这个体积系数，必须保留。</p>","figureImages":[],"answerImages":["assets/948ba318730b6f37a9.webp"]},{"id":"H03","source":"H","page":3,"label":"H03｜p.3","title":"锥面、平面、偏心柱面围体积","method":"按图取第一卦限θ∈[π/4,π/2]，0≤r≤2sinθ，0≤z≤r；第04节。","module":"triple","nodeIds":["s4-1"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["按原图选 y≥x 的一侧：投影为蓝色区域；角度 π/4≤θ≤π/2，竖直方向 0≤z≤r。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>求由锥面、平面、柱面及 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xOy</annotation></semantics></math> 面所围立体在第一卦限内的部分的体积，其中三个曲面为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2},\\qquad y=x,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2=2y.</annotation></semantics></math></span>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：按原图确定平面一侧，再先单后重</h4><p>先核对区域：原讲义图示取 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y\\ge x</annotation></semantics></math> 一侧。因此投影落在第一象限、圆盘 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2\\le2y</annotation></semantics></math> 内，且满足 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le x\\le y</annotation></semantics></math>。仅有“第一卦限”这几个字，并不能独自决定平面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=x</annotation></semantics></math> 的哪一侧；这里的选侧依据是原图。</p><h4>第一步：写出立体和投影的范围</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D=\\{(x,y):0\\le x\\le y,\\ x^2+y^2\\le2y\\}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>立体下方为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=0</annotation></semantics></math>，上方为圆锥面，故</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le z\\le\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>先对 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 积分，相当于用“高度乘底部面积微元”：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V=\\iint_D\\left[\\int_0^{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}dz\\right]dx\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\iint_D\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第二步：在投影平面内改用极坐标</h4><p>令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=r\\cos\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=r\\sin\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>。第一象限并满足 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y\\ge x</annotation></semantics></math>，所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac\\pi4\\le\\theta\\le\\frac\\pi2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>圆盘条件变为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^2\\le2r\\sin\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>。除圆心外可约去 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math>，并把圆心补回范围：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le r\\le2\\sin\\theta.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>同时，锥面高度为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math>，面积微元为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r\\,dr\\,d\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>，两者相乘为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^2\\,dr\\,d\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></msubsup><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V=\\int_{\\pi/4}^{\\pi/2}d\\theta\\int_0^{2\\sin\\theta}r^2\\,dr</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\frac83\\int_{\\pi/4}^{\\pi/2}\\sin^3\\theta\\,d\\theta.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第三步：算清三角积分与上下限</h4><p>令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=\\cos\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>，则 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">du=-\\sin\\theta\\,d\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>，并利用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sin^2\\theta=1-u^2</annotation></semantics></math>：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_{\\pi/4}^{\\pi/2}\\sin^3\\theta\\,d\\theta=\\int_0^{\\sqrt2/2}(1-u^2)\\,du.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\left[u-\\frac{u^3}{3}\\right]_0^{\\sqrt2/2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}-\\frac{\\sqrt2}{12}=\\frac{5\\sqrt2}{12}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><menclose notation=\"box\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mrow></mstyle></mstyle></mstyle></menclose></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boxed{V=\\frac{10\\sqrt2}{9}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><p><strong>易错点：</strong>不是整个第一象限，所以角度不能写成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,\\pi/2]</annotation></semantics></math>；先积高度后仍要乘极坐标的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math>，不能只积 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r\\,dr</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>","figureImages":["assets/ab449adf37faf280bb.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/c24c653b770f354325.webp"]},{"id":"H04","source":"H","page":4,"label":"H04｜p.4","title":"含未知三重积分的函数方程","method":"将整个积分设常数，两边再积分解一次方程；第04节。","module":"triple","nodeIds":["s4-4"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["立体位于圆锥 z=√(x²+y²) 内、平面 z=1 下方；固定 z 的截面半径为 z。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>设连续函数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x,y,z)</annotation></semantics></math> 满足</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x,y,z)=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}+z\\iiint_\\Omega f(x,y,z)\\,dV,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega=\\{(x,y,z):\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}\\le z\\le1\\}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>求 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x,y,z)</annotation></semantics></math> 的表达式。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：把整个定积分看成一个常数</h4><p>定积分的值不随积分号外的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y,z</annotation></semantics></math> 改变。题目看似是三元函数方程，实际上只需要求一个未知常数。这一类“函数表达式中含整个定积分”的题，先设常数通常比直接反复代入更清楚。</p><h4>第一步：设常数，再对原等式积分</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C=\\iiint_\\Omega f(x,y,z)\\,dV.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>原等式可写为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x,y,z)=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}+zC.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>在同一区域 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math> 上积分：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C=\\iiint_\\Omega\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}\\,dV+C\\iiint_\\Omega z\\,dV.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>这里只把 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math> 提出积分号；变量 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 仍在积分号内。</p><h4>第二步：确定圆锥体的柱坐标范围</h4><p>由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}\\le z\\le1</annotation></semantics></math>，令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}</annotation></semantics></math>，可取</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le z\\le1,\\quad0\\le r\\le z,\\quad0\\le\\theta\\le2\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dV=r\\,dr\\,d\\theta\\,dz.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第三步：分别计算两个数值积分</h4><p>第一个积分：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>z</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=\\int_0^1dz\\int_0^{2\\pi}d\\theta\\int_0^zr^2\\,dr</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\frac{2\\pi}{3}\\int_0^1z^3\\,dz=\\frac{2\\pi}{3}\\cdot\\frac14=\\frac\\pi6.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>第二个积分：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>z</mi></msubsup><mi>z</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B=\\int_0^1dz\\int_0^{2\\pi}d\\theta\\int_0^zzr\\,dr</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>z</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=2\\pi\\int_0^1z\\cdot\\frac{z^2}{2}\\,dz=\\pi\\int_0^1z^3\\,dz=\\frac\\pi4.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第四步：解一次方程并代回</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C=\\frac\\pi6+\\frac\\pi4C.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left(1-\\frac\\pi4\\right)C=\\frac\\pi6.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C=\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\cdot\\frac4{4-\\pi}=\\frac{2\\pi}{3(4-\\pi)}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><menclose notation=\"box\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mstyle></mstyle></mstyle></menclose></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boxed{f(x,y,z)=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}+\\frac{2\\pi z}{3(4-\\pi)}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><p><strong>核对：</strong>把这个函数再积一次，恰有 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A+BC=C</annotation></semantics></math>，所以常数与原函数方程相容。</p><p><strong>易错点：</strong>题干中根号仅覆盖 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2</annotation></semantics></math>，不是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2+z</annotation></semantics></math>；右边的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 乘的是整个积分常数。</p>","figureImages":["assets/b8f3fa7cd6fa281a79.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/28bea4e5be49d584f2.webp"]},{"id":"H05","source":"H","page":5,"label":"H05｜p.5","title":"球内f(z)积分降成一重积分","method":"固定z的截面积π(1-z²)，先重后单；第04节。","module":"triple","nodeIds":["s4-2"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["球体的水平截面：固定 z 后得到半径 √(1−z²) 的圆盘，截面积为 π(1−z²)。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>设 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(z)</annotation></semantics></math> 连续，区域为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega=\\{(x,y,z):x^2+y^2+z^2\\le1\\}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>证明：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iiint_\\Omega f(z)\\,dV=\\pi\\int_{-1}^{1}f(z)(1-z^2)\\,dz.</annotation></semantics></math></span>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：固定高度，先计算水平截面的面积</h4><p>被积函数只含 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>，所以固定 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 后，它在同一个水平截面上是常数。不必把球坐标中三个变量都带入未知函数，也不必寻找 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math> 的原函数；先重后单就能直接把三重积分降成一重积分。</p><h4>第一步：求高度的范围和截面形状</h4><p>单位球条件为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2+z^2\\le1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>为了使截面非空，必须有</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1\\le z\\le1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>固定这样的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>，原条件等价于</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2\\le1-z^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因此水平截面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_z</annotation></semantics></math> 是半径 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{1-z^2}</annotation></semantics></math> 的圆盘，其面积为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(z)=\\pi\\left(\\sqrt{1-z^2}\\right)^2=\\pi(1-z^2).</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第二步：把积分拆成“截面积分，再沿高度积分”</h4><p>连续性保证在有界球体上可以按这个顺序积分：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iiint_\\Omega f(z)\\,dV=\\int_{-1}^1\\left[\\iint_{D_z}f(z)\\,dx\\,dy\\right]dz.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>内层积分只对 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y</annotation></semantics></math> 进行，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 暂时固定，因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_{D_z}f(z)\\,dx\\,dy=f(z)\\iint_{D_z}dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=f(z)A(z)=\\pi f(z)(1-z^2).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>代回外层积分即得</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><menclose notation=\"box\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mrow><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></mstyle></mstyle></mstyle></menclose><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boxed{\\iiint_\\Omega f(z)\\,dV=\\pi\\int_{-1}^1f(z)(1-z^2)\\,dz}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>用一个特例核对截面积因子</h4><p>若取 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(z)=1</annotation></semantics></math>，左边应等于单位球体积。右边给出</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi\\int_{-1}^1(1-z^2)\\,dz=\\pi\\left[z-\\frac{z^3}{3}\\right]_{-1}^1=\\frac{4\\pi}{3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>这与单位球体积一致，可以快速发现截面半径平方、积分区间或系数是否漏写。</p><p><strong>易错点：</strong>截面积是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi(1-z^2)</annotation></semantics></math>，不是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi\\sqrt{1-z^2}</annotation></semantics></math>；<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 要从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1</annotation></semantics></math> 积到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math>，不能无条件对半球乘二，因为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(z)</annotation></semantics></math> 未必是偶函数。</p>","figureImages":["assets/a74c64c65494214b4e.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/2072c106fb6bc3e7d1.webp"]},{"id":"H06","source":"H","page":6,"label":"H06｜p.6","title":"跨顶点抛物线的第一类积分","method":"用y参数从-2到4，面积/弧长方向不跟起终点变号；第05节。","module":"line1","nodeIds":["s5-0"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["用 y 作参数可一次经过顶点，覆盖 A 到 B 的整段抛物线；ds 为正，不随行进方向变号。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>求第一类曲线积分</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_L y\\,ds,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 是抛物线 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y^2=2x</annotation></semantics></math> 上连接 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(2,-2)</annotation></semantics></math> 与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(8,4)</annotation></semantics></math> 的弧。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：选 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 作参数，不把抛物线拆成两支</h4><p>曲线从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=-2</annotation></semantics></math> 到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=4</annotation></semantics></math>，经过顶点。若用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 作参数，必须区分 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\pm\\sqrt{2x}</annotation></semantics></math> 两支；而用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 作参数，整段弧都由一个表达式描述，计算更稳妥。</p><h4>第一步：写参数和正的弧长微元</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>4.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=\\frac{y^2}{2},\\qquad-2\\le y\\le4.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{dx}{dy}=y.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>第一类曲线积分使用的是弧长，不是有向微元：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds=\\sqrt{1+\\left(\\frac{dx}{dy}\\right)^2}\\,dy=\\sqrt{1+y^2}\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>这里按参数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 递增积分，故 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dy\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math>，无需再附加方向负号。</p><h4>第二步：把曲线积分化为一元积分</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mi>y</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_{-2}^4y\\sqrt{1+y^2}\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>注意：<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds</annotation></semantics></math> 非负，但被积函数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 在负半段仍然为负，不能把它擅自改成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|y|</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><h4>第三步：利用奇偶性缩短计算</h4><p>函数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y\\sqrt{1+y^2}</annotation></semantics></math> 是奇函数，因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>y</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_{-2}^{2}y\\sqrt{1+y^2}\\,dy=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mi>y</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_2^4y\\sqrt{1+y^2}\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>在这个单调区间令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=1+y^2</annotation></semantics></math>，则</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>17.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">du=2y\\,dy,\\qquad y=2\\Rightarrow u=5,\\quad y=4\\Rightarrow u=17.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>5</mn><mn>17</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\frac12\\int_5^{17}u^{1/2}\\,du.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>5</mn><mn>17</mn></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\frac12\\cdot\\frac23\\left[u^{3/2}\\right]_5^{17}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><menclose notation=\"box\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>17</mn><msqrt><mn>17</mn></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mstyle></mstyle></mstyle></menclose></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boxed{I=\\frac{17\\sqrt{17}-5\\sqrt5}{3}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>不用对称性也可直接求原函数</h4><p>在整个区间上，</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{d}{dy}\\left[\\frac13(1+y^2)^{3/2}\\right]=y\\sqrt{1+y^2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因此直接代入 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-2</annotation></semantics></math> 和 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math> 也得到相同答案。若在原区间上换元，要留意 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1+y^2</annotation></semantics></math> 在跨过零点时并非单调；用原函数或先消去对称段最清楚。</p><p><strong>易错点：</strong>第一类积分不因起终点调换而变号；它的正负来自函数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math>，不是来自弧长方向。</p>","figureImages":["assets/04f26b7c953ee8109e.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/bb12b7dd90d24bcd97.webp"]},{"id":"H07","source":"H","page":7,"label":"H07｜p.7","title":"球面与x=y交圆上的x²","method":"不能三变量轮换，选倾斜圆参数；第06节。","module":"line1","nodeIds":["s22-0","s5-1","s6-3"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["示意取 a=1。交圆位于平面 x=y 内；x 与 y 对称，但 z 的参数振幅不同，不能三平方项平均。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>求</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_L x^2\\,ds,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中闭曲线 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 是下列球面与平面的交线：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2+z^2=a^2,\\qquad x-y=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：先看清交圆，再选合适的圆参数</h4><p>平面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=y</annotation></semantics></math> 经过球心，因此交线是球面上的大圆。它并不具备三个变量的轮换对称性：交换 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y</annotation></semantics></math> 仍满足平面方程，但把 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 交换后，平面会变成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=y</annotation></semantics></math>，区域已经改变。这正是本题不能直接“三等份”的原因。</p><h4>第一步：处理半径记号</h4><p>题干只写了 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a^2</annotation></semantics></math>，未单独说明 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>。先记</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R=|a|.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>非退化情形 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> 时，球的半径是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math>。若平常按半径约定使用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>，最后把 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math> 换回 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math> 即可。</p><h4>第二步：给出位于平面内的参数方程</h4><p>可令</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=\\frac{R}{\\sqrt2}\\cos t,\\qquad y=\\frac{R}{\\sqrt2}\\cos t,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=R\\sin t,\\qquad0\\le t\\le2\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>它同时满足 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x-y=0</annotation></semantics></math>，以及</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2+z^2=R^2\\cos^2t+R^2\\sin^2t=R^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第三步：计算弧长微元，不能把坐标投影当弧长</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msup><mi>y</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msup><mi>z</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x'=-\\frac{R}{\\sqrt2}\\sin t,\\qquad y'=-\\frac{R}{\\sqrt2}\\sin t,\\qquad z'=R\\cos t.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x')^2+(y')^2+(z')^2=R^2\\sin^2t+R^2\\cos^2t=R^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds=R\\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第四步：代入并计算</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><mfrac><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>R</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\frac{R^2}{2}\\cos^2t\\cdot R\\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\cos^2t\\,dt=\\frac12\\int_0^{2\\pi}(1+\\cos2t)\\,dt=\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><menclose notation=\"box\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>a</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mstyle></mstyle></mstyle></menclose></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boxed{I=\\frac{\\pi R^3}{2}=\\frac{\\pi|a|^3}{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>若约定 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>，答案就是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi a^3/2</annotation></semantics></math>。<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=0</annotation></semantics></math> 时曲线退化，积分按零弧长理解为零，公式仍相容。</p><p><strong>易错点：</strong>虽然 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2,y^2</annotation></semantics></math> 的积分相等，但它们与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z^2</annotation></semantics></math> 的积分不相等。也不能误把平面投影圆的半径当作空间大圆的半径。</p>","figureImages":["assets/bd9fb8ae2ac74369f3.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/3041c5534c33cf42a1.webp"]},{"id":"H08","source":"H","page":8,"label":"H08｜p.8","title":"星形线长度","method":"x=cos³t,y=sin³t，第一象限积分乘4；第05节。","module":"line1","nodeIds":["s5-1"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["星形线四象限对称。青色为第一象限弧段，计算其弧长后乘 4。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>设星形线 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 的方程为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^{2/3}+y^{2/3}=1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>求 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 的长度。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：用三次幂三角参数，先算第一象限</h4><p>方程中出现 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2/3</annotation></semantics></math> 次幂，适合取 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=\\cos^3t</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\sin^3t</annotation></semantics></math>。这样分别取 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2/3</annotation></semantics></math> 次幂后变成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos^2t</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sin^2t</annotation></semantics></math>，立刻满足曲线方程。完整星形线关于两坐标轴对称，弧长可取第一象限的四倍。</p><h4>第一步：确定参数范围</h4><p>第一象限从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math>，可取</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=\\cos^3t,\\quad y=\\sin^3t,\\quad0\\le t\\le\\frac\\pi2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>这个范围恰好走过一个象限的弧，不是整条曲线。</p><h4>第二步：逐项求导，合并根号</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x'=-3\\cos^2t\\sin t,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y'=3\\sin^2t\\cos t.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>速度平方为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x')^2+(y')^2=9\\cos^4t\\sin^2t+9\\sin^4t\\cos^2t.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>提取公因式：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=9\\sin^2t\\cos^2t(\\cos^2t+\\sin^2t).</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=9\\sin^2t\\cos^2t.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>开根号一般应写成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3|\\sin t\\cos t|</annotation></semantics></math>。但在第一象限，正弦和余弦都非负，所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds=3\\sin t\\cos t\\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第三步：积分并乘对称倍数</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell_1=\\int_0^{\\pi/2}3\\sin t\\cos t\\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=\\sin t</annotation></semantics></math>，则 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">du=\\cos t\\,dt</annotation></semantics></math>，上下限从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math> 变到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math>：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>u</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell_1=3\\int_0^1u\\,du=\\frac32.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>完整星形线有四段对称弧：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><menclose notation=\"box\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mstyle></mstyle></mstyle></menclose><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boxed{\\ell=4\\ell_1=6}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>考场识别与核对</h4><p>遇到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^{2/3}+y^{2/3}=a^{2/3}</annotation></semantics></math> 一类星形线，可考虑三次幂三角参数；尺度为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> 时周长相应为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6a</annotation></semantics></math>。本题尺度为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math>，所以周长为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><p><strong>易错点：</strong>若直接把参数取到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\pi</annotation></semantics></math>，开根号后必须保留绝对值，否则正负抵消会错误地得到零。先缩到第一象限，既简短也避免这个错误。</p>","figureImages":["assets/724b0218beeb55f64e.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/bbde95613ae6f73f76.webp"]},{"id":"H09","source":"H","page":9,"label":"H09｜p.9","title":"交圆上x+y²的积分","method":"x项中心奇对称消去，y²轮换平均；第06节。","module":"line1","nodeIds":["s22-0","s6-0","s6-1","s6-2"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["示意取 a=1。过球心平面的交圆对原点中心对称，且满足 x、y、z 轮换对称。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>求</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_L(x+y^2)\\,ds,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 为球面与平面的交线：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2+z^2=a^2,\\qquad x+y+z=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：一次项用中心对称，平方项用轮换对称</h4><p>不要一开始就参数化整条空间曲线。交线经过球心所在平面，中心对称和三个坐标的循环对称同时存在。分别处理 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y^2</annotation></semantics></math>，可以把计算化成圆的周长。</p><h4>第一步：先确定交圆半径</h4><p>平面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x+y+z=0</annotation></semantics></math> 经过原点，也就是球心，因此交线是大圆。记实际半径为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R=|a|.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>于是</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_Lds=2\\pi R.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>题干未限定 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math> 的正负；若按半径符号约定 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>，就有 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R=a</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><h4>第二步：消去一次项</h4><p>将每个点对应到其中心对称点：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⟼</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,y,z)\\longmapsto(-x,-y,-z).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>两条曲线方程都保持不变，弧长微元 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ds</annotation></semantics></math> 也不变，而函数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 改变符号。因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_Lx\\,ds=-\\int_Lx\\,ds,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_Lx\\,ds=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第三步：平方项相加凑球面恒等式</h4><p>循环交换 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y,z</annotation></semantics></math> 后，球面方程与平面方程都不变，故</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J=\\int_Lx^2\\,ds=\\int_Ly^2\\,ds=\\int_Lz^2\\,ds.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>三个相等积分相加：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3J=\\int_L(x^2+y^2+z^2)\\,ds.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>在曲线上，平方和恒为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R^2</annotation></semantics></math>，所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3J=R^2\\int_Lds=R^2\\cdot2\\pi R=2\\pi R^3.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J=\\frac{2\\pi R^3}{3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第四步：合并两部分</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>J</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_Lx\\,ds+\\int_Ly^2\\,ds=0+J.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><menclose notation=\"box\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>a</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mstyle></mstyle></mstyle></menclose></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boxed{I=\\frac{2\\pi|a|^3}{3}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>若 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>，可写成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\pi a^3/3</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><p><strong>易错点：</strong>轮换结论来自“积分区域及微元不变”，不是三个变量写在一个式子里就必然能平均。本题恰好满足条件；前一题平面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=y</annotation></semantics></math> 则只具有部分对称，不能照搬。</p>","figureImages":["assets/48b520f0a19a2b3613.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/17d5ce600f35c07b8f.webp"]},{"id":"H10","source":"H","page":10,"label":"H10｜p.10—11","title":"绝对值折线的第二类积分","method":"x=0处分段；也可补底边用格林，核对顺时针；第07、08节。","module":"line2","nodeIds":["s22-4","s7-0","s8-0","s8-1"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["沿折线 A→(0,1)→B 行进。若补底边 B→A，构成顺时针闭边界，格林公式应加负号。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>曲线 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 的方程为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=1-|x|,\\qquad-1\\le x\\le1,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>起点为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-1,0)</annotation></semantics></math>，终点为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,0)</annotation></semantics></math>。求</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_Lxy\\,dx+x^2\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>","solutionHtml":"<h4>方法一：在绝对值改变符号的位置分段</h4><p>本题是第二类曲线积分，必须按从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-1,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 的行进方向写上下限。折线在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0</annotation></semantics></math> 拐弯，左右两段的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dy</annotation></semantics></math> 符号不同。</p><h4>第一步：左半段</h4><p>当 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1\\le x\\le0</annotation></semantics></math> 时，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|x|=-x</annotation></semantics></math>，所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=1+x,\\qquad dy=dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>代入两项：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo fence=\"false\" maxsize=\"1.2em\" minsize=\"1.2em\" stretchy=\"true\">[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo fence=\"false\" maxsize=\"1.2em\" minsize=\"1.2em\" stretchy=\"true\">]</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_1=\\int_{-1}^0\\big[x(1+x)+x^2\\big]dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\int_{-1}^0(x+2x^2)dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\left[\\frac{x^2}{2}+\\frac{2x^3}{3}\\right]_{-1}^0.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=0-\\left(\\frac12-\\frac23\\right)=\\frac16.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第二步：右半段</h4><p>当 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le x\\le1</annotation></semantics></math> 时，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|x|=x</annotation></semantics></math>，所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=1-x,\\qquad dy=-dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>注意第二项由此带负号：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo fence=\"false\" maxsize=\"1.2em\" minsize=\"1.2em\" stretchy=\"true\">[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo fence=\"false\" maxsize=\"1.2em\" minsize=\"1.2em\" stretchy=\"true\">]</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_2=\\int_0^1\\big[x(1-x)-x^2\\big]dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\int_0^1(x-2x^2)dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\left[\\frac{x^2}{2}-\\frac{2x^3}{3}\\right]_0^1=-\\frac16.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>两段相加：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><menclose notation=\"box\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mstyle></mstyle></menclose><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boxed{I=I_1+I_2=0}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>方法二：补底边，格林后用奇偶性</h4><p>补上 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=0</annotation></semantics></math> 上从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 回到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-1,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 的线段 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_0</annotation></semantics></math>。补边上 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=0</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dy=0</annotation></semantics></math>，所以补边积分为零。原折线加补边围成顺时针边界，方向为负。</p><p>取 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=xy</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=x^2</annotation></semantics></math>，得到</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x-P_y=2x-x=x.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>设 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math> 为底边上方的等腰三角形，则</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I+0=-\\iint_Dx\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>区域关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 轴对称，被积函数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 为奇函数，故面积积分为零，从而仍有 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=0</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><p><strong>方法选择：</strong>分段法最直接，格林法更能说明抵消的原因。无论选哪一种，都不能把第二类积分的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dy</annotation></semantics></math> 当作总为正的弧长微元。</p><p><strong>易错点：</strong>右半段必须用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dy=-dx</annotation></semantics></math>；补闭合以后是顺时针，格林公式前应有负号。虽然本题结果为零，这个方向错误仍不能忽略。</p>","figureImages":["assets/8750713d3f72a77ae7.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/6bcc503bff04805e0a.webp","assets/5d760795c92e52cccc.webp"]},{"id":"H11","source":"H","page":12,"label":"H11｜p.12","title":"偏心上半圆的第二类积分","method":"分离d((x²+y²)/2)及x dy-y dx，或参数化；从左到右为顺时针；第07节。","module":"line2","nodeIds":["s7-3"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["上半圆从左端 A 走到右端 B，为顺时针方向；参数角 t 从 π 递减到 0。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>求</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_L(x+y)\\,dx+(y-x)\\,dy,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 是圆周 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x-2)^2+y^2=1</annotation></semantics></math> 的上半圆，从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(1,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(3,0)</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：凑出全微分，只对剩余部分参数化</h4><p>系数中同时出现 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\,dx+y\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math>，这是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x^2+y^2)/2</annotation></semantics></math> 的全微分。把容易的部分先拆出，可以少算一半。剩下的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y\\,dx-x\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math> 则与绕圆运动有关。</p><h4>第一步：准确拆分原式</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x+y)dx+(y-x)dy</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=x\\,dx+y\\,dy+y\\,dx-x\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=d\\left(\\frac{x^2+y^2}{2}\\right)+y\\,dx-x\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>全微分在起点 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(1,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 与终点 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(3,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 之间的积分为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{3^2+0^2}{2}-\\frac{1^2+0^2}{2}=\\frac92-\\frac12=4.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第二步：按左到右的方向确定圆参数</h4><p>圆心为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(2,0)</annotation></semantics></math>、半径为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math>。上半圆可令</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=2+\\cos t,\\qquad y=\\sin t.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>起点 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 对应 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=\\pi</annotation></semantics></math>，终点 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(3,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 对应 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=0</annotation></semantics></math>，所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>⟶</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t:\\pi\\longrightarrow0.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>这是上半圆从左向右的顺时针方向。微分为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx=-\\sin t\\,dt,\\qquad dy=\\cos t\\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第三步：逐项算剩余积分</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y\\,dx-x\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=-\\sin^2t\\,dt-(2+\\cos t)\\cos t\\,dt</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=-(\\sin^2t+\\cos^2t+2\\cos t)dt</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=-(1+2\\cos t)dt.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>π</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_L(y\\,dx-x\\,dy)=\\int_\\pi^0-(1+2\\cos t)dt</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mi>π</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\left[-t-2\\sin t\\right]_\\pi^0=\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>与端点差合并：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><menclose notation=\"box\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow></mstyle></mstyle></mstyle></menclose><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boxed{I=4+\\pi}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>直接参数法的核对</h4><p>若把原式全部代入同一个圆参数，会得到</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>π</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_\\pi^0(-2\\sin t-1-2\\cos t)dt.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>三项依次积分得到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math>，仍是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4+\\pi</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><p><strong>易错点：</strong>圆心不在原点，不能取 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=\\cos t</annotation></semantics></math>；上限是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math> 而不是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math>，否则方向和结果都会出错。</p>","figureImages":["assets/436b23e1bbdb27d01f.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/d97fc7de66bb2ee623.webp"]},{"id":"H12","source":"H","page":13,"label":"H12｜p.13","title":"两球交线上的(x+y)dx","method":"两式相减得z=1/2，化水平圆；x dx全微分，y dx可格林；第07节。","module":"line2","nodeIds":["s22-1","s7-1","s7-2","s7-3","s8-0"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["两球面相减得到水平平面 z=1/2，交圆半径为 √3/2；蓝色箭头对应从 +z 方向看逆时针。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>闭曲线 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 由两球面相交得到：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2+z^2=1,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2+z^2=2z.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 轴正向看去，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 为逆时针方向。求</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\oint_L(x+y)\\,dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：先用两个球面相减，找出真正的交圆</h4><p>原题虽然给的是两条空间曲面方程，但它们的左端完全相同，立即相减就能得到交线所在的水平面。之后只是一道平面圆周上的第二类积分，不需要直接处理三维参数。</p><h4>第一步：求高度与半径</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2+z^2=1,\\qquad x^2+y^2+z^2=2z.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>相减得</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2z=1,\\qquad z=\\frac12.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>代回第一个球面：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2=1-\\frac14=\\frac34.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因此交圆半径为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R=\\sqrt3/2</annotation></semantics></math>。从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 轴正向看去为逆时针，投影到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xOy</annotation></semantics></math> 面后仍是逆时针。</p><h4>第二步：先去掉全微分项</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\oint_Lx\\,dx+\\oint_Ly\\,dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\,dx=d\\left(\\frac{x^2}{2}\\right),</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>沿闭路积分只看首尾，而首尾相同，所以第一项为零：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\oint_Ly\\,dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第三步：用格林公式</h4><p>在投影圆盘 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math> 上取 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=y</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=0</annotation></semantics></math>。系数在整个圆盘上光滑，方向也是正向，因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_D(Q_x-P_y)dx\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Area</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\iint_D(0-1)dx\\,dy=-\\operatorname{Area}(D).</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><menclose notation=\"box\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mstyle></mstyle></mstyle></menclose><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boxed{I=-\\pi\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\right)^2=-\\frac{3\\pi}{4}}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>直接参数法核对方向</h4><p>取 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=R\\cos t</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=R\\sin t</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le t\\le2\\pi</annotation></semantics></math>。则</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oint_Ly\\,dx=-R^2\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\sin^2t\\,dt=-\\pi R^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>同样得到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-3\\pi/4</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><p><strong>易错点：</strong>交圆半径不是单位球半径 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math>，必须先减去高度平方；逆时针圆周上的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∮</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oint y\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math> 是负面积，而 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∮</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oint x\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math> 才是正面积。</p>","figureImages":["assets/1c25847681793ecfed.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/1e8c694768ceaa3be6.webp"]},{"id":"H13","source":"H","page":14,"label":"H13｜p.14—15","title":"两球交线与|y-x|","method":"先得z=1、dz=0；中心对称配对或三角参数绝对值分段；第07节。","module":"line2","nodeIds":["s22-1","s7-0","s7-1","s7-2"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["先由两球面消元得到 z=1，再投影为单位圆。直线 y=x 标出绝对值 |y−x| 的变号位置。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>闭曲线 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 是两球面的交线：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2+z^2=2,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2+z^2=2z.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 轴正向看去，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 为逆时针方向。求</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\oint_L|y-x|\\,dx+z\\,dz.</annotation></semantics></math></span>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：消元降维，再把相对两半圆配对</h4><p>绝对值容易让人想到分段，但本题不必先找 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y-x=0</annotation></semantics></math> 与圆的所有交点。交圆具有中心对称性，而绝对值在中心对称下不变；与有向微元 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx</annotation></semantics></math> 配合，恰好能让两半圆相互抵消。</p><h4>第一步：确定交线并处理 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\,dz</annotation></semantics></math></h4><p>两球面相减：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2=2z,\\qquad z=1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>代回球面方程：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2=2-1=1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因此整条曲线上 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 恒等于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math>，有 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dz=0</annotation></semantics></math>。所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\oint_{x^2+y^2=1}|y-x|\\,dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>此时已经完全化为平面单位圆上的积分。</p><h4>第二步：写出与方向一致的参数</h4><p>从正 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 轴看逆时针，取</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=\\cos t,\\quad y=\\sin t,\\quad0\\le t\\le2\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx=-\\sin t\\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>于是</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=-\\int_0^{2\\pi}|\\sin t-\\cos t|\\sin t\\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第三步：后半段平移 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math>，逐项比较符号</h4><p>把积分区间分为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,\\pi]</annotation></semantics></math> 和 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>π</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\pi,2\\pi]</annotation></semantics></math>。后半段令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=u+\\pi</annotation></semantics></math>，则</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sin(u+\\pi)=-\\sin u,\\qquad\\cos(u+\\pi)=-\\cos u.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因此绝对值满足</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\sin(u+\\pi)-\\cos(u+\\pi)|=|\\sin u-\\cos u|.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>但外面的正弦改变符号，所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>π</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\int_\\pi^{2\\pi}|\\sin t-\\cos t|\\sin t\\,dt</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>π</mi></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>u</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\int_0^\\pi|\\sin u-\\cos u|\\sin u\\,du.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>它与前半段正好互为相反数：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><menclose notation=\"box\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mstyle></mstyle></menclose><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boxed{I=0}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>为什么绝对值没有使积分非负</h4><p>绝对值只保证 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|y-x|\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math>，但这是对坐标的第二类积分，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx</annotation></semantics></math> 随行进方向有正有负。它不同于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_L|y-x|\\,ds</annotation></semantics></math>，后者才一定非负。</p><p><strong>易错点：</strong>不能因为有绝对值就默认结果大于零；也不能跳过消元而把 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\,dz</annotation></semantics></math> 当成一般的非零项。先用曲线约束，往往比直接套定理更短。</p>","figureImages":["assets/9cbe3b44861ba172a2.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/ab2ddabf11b6e61ce9.webp","assets/52719c27d15fa70c83.webp"]},{"id":"H14","source":"H","page":16,"label":"H14｜p.16","title":"四条闭曲线积分比较","method":"格林被积函数正负区域决定最大值，L4围正贡献区域；第08节。","module":"green","nodeIds":["s8-0","s8-2"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["四条边界与格林公式的符号区域。蓝色 L4 恰好包围 1−x²−y²/2≥0 的全部区域，因此积分最大。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>四条平面闭曲线都取逆时针方向：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_1:x^2+y^2=1,\\qquad L_2:x^2+y^2=2,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_3:x^2+2y^2=2,\\qquad L_4:2x^2+y^2=2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>记</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_i=\\oint_{L_i}\\left(y+\\frac{y^3}{6}\\right)dx+\\left(2x-\\frac{x^3}{3}\\right)dy,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i=1,2,3,4.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_1,I_2,I_3,I_4</annotation></semantics></math> 中，哪一个最大？选项 A、B、C、D 分别对应 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_1,I_2,I_3,I_4</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：格林公式后，比较“带正负号的区域贡献”</h4><p>四条曲线都取逆时针，所以它们都是各自内部区域的正向边界。不能仅凭面积大小判断积分大小：被积函数在某些位置为负，多围进去的区域反而可能拉低积分。</p><h4>第一步：把四个曲线积分统一写成面积积分</h4><p>取</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=y+\\frac{y^3}{6},\\qquad Q=2x-\\frac{x^3}{3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>分别求偏导：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x=2-x^2,\\qquad P_y=1+\\frac{y^2}{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x-P_y=1-x^2-\\frac{y^2}{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>记 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_i</annotation></semantics></math> 为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_i</annotation></semantics></math> 内部，则</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_i=\\iint_{D_i}\\left(1-x^2-\\frac{y^2}{2}\\right)dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第二步：找出被积函数恰好为正的区域</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-x^2-\\frac{y^2}{2}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⟺</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad2x^2+y^2&lt;2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>这正是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_4</annotation></semantics></math> 的内部 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_4</annotation></semantics></math>。因此 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_4</annotation></semantics></math> 收集了所有正贡献，且没有收进任何负贡献。</p><h4>第三步：严格说明为什么它比其余三个都大</h4><p>对任一其他区域 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_i</annotation></semantics></math>，把差分为两部分：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mi>g</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></msub><mi>g</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_4-I_i=\\iint_{D_4\\setminus D_i}g\\,dx\\,dy-\\iint_{D_i\\setminus D_4}g\\,dx\\,dy,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g=1-x^2-\\frac{y^2}{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>第一块位于正贡献区域内，所以非负；第二块位于正区域外，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g\\le0</annotation></semantics></math>，减去它仍非负。这里三个其他区域都与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_4</annotation></semantics></math> 存在正面积的不同部分，故实际为严格大于。</p><p><strong>因此最大项是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_4</annotation></semantics></math>，选择 D。</strong></p><h4>若还要求最大数值：把椭圆化成单位圆</h4><p>令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=u</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\sqrt2v</annotation></semantics></math>，则 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_4</annotation></semantics></math> 变成单位圆盘，雅可比为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt2</annotation></semantics></math>：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msub><mo>∬</mo><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_4=\\sqrt2\\iint_{u^2+v^2\\le1}(1-u^2-v^2)du\\,dv.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>再取极坐标，</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_4=2\\sqrt2\\pi\\int_0^1(1-r^2)r\\,dr.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=2\\sqrt2\\pi\\left[\\frac{r^2}{2}-\\frac{r^4}{4}\\right]_0^1=\\frac\\pi{\\sqrt2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>直接计算四个积分也可核对：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_1=\\frac{5\\pi}{8},\\quad I_2=\\frac\\pi2,\\quad I_3=\\frac{3\\sqrt2\\pi}{8},\\quad I_4=\\frac{\\sqrt2\\pi}{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p><strong>易错点：</strong>“区域越大，积分越大”只适用于非负被积函数；本题关键是正负分界恰好与候选边界之一重合。</p>","figureImages":["assets/4d447bb26d06b8ae07.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/4bf7aba545dd71cb0d.webp"]},{"id":"H15","source":"H","page":17,"label":"H15｜p.17","title":"两段圆弧构成开放路径","method":"补y轴；或先拆d(x³y-y²)再算x dy；第08节。","module":"green","nodeIds":["s7-3","s8-0","s8-1"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["路径分为两段圆弧：蓝色先走到 (2,0)，青色再走到 (0,2)。虚线为需要减去的 y 轴补线。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>曲线 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 位于第一象限：先从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 沿圆周 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2=2x</annotation></semantics></math> 到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(2,0)</annotation></semantics></math>，再沿圆周 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2=4</annotation></semantics></math> 到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,2)</annotation></semantics></math>。求</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_L3x^2y\\,dx+(x^3+x-2y)\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>","solutionHtml":"<h4>方法一：拆全微分，剩下两段圆弧分别参数化</h4><p>先观察 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3x^2y\\,dx+x^3\\,dy=d(x^3y)</annotation></semantics></math>，而 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-2y\\,dy=d(-y^2)</annotation></semantics></math>。因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3x^2y\\,dx+(x^3+x-2y)dy=d(x^3y-y^2)+x\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,2)</annotation></semantics></math> 的端点差为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msubsup><mo fence=\"false\" maxsize=\"1.2em\" minsize=\"1.2em\" stretchy=\"true\">∣</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x^3y-y^2)\\big|_{(0,0)}^{(0,2)}=-4.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第一段：小圆上半弧从左到右</h4><p>圆 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2=2x</annotation></semantics></math> 可写成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x-1)^2+y^2=1</annotation></semantics></math>。取</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>t</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=1+\\cos t,\\qquad y=\\sin t,\\qquad t:\\pi\\to0.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>π</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_{L_1}x\\,dy=\\int_\\pi^0(1+\\cos t)\\cos t\\,dt.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>π</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_\\pi^0\\cos t\\,dt=0</annotation></semantics></math>，而</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>π</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mi>π</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_\\pi^0\\cos^2t\\,dt=\\left[\\frac t2+\\frac{\\sin2t}{4}\\right]_\\pi^0=-\\frac\\pi2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第二段：半径为二的四分之一圆弧</h4><p>从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(2,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,2)</annotation></semantics></math> 可取</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=2\\cos t,\\quad y=2\\sin t,\\quad0\\le t\\le\\frac\\pi2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_{L_2}x\\,dy=4\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\cos^2t\\,dt=4\\cdot\\frac\\pi4=\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><menclose notation=\"box\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mstyle></mstyle></mstyle></menclose><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boxed{I=-4-\\frac\\pi2+\\pi=\\frac\\pi2-4}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>方法二：补 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 轴，用格林公式算面积</h4><p>补上 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_0</annotation></semantics></math>：从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,2)</annotation></semantics></math> 沿 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 轴回到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0)</annotation></semantics></math>。闭合边界为正向。原式满足</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x-P_y=(3x^2+1)-3x^2=1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>围成的区域是半径二的四分之一圆盘，去掉圆心 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,0)</annotation></semantics></math>、半径一的上半圆盘，故面积为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>π</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>π</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S=\\frac14\\pi\\cdot2^2-\\frac12\\pi\\cdot1^2=\\frac\\pi2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>在补线上，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx=0</annotation></semantics></math>，因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_{L_0}Pdx+Qdy=\\int_2^0(-2y)dy=4.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>格林公式给出 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I+4=S</annotation></semantics></math>，所以同样有 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\pi/2-4</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><p><strong>易错点：</strong>补线积分不是零；原积分等于闭合积分减去补线积分。第一段圆弧的参数又是从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math> 降到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math>，不要颠倒。</p>","figureImages":["assets/d240256eb11098e8fd.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/e984780afae7156368.webp"]},{"id":"H16","source":"H","page":18,"label":"H16｜p.18—19","title":"齐次函数条件证明闭路积分零","method":"对缩放参数t求导得欧拉型等式，再格林；第11节。","module":"green","nodeIds":["s11-2"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":[],"diagramType":"not-required","questionHtml":"<p>在上半平面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D=\\{(x,y):y&gt;0\\}</annotation></semantics></math> 内，函数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math> 具有连续偏导数，且对任意 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> 均满足</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(tx,ty)=t^{-2}f(x,y).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>证明：对 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math> 内任意分段光滑的有向简单闭曲线 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math>，有</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>y</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oint_Lyf(x,y)\\,dx-xf(x,y)\\,dy=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：对缩放参数求导，把齐次条件变成偏导关系</h4><p>题目给出的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(tx,ty)=t^{-2}f(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math> 是一种缩放关系。要与格林公式联系，关键不是展开 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math>，而是对 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math> 求导，由此得到关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_x,f_y</annotation></semantics></math> 的恒等式。</p><h4>第一步：固定 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y</annotation></semantics></math>，对 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math> 求导</h4><p>因为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>，点 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(tx,ty)</annotation></semantics></math> 始终位于上半平面，题目的可微条件可以使用。链式法则给出</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xf_x(tx,ty)+yf_y(tx,ty)=-2t^{-3}f(x,y).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=1</annotation></semantics></math>，得到</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xf_x(x,y)+yf_y(x,y)=-2f(x,y).</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第二步：求格林公式中的偏导差</h4><p>设</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=yf(x,y),\\qquad Q=-xf(x,y).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>对乘积分别求导：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_y=f+yf_y,\\qquad Q_x=-f-xf_x.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x-P_y=(-f-xf_x)-(f+yf_y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=-2f-xf_x-yf_y.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>代入上一步恒等式：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x-P_y=-2f-(-2f)=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第三步：核对区域条件后应用格林公式</h4><p>上半平面是单连通区域。闭曲线 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 及其内部都位于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> 内，不会围住上半平面外的奇点。<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P,Q</annotation></semantics></math> 在该区域内有连续偏导，故可用格林公式：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oint_LP\\,dx+Q\\,dy=\\iint_{D_L}(Q_x-P_y)dx\\,dy=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>若 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 反向，积分只会整体变号，零仍然为零。因此结论对题设的有向闭曲线成立。</p><h4>本质理解：这个微分式只依赖比值 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x/y</annotation></semantics></math></h4><p>在缩放公式中取 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=1/y</annotation></semantics></math>，可得</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x,y)=y^{-2}f(x/y,1).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>再令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=x/y</annotation></semantics></math>，则</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">du=\\frac{y\\,dx-x\\,dy}{y^2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>于是原微分式变为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">yf\\,dx-xf\\,dy=f(u,1)\\,du.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>它是一元函数关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math> 的全微分，沿闭路首尾 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math> 相同，积分自然为零。这说明格林法中出现的抵消不是偶然。</p><p><strong>易错点：</strong>对 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math> 求导时左边必须同时产生 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xf_x</annotation></semantics></math> 和 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">yf_y</annotation></semantics></math>；右边指数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-2</annotation></semantics></math> 求导后为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-2t^{-3}</annotation></semantics></math>，不能把负号漏掉。</p>","figureImages":[],"answerImages":["assets/6fcb692f73d59b30b2.webp","assets/8ad119f362e895b356.webp"]},{"id":"H17","source":"H","page":20,"label":"H17｜p.20—21","title":"验证路径无关并求指定积分","method":"全微分原函数/折线法，终点减起点；第10节。","module":"path","nodeIds":["s10-1","s10-2"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":[],"diagramType":"not-required","questionHtml":"<p>验证下列曲线积分与路径无关，并计算其值：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mi>P</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_{(0,0)}^{(\\pi/2,1)}P\\,dx+Q\\,dy,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=2xy^3-y^2\\cos x,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=1-2y\\sin x+3x^2y^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：先证明路径无关，再选最省的求值方法</h4><p>题目既要求验证，又要求求值，不能只算出某一条路径上的积分就结束。先检查偏导相等，并确认定义区域没有孔洞，再用原函数端点差或简单折线路径计算。</p><h4>第一步：验证偏导相等</h4><p>系数为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=2xy^3-y^2\\cos x,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=1-2y\\sin x+3x^2y^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>分别求偏导：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_y=6xy^2-2y\\cos x,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x=-2y\\cos x+6xy^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>两者在整个平面上恒等相等。<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P,Q</annotation></semantics></math> 的偏导连续，整个平面又是单连通区域，故积分与路径无关。</p><h4>方法一：求原函数，再算终点减起点</h4><p>由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_x=P</annotation></semantics></math>，先对 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 积分：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U=x^2y^3-y^2\\sin x+\\varphi(y).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>这里必须补上“只依赖 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 的函数”，不能只补一个常数。再求 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 偏导：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>φ</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_y=3x^2y^2-2y\\sin x+\\varphi'(y).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math> 比较，得到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>φ</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varphi'(y)=1</annotation></semantics></math>，可以取 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varphi(y)=y</annotation></semantics></math>。因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U=x^2y^3-y^2\\sin x+y.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>在终点 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\pi/2,1)</annotation></semantics></math>：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U(\\pi/2,1)=\\frac{\\pi^2}{4}-\\sin\\frac\\pi2+1=\\frac{\\pi^2}{4}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>在起点 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0)</annotation></semantics></math>，有 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U(0,0)=0</annotation></semantics></math>，所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><menclose notation=\"box\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mstyle></mstyle></mstyle></menclose><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boxed{I=\\frac{\\pi^2}{4}}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>方法二：验证后改走折线</h4><p>先沿 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0</annotation></semantics></math> 从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math>，再沿 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=1</annotation></semantics></math> 到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\pi/2,1)</annotation></semantics></math>。第一段 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx=0</annotation></semantics></math>，且</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q(0,y)=1,\\qquad I_1=\\int_0^1dy=1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>第二段 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dy=0</annotation></semantics></math>，且</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(x,1)=2x-\\cos x.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_2=\\int_0^{\\pi/2}(2x-\\cos x)dx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\left[x^2-\\sin x\\right]_0^{\\pi/2}=\\frac{\\pi^2}{4}-1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>两段相加：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=I_1+I_2=1+\\frac{\\pi^2}{4}-1=\\frac{\\pi^2}{4}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p><strong>方法选择：</strong>如果原函数一眼可凑，用端点差；若某些坐标轴上系数明显简化，验证后改走折线往往更快。</p><p><strong>易错点：</strong>路径无关的偏导条件要结合区域条件；端点差必须“终点减起点”。尚未证明路径无关时，不可擅自换路。</p>","figureImages":[],"answerImages":["assets/e109c6d54ffb52d32b.webp","assets/ca794e58f611de111e.webp"]},{"id":"H18","source":"H","page":22,"label":"H18｜p.22—23","title":"路径无关反求f(x)","method":"偏导相等导出二阶常系数微分方程，代初值；第11节。","module":"path","nodeIds":["s11-0"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":[],"diagramType":"not-required","questionHtml":"<p>设 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)</annotation></semantics></math> 有二阶连续导数，满足 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(0)=0</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f'(0)=-1</annotation></semantics></math>。已知曲线积分</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_LP\\,dx+Q\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>与积分路径无关，其中</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=[xe^{2x}-6f(x)]\\sin y,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=-[5f(x)-f'(x)]\\cos y.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>求 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：路径无关先化为微分方程，再逐步解初值问题</h4><p>未知函数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)</annotation></semantics></math> 出现在积分系数中。路径无关要求 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_y=Q_x</annotation></semantics></math>，求偏导后会得到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math> 的二阶常系数微分方程。这里用两次一阶积分因子求解，可以减少待定系数的展开量。</p><h4>第一步：由偏导恒等得到微分方程</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=[xe^{2x}-6f(x)]\\sin y,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=[f'(x)-5f(x)]\\cos y.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>分别求偏导：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_y=[xe^{2x}-6f(x)]\\cos y,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>f</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x=[f''(x)-5f'(x)]\\cos y.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>二者对所有 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 相等，尤其可取 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=0</annotation></semantics></math> 比较系数，不必在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos y=0</annotation></semantics></math> 的地方作除法：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>f</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f''-5f'+6f=xe^{2x}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>初值仍为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(0)=0</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f'(0)=-1</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><h4>第二步：把二阶式拆为两个一阶式</h4><p>注意系数对应</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda^2-5\\lambda+6=(\\lambda-2)(\\lambda-3).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>令</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h=f'-2f.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>于是</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>f</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>f</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h'-3h=f''-2f'-3f'+6f=xe^{2x},</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(0)=f'(0)-2f(0)=-1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第三步：先解关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math> 的方程</h4><p>乘以积分因子 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{-3x}</annotation></semantics></math>：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mi>h</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{-3x}h'-3e^{-3x}h=xe^{-x}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>h</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(e^{-3x}h)'=xe^{-x}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>两边从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math> 积到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math>，将积分变量暂记为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math>：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mi>t</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{-3x}h(x)-h(0)=\\int_0^xt e^{-t}dt.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>分部积分可取 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=t</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dv=e^{-t}dt</annotation></semantics></math>，故</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mi>t</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int t e^{-t}dt=-t e^{-t}-e^{-t}=-(t+1)e^{-t}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mi>t</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_0^xt e^{-t}dt=1-(x+1)e^{-x}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>代入 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(0)=-1</annotation></semantics></math>：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{-3x}h(x)+1=1-(x+1)e^{-x},</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(x)=-(x+1)e^{2x}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第四步：由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h=f'-2f</annotation></semantics></math> 求 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f'-2f=-(x+1)e^{2x}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>乘以积分因子 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{-2x}</annotation></semantics></math>：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>f</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(e^{-2x}f)'=-(x+1).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>再从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math> 积到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math>，利用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(0)=0</annotation></semantics></math>：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{-2x}f(x)=\\int_0^x-(t+1)dt=-\\frac{x^2}{2}-x.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><menclose notation=\"box\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mstyle></mstyle></mstyle></menclose><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boxed{f(x)=-\\left(\\frac{x^2}{2}+x\\right)e^{2x}}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>代回核对初值与方程</h4><p>记 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g=-x^2/2-x</annotation></semantics></math>，则 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f=e^{2x}g</annotation></semantics></math>。显然 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(0)=0</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>g</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g'(0)=-1</annotation></semantics></math>，所以初值正确；而</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>f</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f''-5f'+6f=e^{2x}(g''-g').</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>g</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" mathvariant=\"normal\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g''-g'=-1-(-x-1)=x.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因此方程右端确为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xe^{2x}</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><p><strong>常规方法提示：</strong>也可用待定系数法。齐次特征根为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2,3</annotation></semantics></math>，右端含 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{2x}</annotation></semantics></math>，所以特解要设成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(Ax+B)xe^{2x}</annotation></semantics></math>。漏乘这个 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 是最常见错误。</p>","figureImages":[],"answerImages":["assets/c281c6369b3908957f.webp","assets/d2b2e66a2dce68dbee.webp"]},{"id":"H19","source":"H","page":24,"label":"H19｜p.24","title":"三角形平面片上的y²","method":"投影三角形，dS=√3 dxdy；第12节。","module":"surface1","nodeIds":["s12-0"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["三角形平面片 x+y+z=1 及其 xOy 投影。投影三角域为 x≥0、y≥0、x+y≤1，面积因子为 √3。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>设三角形平面片</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>z</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma=\\{(x,y,z):x+y+z=1,\\ x\\ge0,\\ y\\ge0,\\ z\\ge0\\}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>求第一类曲面积分</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_\\Sigma y^2\\,dS.</annotation></semantics></math></span>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：投影三角形，平面片的面积因子为常数</h4><p>本题是第一类曲面积分。它积的是面积微元 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS</annotation></semantics></math>，不涉及曲面上侧、下侧的方向选择。三角形平面片能写成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=z(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math>，直接投影到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xOy</annotation></semantics></math> 面最方便。</p><h4>第一步：把平面写为显函数并求偏导</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=1-x-y.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_x=-1,\\qquad z_y=-1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>第一类曲面积分的面积微元是</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS=\\sqrt{1+z_x^2+z_y^2}\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>代入这两个常数：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS=\\sqrt{1+1+1}\\,dx\\,dy=\\sqrt3\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第二步：完整写出投影区域</h4><p>原曲面满足 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math>。最后一个条件化为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-x-y\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math>，所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D=\\{(x,y):x\\ge0,\\ y\\ge0,\\ x+y\\le1\\}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>这是顶点为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0)</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,0)</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math> 的三角形。若选 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 为外层变量，则</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le y\\le1,\\qquad0\\le x\\le1-y.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第三步：按这个次序逐层积分</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\sqrt3\\iint_Dy^2\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msubsup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\sqrt3\\int_0^1dy\\int_0^{1-y}y^2\\,dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>内层积分时 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 固定：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msubsup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>x</mi><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_0^{1-y}y^2\\,dx=y^2[x]_0^{1-y}=y^2(1-y).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\sqrt3\\int_0^1(y^2-y^3)dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\sqrt3\\left[\\frac{y^3}{3}-\\frac{y^4}{4}\\right]_0^1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\sqrt3\\left(\\frac13-\\frac14\\right).</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><menclose notation=\"box\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mrow></mstyle></mstyle></mstyle></menclose><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boxed{I=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{12}}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>面积因子的几何核对</h4><p>投影三角形面积为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/2</annotation></semantics></math>，而空间三角形的三条边均长 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt2</annotation></semantics></math>，其面积为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt3/2</annotation></semantics></math>。两者之比正是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt3</annotation></semantics></math>，与刚算出的面积微元因子一致。</p><p><strong>易错点：</strong>不能漏掉 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt3</annotation></semantics></math>，把曲面面积元直接当投影面积元；投影不是单位正方形，内层上限必须为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-y</annotation></semantics></math>。也不要为第一类面积积分额外添加“上侧正、下侧负”的符号。</p>","figureImages":["assets/ed67b7c339fac8e669.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/393cb63740e4c7bc75.webp"]},{"id":"H20","source":"H","page":25,"label":"H20｜p.25","title":"单位球面上的x²","method":"三平方轮换相等，球面关系与面积；第12节。","module":"surface1","nodeIds":["s6-0","s6-1","s12-3"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["单位球面各平方项面积积分相等。青色仅标出一个卦限，便于理解对称性；本题积分面为整个球面。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>计算曲面积分</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_{\\Sigma}x^2\\,dS,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math> 为球心在原点的单位球面。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：利用轮换对称，把一个平方项变成三个平方项之和</h4><p>这是第一类曲面积分，积分对象是整个单位球面。三个坐标在球面方程中的地位完全相同，面积微元也不会因交换坐标而改变。因此本题应优先想到轮换对称；直接把球面写成两个根式曲面反而会增加计算量。</p><h4>方法一：轮换对称，最适合考场</h4><p>记题目中的积分为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math>。交换坐标轴名称后，积分区域仍然是同一个单位球面，所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_\\Sigma x^2\\,dS=\\iint_\\Sigma y^2\\,dS.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_\\Sigma x^2\\,dS=\\iint_\\Sigma z^2\\,dS.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>将这三个相等的积分相加：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3I=\\iint_\\Sigma(x^2+y^2+z^2)\\,dS.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>单位球面上处处满足 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2+z^2=1</annotation></semantics></math>，于是</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3I=\\iint_\\Sigma1\\,dS=4\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\frac{4\\pi}{3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>这一步的本质是：球面对三个坐标轴没有偏向，因此三个平方坐标对总积分的贡献相等，而它们的和恰好是常数。</p><h4>方法二：球面参数化，核对微元</h4><p>取参数</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>φ</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>φ</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=\\sin\\varphi\\cos\\theta,\\qquad y=\\sin\\varphi\\sin\\theta,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>π</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=\\cos\\varphi,\\qquad0\\le\\varphi\\le\\pi,\\quad0\\le\\theta\\le2\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>单位球面的面积微元为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>φ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>φ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS=\\sin\\varphi\\,d\\varphi\\,d\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>，因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>π</mi></msubsup><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>φ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>φ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\cos^2\\theta\\,d\\theta\\int_0^\\pi\\sin^3\\varphi\\,d\\varphi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>第一个积分由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos^2\\theta=(1+\\cos2\\theta)/2</annotation></semantics></math> 得到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math>。第二个积分令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=\\cos\\varphi</annotation></semantics></math>，则</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>π</mi></msubsup><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>φ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>φ</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_0^\\pi\\sin^3\\varphi\\,d\\varphi=\\int_{-1}^1(1-u^2)\\,du=\\frac43.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>所以仍有 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\pi\\cdot4/3=4\\pi/3</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><h4>结论与易错点</h4><p>结果为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\pi/3</annotation></semantics></math>。第一类曲面积分不分上侧、下侧，不需要额外添加方向符号。轮换对称必须同时检查积分区域与面积微元，不能只看被积函数的形式。</p>","figureImages":["assets/19ddca605e9d972929.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/c223a5a1114b5f716a.webp"]},{"id":"H21","source":"H","page":26,"label":"H21｜p.26—27","title":"柱面侧面上的径向分式","method":"θ,z参数，dS=dθ dz；别投到xOy当圆盘；第12节。","module":"surface1","nodeIds":["s12-2"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["积分面仅为高度 0≤z≤1 的圆柱侧面，不含上下底；参数为 (θ,z)，面积微元为 dθ dz。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>求曲面积分</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_\\Sigma\\frac{dS}{x^2+y^2+z^2},</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math> 为柱面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2=1</annotation></semantics></math> 介于平面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=0</annotation></semantics></math> 与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=1</annotation></semantics></math> 之间的部分。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：柱面直接用“圆周角＋高度”作参数</h4><p>积分曲面是完整圆柱侧面，半径为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math>，高度从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math> 到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math>。分母中的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2</annotation></semantics></math> 在柱面上恒等于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math>，因此沿每一条水平圆周，被积函数都是同一个只与高度有关的值。这样的结构适合直接参数化，不适合把侧面强行投影到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xOy</annotation></semantics></math> 面。</p><h4>第一步：写出覆盖整个侧面的参数范围</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol r(\\theta,z)=(\\cos\\theta,\\sin\\theta,z).</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le\\theta\\le2\\pi,\\qquad0\\le z\\le1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>角度必须取满一周，才能覆盖题目中的整个柱面；高度上下限直接来自两块截平面。</p><h4>第二步：核对面积微元</h4><p>分别对两个参数求导：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">r</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol r_\\theta=(-\\sin\\theta,\\cos\\theta,0),</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">r</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol r_z=(0,0,1).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>两个向量相互垂直，长度均为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math>。也可直接计算叉积：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">r</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">r</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol r_\\theta\\times\\boldsymbol r_z=(\\cos\\theta,\\sin\\theta,0).</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">r</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">r</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left|\\boldsymbol r_\\theta\\times\\boldsymbol r_z\\right|=1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS=d\\theta\\,dz.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>这里没有额外的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{1+z_x^2+z_y^2}</annotation></semantics></math>；那是把曲面写成显函数后投影时使用的另一种表达。</p><h4>第三步：先利用曲面方程化简，再积分</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2+z^2=1+z^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\int_0^1\\frac{1}{1+z^2}\\,dz\\,d\\theta.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>内层积分为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"true\" maxsize=\"1.2em\" minsize=\"1.2em\" stretchy=\"true\">[</mo><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>z</mi><msubsup><mo fence=\"true\" maxsize=\"1.2em\" minsize=\"1.2em\" stretchy=\"true\">]</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_0^1\\frac{dz}{1+z^2}=\\bigl[\\arctan z\\bigr]_0^1=\\frac\\pi4.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>再对角度积分：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\frac\\pi4\\int_0^{2\\pi}d\\theta=\\frac\\pi4\\cdot2\\pi=\\frac{\\pi^2}{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>本质理解与易错点</h4><p>也可以把柱面想成许多很窄的水平圆带：每条圆带的面积近似等于“周长 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\pi</annotation></semantics></math> 乘厚度 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dz</annotation></semantics></math>”，所以直接得到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=2\\pi\\int_0^1(1+z^2)^{-1}dz</annotation></semantics></math>。柱面投影到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xOy</annotation></semantics></math> 面只是圆周，不能把它误认成一个圆盘。此题是第一类曲面积分，面积微元始终取正。</p>","figureImages":["assets/66d1593d051abfc7cd.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/b42c588f4205cc5600.webp","assets/d9a7997481280b3461.webp"]},{"id":"H22","source":"H","page":28,"label":"H22｜p.28—29","title":"圆锥侧面上的多项式","method":"先消x,y奇项，再代z=r和dS=√2 dxdy；未要求补底；第12节。","module":"surface1","nodeIds":["s12-1"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["圆锥侧面 z=r，0≤z≤1。底部圆盘只表示投影边界，并不是需要加上的积分面。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>计算</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_\\Sigma(x^2+y^2+z^2+x+y+z)\\,dS,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math> 为圆锥面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2=z^2</annotation></semantics></math> 上满足 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le z\\le1</annotation></semantics></math> 的部分。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：先用对称性消去一次奇项，再在圆锥面上化简</h4><p>圆锥面由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2=z^2</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le z\\le1</annotation></semantics></math> 给出，因此实际取上半锥面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}</annotation></semantics></math>。题目中的“表面”指这段圆锥侧面，没有另外给出顶端圆盘，不应自行补入第一类曲面积分。</p><h4>第一步：判断哪些项积分为零</h4><p>侧面关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=0</annotation></semantics></math> 都对称。反射 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>↦</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\mapsto-x</annotation></semantics></math> 时，面积微元不变而 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 变号；因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_\\Sigma x\\,dS=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>同理，</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_\\Sigma y\\,dS=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>但 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math>，区域不关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=0</annotation></semantics></math> 对称，所以不能连 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 项也一起消掉。原积分化为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_\\Sigma(x^2+y^2+z^2+z)\\,dS.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第二步：投影到单位圆盘，并写准面积因子</h4><p>记 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}</annotation></semantics></math>，曲面上有 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=r</annotation></semantics></math>。除顶点外，</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_x=\\frac{x}{r},\\qquad z_y=\\frac{y}{r}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1+z_x^2+z_y^2=1+\\frac{x^2+y^2}{r^2}=2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS=\\sqrt2\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>投影区域是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D:x^2+y^2\\le1</annotation></semantics></math>。顶点只有一个，不影响本题的面积积分。</p><h4>第三步：转极坐标并逐项算完</h4><p>曲面方程给出</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2+z^2+z=2r^2+r.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>再把平面面积微元 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx\\,dy=r\\,dr\\,d\\theta</annotation></semantics></math> 代入：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\sqrt2\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\int_0^1(2r^2+r)r\\,dr\\,d\\theta.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=2\\pi\\sqrt2\\int_0^1(2r^3+r^2)\\,dr.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_0^1(2r^3+r^2)\\,dr=\\left[\\frac{r^4}{2}+\\frac{r^3}{3}\\right]_0^1=\\frac56.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=2\\pi\\sqrt2\\cdot\\frac56=\\frac{5\\sqrt2\\pi}{3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>结论与检查</h4><p>结果为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\sqrt2\\pi/3</annotation></semantics></math>。本题要区分两个因子：<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt2</annotation></semantics></math> 来自曲面面积元，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math> 来自平面极坐标换元。漏掉其中任何一个，都会改变最终结果。对称性消项以后，仍要保留非负的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 项。</p>","figureImages":["assets/7f5617b481ee4027aa.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/2fd9b9454c2111db53.webp","assets/96fb7d4e01c64cdc1c.webp"]},{"id":"H23","source":"H","page":30,"label":"H23｜p.30—31","title":"最大方向导数反求曲面并求面积","method":"最大方向单位化得梯度，先定a,b再投影；第12节。","module":"surface1","nodeIds":["s12-4"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["由最大方向导数确定 a=b=−1 后，曲面是向下开口的抛物面；z≥0 对应半径 √2 的投影圆盘。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>设 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a,b</annotation></semantics></math> 为实数。函数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=2+ax^2+by^2</annotation></semantics></math> 在点 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(3,4)</annotation></semantics></math> 处的所有方向导数中，沿方向</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">l</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol l=-3\\boldsymbol i-4\\boldsymbol j</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>的方向导数最大，最大值为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><p>（1）求 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a,b</annotation></semantics></math>；<br/>（2）求曲面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=2+ax^2+by^2</annotation></semantics></math> 位于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math> 的部分的面积。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：用最大方向导数恢复梯度，再把面积问题投影到圆盘</h4><p>第一问既给了“在哪个方向取得最大值”，也给了“最大值是多少”。前者确定梯度的方向，后者确定梯度的长度，两个条件缺一不可。</p><h4>第一问：先把方向单位化</h4><p>方向导数使用单位方向向量。给定方向 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-3,-4)</annotation></semantics></math> 的模为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math>，所以对应单位向量为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">e</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol e=\\left(-\\frac35,-\\frac45\\right).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>在给定点处，梯度等于</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla z(3,4)=(6a,8b).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>方向导数可写成梯度与单位方向的点积，其最大值是梯度的模，且在梯度同向时取得。因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">e</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla z(3,4)=10\\boldsymbol e=(-6,-8).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>比较两个分量：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mn>8</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6a=-6,\\qquad8b=-8,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=-1,\\qquad b=-1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>注意不能仅写“<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(6a,8b)</annotation></semantics></math> 与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-3,-4)</annotation></semantics></math> 平行”，否则还无法唯一确定两个参数。</p><h4>第二问：先确定投影区域</h4><p>代入参数后，曲面为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=2-x^2-y^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>题目限制 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math>，所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>2.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2\\le2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>也就是说，投影是以原点为圆心、半径 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt2</annotation></semantics></math> 的圆盘；不能误写成半径 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><h4>计算面积微元并转极坐标</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_x=-2x,\\qquad z_y=-2y.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS=\\sqrt{1+z_x^2+z_y^2}\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S=\\iint_{x^2+y^2\\le2}\\sqrt{1+4x^2+4y^2}\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></msubsup><mi>r</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S=2\\pi\\int_0^{\\sqrt2}r\\sqrt{1+4r^2}\\,dr.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=1+4r^2</annotation></semantics></math>，则 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">du=8r\\,dr</annotation></semantics></math>。当 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=0</annotation></semantics></math> 时 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=1</annotation></semantics></math>，当 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=\\sqrt2</annotation></semantics></math> 时 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=9</annotation></semantics></math>，于是</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S=\\frac\\pi4\\int_1^9u^{1/2}\\,du.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S=\\frac\\pi4\\left[\\frac23u^{3/2}\\right]_1^9.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>13</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S=\\frac\\pi6(27-1)=\\frac{13\\pi}{3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>结论与易错点</h4><p>答案为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=b=-1</annotation></semantics></math>，曲面面积为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>13</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">13\\pi/3</annotation></semantics></math>。方向向量必须先单位化；求面积时必须保留根式中的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math>，不能把曲面积分误当成投影圆盘的面积。</p>","figureImages":["assets/3aa7bafe93ac533503.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/45f30096dcbcc200b6.webp","assets/869bc8438c1cf8280a.webp"]},{"id":"H24","source":"H","page":32,"label":"H24｜p.32","title":"半椭球单项第二类积分","method":"曲面关系把根号化成|y|，上侧正号；第14节。","module":"surface2","nodeIds":["s14-0","s14-3"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["半椭球面取上侧，法向 z 分量为正；投影为半径 2 的圆盘，原根式在面上化为 |y|。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>设 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math> 为半椭球面</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>z</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2+4z^2=4,\\qquad z\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>的上侧，求</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_\\Sigma\\sqrt{4-x^2-4z^2}\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：先利用椭球面关系处理根号，再按上侧投影</h4><p>虽然积分符号中只有 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math>，它仍是第二类曲面积分。上侧、下侧决定有向投影面积的正负。被积函数还含有 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>，应先在原曲面上化简，而不是一开始就将 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 的根式代入。</p><h4>第一步：根号等于绝对值，不等于带符号的坐标</h4><p>在椭球面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2+4z^2=4</annotation></semantics></math> 上，</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4-x^2-4z^2=y^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{4-x^2-4z^2}=\\sqrt{y^2}=|y|.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>由于投影同时包含 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math> 的点，这里的绝对值不能去掉。</p><h4>第二步：上侧给出正号，确定投影范围</h4><p>半椭球可写成</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=\\frac12\\sqrt{4-x^2-y^2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>它的上侧法向量的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 分量为正，因此 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math> 直接对应平面上的正面积微元。投影区域为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>4.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D:x^2+y^2\\le4.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>于是原积分化成</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_D|y|\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>这里不再乘 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{1+z_x^2+z_y^2}</annotation></semantics></math>：原题已经是带方向的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math>，不是第一类面积微元 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><h4>方法一：按水平条带积分</h4><p>固定 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math>，对应的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 长度为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\sqrt{4-y^2}</annotation></semantics></math>。再用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 的偶性：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>y</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=4\\int_0^2y\\sqrt{4-y^2}\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=4-y^2</annotation></semantics></math>，有 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">du=-2y\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math>，上下限从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math> 变为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math>：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>4</mn><mn>0</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=-2\\int_4^0u^{1/2}\\,du=2\\int_0^4u^{1/2}\\,du.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><msup><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>32</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\frac43\\,4^{3/2}=\\frac{32}{3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>方法二：极坐标快速核对</h4><p>令 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=r\\cos\\theta,y=r\\sin\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>，则</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_0^2r^2\\,dr\\int_0^{2\\pi}|\\sin\\theta|\\,d\\theta.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>32</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\frac83\\cdot4=\\frac{32}{3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>结论与易错点</h4><p>结果为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>32</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">32/3</annotation></semantics></math>，且应为正数。误把 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{y^2}</annotation></semantics></math> 写成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 会导致错误的“奇函数积分为零”；误加曲面面积因子也会改变积分含义。</p>","figureImages":["assets/3e4064c4f4a9561111.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/8f6364f3e4d5e07e57.webp"]},{"id":"H25","source":"H","page":33,"label":"H25｜p.33","title":"锥面下侧含绝对值通量","method":"先加下侧负号，再用对称缩第一象限；第14节。","module":"surface2","nodeIds":["s14-0","s14-3"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["圆锥下侧的法向朝下，故 dx dy 前带负号。绝对值 |xyz| 不会抵消方向负号。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>曲面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math> 为圆锥面</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z^2=x^2+y^2,\\qquad0\\le z\\le1</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>的下侧，计算</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_\\Sigma|xyz|\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：下侧先写负号，再利用四象限对称去绝对值</h4><p>这是一项第二类曲面积分。虽然系数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|xyz|</annotation></semantics></math> 非负，但有向面积微元 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math> 可为负；题目指定下侧，正是本题符号的来源。不要因为看到绝对值，就认为最后的积分一定非负。</p><h4>第一步：明确曲面与投影</h4><p>由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z^2=x^2+y^2</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le z\\le1</annotation></semantics></math>，取的是上半圆锥侧面：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>它在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xOy</annotation></semantics></math> 面的投影是单位圆盘</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D:x^2+y^2\\le1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>法向量取下侧，即 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 分量为负。因此将原积分化为平面面积积分时，应写</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=-\\iint_D|xy|\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>负号必须在这一步就保留下来，不能算到最后再凭感觉决定符号。</p><h4>第二步：缩到第一象限</h4><p>平面上的完整被积函数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|xy|\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}</annotation></semantics></math> 关于两个坐标轴都是偶函数，所以四个象限贡献相同。在第一象限，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|xy|=xy</annotation></semantics></math>，故</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mo>∬</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=-4\\iint_{D_1}xy\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_1</annotation></semantics></math> 是第一象限的四分之一单位圆盘。</p><h4>第三步：极坐标中逐个核对幂次</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=r\\cos\\theta,\\qquad y=r\\sin\\theta,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le r\\le1,\\qquad0\\le\\theta\\le\\frac\\pi2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>坐标乘积贡献 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^2</annotation></semantics></math>，根号贡献 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math>，面积微元再贡献一个 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math>，所以总幂次是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^4</annotation></semantics></math>：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=-4\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\int_0^1r^4\\cos\\theta\\sin\\theta\\,dr\\,d\\theta.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>分别计算：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_0^1r^4\\,dr=\\frac15,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\cos\\theta\\sin\\theta\\,d\\theta=\\left[\\frac{\\sin^2\\theta}{2}\\right]_0^{\\pi/2}=\\frac12.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>相乘得到</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=-4\\cdot\\frac15\\cdot\\frac12=-\\frac25.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>结论与易错点</h4><p>结果为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-2/5</annotation></semantics></math>。此题不用额外乘圆锥的面积因子 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt2</annotation></semantics></math>，因为题中给的是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math> 而非 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS</annotation></semantics></math>。绝对值作用于系数，方向符号作用于微元，二者不能互相抵消。</p>","figureImages":["assets/c517543e6b24025a4f.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/8b6e52dc09a61d6266.webp"]},{"id":"H26","source":"H","page":34,"label":"H26｜p.34—35","title":"第一卦限锥面多项通量","method":"下侧合一投影到四分之一圆盘；角度0至π/2；第14节。","module":"surface2","nodeIds":["s14-1"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["第一卦限的四分之一圆锥面，取下侧。投影角度为 0≤θ≤π/2，半径 0≤r≤1。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>计算</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_\\Sigma(x^2+y^2)\\,dz\\,dx+z\\,dx\\,dy,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math> 为圆锥面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}</annotation></semantics></math> 上满足 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\ge0,y\\ge0,z\\le1</annotation></semantics></math> 的部分的下侧。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：把两项统一投影到同一个四分之一圆盘</h4><p>场的三个分量分别是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=0</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=x^2+y^2</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R=z</annotation></semantics></math>。曲面不是封闭面，且直接投影后的式子很短，因此优先使用第二类曲面积分的合一投影法，不必补面再用高斯公式。</p><h4>第一步：写出曲面的下侧面积向量</h4><p>记 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}</annotation></semantics></math>，则曲面为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=r</annotation></semantics></math>。除顶点外，</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_x=\\frac{x}{r},\\qquad z_y=\\frac{y}{r}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>上侧对应 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-z_x,-z_y,1)</annotation></semantics></math>，所以题目要求的下侧对应</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d\\boldsymbol S=\\left(\\frac{x}{r},\\frac{y}{r},-1\\right)dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>这是有向面积向量，不是单位法向量；它已经包含投影时需要的面积因素，无须再额外单位化。</p><h4>第二步：将场与面积向量点乘</h4><p>场在曲面上为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,r^2,r)</annotation></semantics></math>，于是</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_D\\left(0\\cdot\\frac xr+r^2\\cdot\\frac yr-r\\right)dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_D(ry-r)\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>这里尤其要注意最后一项是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-r</annotation></semantics></math>，它来自下侧法向量的第三分量 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><h4>第三步：用题目的范围确定极坐标上下限</h4><p>条件 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\ge0,y\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math> 给出第一象限；条件 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=r\\le1</annotation></semantics></math> 给出单位圆盘。因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le\\theta\\le\\frac\\pi2,\\qquad0\\le r\\le1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>代入 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=r\\sin\\theta</annotation></semantics></math> 与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx\\,dy=r\\,dr\\,d\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\int_0^1(r^3\\sin\\theta-r^2)\\,dr\\,d\\theta.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>先对 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math> 积分：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_0^1(r^3\\sin\\theta-r^2)\\,dr=\\frac14\\sin\\theta-\\frac13.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>再对角度积分：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\frac14\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\sin\\theta\\,d\\theta-\\frac13\\int_0^{\\pi/2}d\\theta.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\frac14-\\frac\\pi6.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>结论与易错点</h4><p>结果为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/4-\\pi/6</annotation></semantics></math>。该值为负，与负的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math> 项占主导相符。圆锥顶点使 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x/r,y/r</annotation></semantics></math> 的写法失效，但只对应一个点；可先去掉顶点附近的小圆盘后取极限，化简后的积分收敛，结果不变。</p>","figureImages":["assets/ec9203aff0e3032b36.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/49aba80c79252d92ba.webp","assets/dd1d7e29b435aabc21.webp"]},{"id":"H27","source":"H","page":36,"label":"H27｜p.36—37","title":"抛物面矩形片上的通量","method":"合一投影到[0,1]²，使用z_x=2x,z_y=2y；第14节。","module":"surface2","nodeIds":["s14-1"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["抛物面在单位正方形上的上侧，法向面积向量为 (−2x,−2y,1) dx dy；投影边界不是圆。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>计算</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>y</mi></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_\\Sigma e^y\\,dy\\,dz+ye^x\\,dz\\,dx+x^2y\\,dx\\,dy,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math> 是抛物面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=x^2+y^2</annotation></semantics></math> 被平面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0,x=1,y=0,y=1</annotation></semantics></math> 所截部分的上侧。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：上侧合一投影，三个乘积分开计算</h4><p>抛物面可直接写成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=x^2+y^2</annotation></semantics></math>，四块截平面又给出了一个矩形投影。题目中的场不依赖 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>，因此直接投影最省事；补面法会凭空增加需要核对的面。</p><h4>第一步：投影范围与方向</h4><p>由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0,x=1,y=0,y=1</annotation></semantics></math>，投影区域为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∣</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D=\\{(x,y)\\mid0\\le x\\le1,\\ 0\\le y\\le1\\}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>曲面的两个偏导为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_x=2x,\\qquad z_y=2y.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>上侧的法向量第三分量为正，所以有向面积向量取</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d\\boldsymbol S=(-2x,-2y,1)\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第二步：先点乘，后代入积分</h4><p>场为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>y</mi></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(e^y,ye^x,x^2y)</annotation></semantics></math>。逐项点乘得到</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>y</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^y(-2x)+(ye^x)(-2y)+(x^2y)\\cdot1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>y</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_0^1\\int_0^1\\left(-2xe^y-2y^2e^x+x^2y\\right)dy\\,dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>第二项应是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-2y^2e^x</annotation></semantics></math>，不能漏掉场中原有的那个 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><h4>第三步：三个积分分别计算</h4><p>矩形区域上，分离变量的乘积可以拆成两个一重积分的乘积。第一项为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>y</mi></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_1=-2\\left(\\int_0^1x\\,dx\\right)\\left(\\int_0^1e^y\\,dy\\right).</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_1=-2\\cdot\\frac12\\cdot(e-1)=-(e-1).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>第二项为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_2=-2\\left(\\int_0^1e^x\\,dx\\right)\\left(\\int_0^1y^2\\,dy\\right).</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_2=-2(e-1)\\cdot\\frac13=-\\frac23(e-1).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>第三项为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_3=\\left(\\int_0^1x^2\\,dx\\right)\\left(\\int_0^1y\\,dy\\right)=\\frac13\\cdot\\frac12=\\frac16.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>最后相加：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=-(e-1)-\\frac23(e-1)+\\frac16.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>e</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=-\\frac53e+\\frac53+\\frac16=\\frac{11-10e}{6}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>结论与易错点</h4><p>结果为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(11-10e)/6</annotation></semantics></math>。上侧不代表每一项都取正；正确符号要由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-z_x,-z_y,1)</annotation></semantics></math> 分别与场的分量相乘得到。矩形范围下拆乘积很方便，但一般的非矩形区域不能直接这样拆。</p>","figureImages":["assets/ee1891fca95bd45eb4.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/272e0b145199b1f838.webp","assets/924bdca1c0b78c2335.webp"]},{"id":"H28","source":"H","page":38,"label":"H28｜p.38—39","title":"四面体整个外表面通量","method":"高斯，散度2x+1；三角域补齐x,y非负；第15、19节。","module":"gauss","nodeIds":["s4-1","s15-0"],"correction":"原解的投影三角域漏写 x≥0、y≥0。正确范围还需满足 2x+y≤2。","figureCaptions":["四面体由坐标平面与 2x+y+2z=2 围成。图中标出截距、整个外侧法向与形心 (1/4,1/2,1/4)。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>设有界区域 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math> 由平面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2x+y+2z=2</annotation></semantics></math> 与三个坐标平面围成，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math> 为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math> 整个表面的外侧。计算</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_\\Sigma(x^2+1)\\,dy\\,dz-2y\\,dz\\,dx+3z\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：封闭外侧用高斯公式，先求散度再算立体积分</h4><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math> 是四面体全部表面的外侧，正好符合高斯公式的方向。场的各分量是多项式，在立体内连续可微，因此可以直接使用公式，不需要逐个面投影。</p><h4>第一步：三个分量对各自变量求偏导</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=x^2+1,\\qquad Q=-2y,\\qquad R=3z.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_x=2x,\\qquad Q_y=-2,\\qquad R_z=3.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>相加后得到</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{div}\\boldsymbol F=2x+1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iiint_\\Omega(2x+1)\\,dV.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>方法一：体积与形心，计算最短</h4><p>平面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2x+y+2z=2</annotation></semantics></math> 与三坐标轴的交点分别为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,0,0)</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,2,0)</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0,1)</annotation></semantics></math>。因此四面体体积为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V=\\frac16\\cdot1\\cdot2\\cdot1=\\frac13.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>四面体形心的坐标等于四个顶点对应坐标的平均值，所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar x=\\frac{0+1+0+0}{4}=\\frac14.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>根据形心公式，</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>V</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iiint_\\Omega x\\,dV=V\\bar x=\\frac13\\cdot\\frac14=\\frac1{12}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>于是</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=2\\iiint_\\Omega x\\,dV+V=\\frac16+\\frac13=\\frac12.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>方法二：标准三重积分，范围与运算完整核对</h4><p>有限立体位于第一卦限。投影到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xOy</annotation></semantics></math> 面时，必须完整写成</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D:\\quad x\\ge0,\\quad y\\ge0,\\quad2x+y\\le2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>固定 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y</annotation></semantics></math> 后，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 从底面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math> 到斜平面：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_0^1\\int_0^{2-2x}\\int_0^{(2-2x-y)/2}(2x+1)\\,dz\\,dy\\,dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>先积 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>，再积 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math>：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_0^1\\frac{2x+1}{2}\\int_0^{2-2x}(2-2x-y)\\,dy\\,dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_0^1\\frac{2x+1}{4}(2-2x)^2\\,dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_0^1(2x+1)(1-x)^2\\,dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>展开时，</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(2x+1)(1-2x+x^2)=2x^3-3x^2+1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\left[\\frac{x^4}{2}-x^3+x\\right]_0^1=\\frac12-1+1=\\frac12.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>结论与原资料核对</h4><p>结果为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/2</annotation></semantics></math>。原讲义投影域只写 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2x+y\\le2</annotation></semantics></math>，漏了 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y</annotation></semantics></math> 的非负条件；单独一个半平面不能表达这里的有界三角形。第一种方法适合考场提速，第二种方法用于不会形心结论时的稳妥求解。</p>","figureImages":["assets/e24ac50cfca190cc7e.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/6af153ccdb62151c44.webp","assets/cfee239799c1f492f6.webp"]},{"id":"H29","source":"H","page":40,"label":"H29｜p.40—41","title":"半椭球开放面通量","method":"补x=0平面，补面零，按x截圆盘；第15节。","module":"gauss","nodeIds":["s22-3","s4-2","s15-1","s15-2","s15-3"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["前侧为 x≥0 半椭球的外侧。补面 x=0 应取 −x 方向；其 P=x=0，补面通量为零。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>设 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math> 是曲面</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=\\sqrt{1-3y^2-3z^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>的前侧，计算</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_\\Sigma x\\,dy\\,dz+(y^3+2)\\,dz\\,dx+z^3\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：补上平面圆盘，使前侧成为封闭面的一部分</h4><p>曲面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=\\sqrt{1-3y^2-3z^2}</annotation></semantics></math> 是椭球面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+3y^2+3z^2=1</annotation></semantics></math> 位于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math> 的一半。题目的前侧指法向量朝 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 正向，正好是这半个椭球体的外侧。由于散度很简单，补面用高斯公式比直接求根式曲面的偏导更合适。</p><h4>第一步：写清补面、立体与补面方向</h4><p>补上 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0</annotation></semantics></math> 内的圆盘 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma_0</annotation></semantics></math>，取朝 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 负向的外侧。所围立体是</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo>:</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega:\\quad x\\ge0,\\quad x^2+3y^2+3z^2\\le1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>场为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol F=(x,y^3+2,z^3)</annotation></semantics></math>。补面法向量只沿 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 方向，只有第一个分量参与通量；而补面上恰有 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0</annotation></semantics></math>，所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_{\\Sigma_0}\\boldsymbol F\\cdot d\\boldsymbol S=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>不能仅因为补面在坐标平面上就断言通量为零；本题成立的具体原因是对应分量 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=x</annotation></semantics></math> 在该平面上为零。</p><h4>第二步：高斯公式转成体积分</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_x=1,\\qquad Q_y=3y^2,\\qquad R_z=3z^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I+0=\\iiint_\\Omega(1+3y^2+3z^2)\\,dV.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第三步：按 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 截圆盘，先重后单</h4><p>由椭球不等式，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le x\\le1</annotation></semantics></math>。固定 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 后，截面满足</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y^2+z^2\\le\\frac{1-x^2}{3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>在截面内取 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=r\\cos\\theta,z=r\\sin\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>，记半径 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R=\\sqrt{(1-x^2)/3}</annotation></semantics></math>。于是</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>R</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_0^1\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\int_0^R(1+3r^2)r\\,dr\\,d\\theta\\,dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>先积径向：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>R</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_0^R(r+3r^3)\\,dr=\\frac{R^2}{2}+\\frac{3R^4}{4}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>再积角度并代入 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R^2=(1-x^2)/3</annotation></semantics></math>：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_0^1\\left[\\frac\\pi3(1-x^2)+\\frac\\pi6(1-x^2)^2\\right]dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\frac\\pi6\\int_0^1(3-4x^2+x^4)\\,dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\frac\\pi6\\left[3x-\\frac43x^3+\\frac15x^5\\right]_0^1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>14</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>45</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\frac\\pi6\\left(3-\\frac43+\\frac15\\right)=\\frac{14\\pi}{45}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>结论与易错点</h4><p>结果为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>14</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>45</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">14\\pi/45</annotation></semantics></math>。式中常数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math> 对散度没有贡献，且补面通量也为零；它不会出现在最终数值中。截面半径有一个 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\sqrt3</annotation></semantics></math>，不要把椭球误当成单位半球。</p>","figureImages":["assets/da39a819f6f6d63dce.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/f65000114e6621fbe7.webp","assets/18b1121e8c0624df6b.webp"]},{"id":"H30","source":"H","page":42,"label":"H30｜p.42—44","title":"椭圆抛物面上侧通量","method":"补z=0椭圆盘；对称消补面积分，按z截面积；第15节。","module":"gauss","nodeIds":["s22-3","s4-2","s15-1","s15-2","s15-3"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["椭圆抛物面上侧与 z=0 补面。固定 z 的椭圆截面半轴为 √(1−z)、2√(1−z)，截面积为 2π(1−z)。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>计算</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_\\Sigma xz\\,dy\\,dz+2zy\\,dz\\,dx+3xy\\,dx\\,dy,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math> 为椭圆抛物面</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=1-x^2-\\frac{y^2}{4},\\qquad0\\le z\\le1</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>的上侧。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：补底面用高斯公式，再利用椭圆截面积</h4><p>曲面是椭圆抛物面的顶盖，上侧正好指向它与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=0</annotation></semantics></math> 所围立体的外部。这里场的散度只依赖 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>，而水平截面又是椭圆，所以“补面＋先重后单”最省计算。</p><h4>方法一：高斯公式与截面面积</h4><p>记 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma_0</annotation></semantics></math> 为平面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=0</annotation></semantics></math> 内的椭圆盘，取下侧。场的各分量为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=xz,\\qquad Q=2zy,\\qquad R=3xy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>分别求偏导：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_x=z,\\qquad Q_y=2z,\\qquad R_z=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>所以封闭外表面的通量满足</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I+I_0=\\iiint_\\Omega3z\\,dV.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>补面只剩第三项，且取下侧：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_0=-\\iint_{x^2+y^2/4\\le1}3xy\\,dx\\,dy=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>最后一个等号来自椭圆域关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0</annotation></semantics></math> 对称，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xy</annotation></semantics></math> 关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 为奇函数。</p><p>固定高度 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\in[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math>，截面为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+\\frac{y^2}{4}\\le1-z.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>两半轴为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{1-z}</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\sqrt{1-z}</annotation></semantics></math>，面积为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(z)=\\pi\\sqrt{1-z}\\cdot2\\sqrt{1-z}=2\\pi(1-z).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>于是</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\int_0^1 3zA(z)\\,dz=6\\pi\\int_0^1(z-z^2)\\,dz.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=6\\pi\\left[\\frac{z^2}{2}-\\frac{z^3}{3}\\right]_0^1=\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>方法二：直接投影，核对法向与椭圆换元</h4><p>曲面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=1-x^2-y^2/4</annotation></semantics></math> 的两个偏导为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_x=-2x,\\qquad z_y=-\\frac y2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>上侧面积向量为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(2x,y/2,1)dx\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math>，点乘得</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_D\\left[(2x^2+y^2)z+3xy\\right]dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D:x^2+y^2/4\\le1</annotation></semantics></math>。<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3xy</annotation></semantics></math> 项积分为零。对余项取椭圆极坐标：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=r\\cos\\theta,\\qquad y=2r\\sin\\theta,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le r\\le1,\\qquad0\\le\\theta\\le2\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>此时 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=1-r^2</annotation></semantics></math>，且 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx\\,dy=2r\\,dr\\,d\\theta</annotation></semantics></math>。故</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=2\\int_0^1r^3(1-r^2)\\,dr\\int_0^{2\\pi}(2\\cos^2\\theta+4\\sin^2\\theta)\\,d\\theta.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>两个一重积分分别为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_0^1(r^3-r^5)\\,dr=\\frac14-\\frac16=\\frac1{12},</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_0^{2\\pi}(2\\cos^2\\theta+4\\sin^2\\theta)\\,d\\theta=6\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=2\\cdot\\frac1{12}\\cdot6\\pi=\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>结论与易错点</h4><p>两种方法均得 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\pi</annotation></semantics></math>。第一种方法更适合考场；第二种方法能核对上侧法向量的符号与椭圆换元的雅可比 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2r</annotation></semantics></math>。补面通量为零来自奇偶性，不是因为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=0</annotation></semantics></math> 就能消去全部场分量。</p>","figureImages":["assets/80f64b60f20c1ed27e.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/54481dca3f71aad207.webp","assets/37c73a46ce45426a90.webp","assets/c25a2164a131c48435.webp"]},{"id":"H31","source":"H","page":45,"label":"H31｜p.45—46","title":"第一卦限抛物面上侧通量","method":"直接投影最短；补面法需辨原上侧为内侧且含多个补面；第14、15节。","module":"gauss","nodeIds":["s4-1","s14-1","s15-1"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["第一卦限抛物面上侧。箭头朝上，但对与 z=1 围成的立体而言是内侧；直接投影最省符号。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>计算</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_\\Sigma x\\,dy\\,dz+y\\,dz\\,dx+z\\,dx\\,dy,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math> 为曲面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=x^2+y^2</annotation></semantics></math> 在第一卦限中满足 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le z\\le1</annotation></semantics></math> 的部分的上侧。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：直接投影最短，避免补面时把内侧误当外侧</h4><p>题目给的是抛物面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=x^2+y^2</annotation></semantics></math> 的上侧，并且只取第一卦限的一部分。它不是封闭面。虽然也能补面用高斯公式，但需要同时处理顶部圆盘和两个坐标平面，还要反转原曲面的方向。因此优先直接合一投影。</p><h4>第一步：从空间条件逐项确定投影范围</h4><p>第一卦限给出 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\ge0,y\\ge0,z\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math>。再由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=x^2+y^2\\le1</annotation></semantics></math>，得到</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D:\\quad x\\ge0,\\quad y\\ge0,\\quad x^2+y^2\\le1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>它是四分之一单位圆盘，极坐标范围为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le r\\le1,\\qquad0\\le\\theta\\le\\frac\\pi2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第二步：上侧面积向量与场点乘</h4><p>曲面的偏导数为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_x=2x,\\qquad z_y=2y.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>上侧法向量的第三分量为正，所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d\\boldsymbol S=(-2x,-2y,1)\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>场为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,y,z)</annotation></semantics></math>，先点乘：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x(-2x)+y(-2y)+z\\cdot1=-2x^2-2y^2+z.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>再用原曲面关系 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=x^2+y^2</annotation></semantics></math> 化简：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-2x^2-2y^2+z=-(x^2+y^2).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>于是</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=-\\iint_D(x^2+y^2)\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第三步：极坐标积分</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=-\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\int_0^1r^2\\cdot r\\,dr\\,d\\theta.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=-\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\left[\\frac{r^4}{4}\\right]_0^1d\\theta.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=-\\frac14\\cdot\\frac\\pi2=-\\frac\\pi8.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>补面法为什么容易错：给出方向核对</h4><p>若把抛物面与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=1</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=0</annotation></semantics></math> 补成封闭面，所围立体位于抛物面上方。原抛物面的上侧朝向立体内部，所以封闭面通量中的这一部分应是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-I</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><p>两个竖直坐标面上对应场分量为零。顶部四分之一圆盘的通量为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi/4</annotation></semantics></math>。立体体积为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V=\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\int_0^1(1-r^2)r\\,dr\\,d\\theta=\\frac\\pi8.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>场的散度为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math>，所以高斯公式给出</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-I+\\frac\\pi4=3V=\\frac{3\\pi}{8}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\frac\\pi4-\\frac{3\\pi}{8}=-\\frac\\pi8.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>结论与易错点</h4><p>结果为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\pi/8</annotation></semantics></math>。上下侧由法向量的竖直分量决定，内外侧由所围立体决定，二者不是同一组概念。本题正是“上侧同时为内侧”的典型例子。</p>","figureImages":["assets/ee906b23bb804a519f.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/7123b99023c036fd39.webp","assets/5f8a8acdcf47a06c13.webp"]},{"id":"H32","source":"H","page":47,"label":"H32｜p.47—49","title":"球面与偏心柱面交线环流","method":"斯托克斯选球面片，向上法向，偏心圆盘投影；第16节。","module":"stokes","nodeIds":["s22-1","s16-2"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["上半球面与偏心圆柱的交线 Γ。虚线是投影圆，中心 (0,1)、半径 1；取向与上侧法向一致。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>计算曲线积分</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi></msub><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\oint_\\Gamma z^2\\,dx+2xy\\,dy+2yz\\,dz,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Gamma</annotation></semantics></math> 为上半球面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=\\sqrt{4-x^2-y^2}</annotation></semantics></math> 与柱面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2=2y</annotation></semantics></math> 的交线。从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 轴正向看去，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Gamma</annotation></semantics></math> 沿逆时针方向。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：交线不在一个平面，斯托克斯选原球面片</h4><p>积分路径来自球面与偏心柱面的交线，不适合硬找平面片。选择上半球被柱面截得的球面片，其投影刚好是偏心圆盘；旋度与面积向量点乘后，根式会消失，这是本题适合斯托克斯公式的原因。</p><h4>第一步：由边界绕行方向确定曲面方向</h4><p>从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 轴正向看去，边界逆时针，根据右手规则，球面片应取向上的法向。记场为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol F=(z^2,2xy,2yz).</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第二步：逐分量求旋度</h4><p>第一分量为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_y-Q_z</annotation></semantics></math>，第二分量为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_z-R_x</annotation></semantics></math>，第三分量为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x-P_y</annotation></semantics></math>：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_y-Q_z=2z-0=2z,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_z-R_x=2z-0=2z,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x-P_y=2y-0=2y.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla\\times\\boldsymbol F=(2z,2z,2y).</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第三步：投影到偏心圆盘并点乘</h4><p>由球面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=\\sqrt{4-x^2-y^2}</annotation></semantics></math>，在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> 的内部有</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_x=-\\frac xz,\\qquad z_y=-\\frac yz.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>向上的有向面积向量为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d\\boldsymbol S=\\left(\\frac xz,\\frac yz,1\\right)dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>与旋度点乘：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(2z)\\frac xz+(2z)\\frac yz+(2y)\\cdot1=2x+4y.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>柱面方程决定投影区域：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D:x^2+y^2\\le2y,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D:x^2+(y-1)^2\\le1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_D(2x+4y)\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第四步：平移圆心，完整算出两个平面矩</h4><p>圆盘关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0</annotation></semantics></math> 对称，故 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_Dx\\,dx\\,dy=0</annotation></semantics></math>。为计算另一项，取</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=r\\cos\\theta,\\qquad y=1+r\\sin\\theta,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le r\\le1,\\qquad0\\le\\theta\\le2\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>于是</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_Dy\\,dx\\,dy=\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\int_0^1(1+r\\sin\\theta)r\\,dr\\,d\\theta.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\left(\\frac12+\\frac13\\sin\\theta\\right)d\\theta=\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=2\\cdot0+4\\pi=4\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>边界退化点与易错点</h4><p>边界点 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,2,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 处 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=0</annotation></semantics></math>，上述显函数偏导写法退化，但球面本身仍光滑。可使用球面的光滑参数片，或先去掉该点的小邻域，再令邻域缩小；场连续，增加的小边界贡献趋于零，而化简后的平面被积函数连续，因此结果成立。不要把偏心圆盘当成以原点为圆心，也不要将 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_Dy</annotation></semantics></math> 误判为零。</p>","figureImages":["assets/72d9ab5ac95b27cc67.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/a0f77b41c9fcecec3c.webp","assets/86d3a5af4ac7a6a07e.webp","assets/3662ca6f328bfce262.webp"]},{"id":"H33","source":"H","page":50,"label":"H33｜p.50—51","title":"倾斜平面上的菱形边界环流","method":"斯托克斯选平面片，常法向，奇偶性消线性项；第16节。","module":"stokes","nodeIds":["s16-0","s16-3"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["倾斜平面 z=2−x−y 上的菱形边界，投影是 |x|+|y|≤1；向上法向为 (1,1,1)，边界投影逆时针。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>计算</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\oint_L(y^2-z^2)\\,dx+(2z^2-x^2)\\,dy+(3x^2-y^2)\\,dz,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>其中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 是平面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x+y+z=2</annotation></semantics></math> 与柱面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|x|+|y|=1</annotation></semantics></math> 的交线。从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 轴正向看去，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 为逆时针方向。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：选倾斜平面片，常面积向量配合菱形对称</h4><p>边界曲线全部位于平面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x+y+z=2</annotation></semantics></math> 内，因此斯托克斯公式应优先选该平面被边界围成的片。它在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xOy</annotation></semantics></math> 面上的投影是一个中心对称菱形，最后的线性奇项可以直接消去。</p><h4>第一步：确定法向与投影</h4><p>从上方看，边界逆时针，故平面片取向上法向。将平面写成</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=2-x-y,\\qquad z_x=-1,\\quad z_y=-1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>向上的有向面积向量为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d\\boldsymbol S=(-z_x,-z_y,1)dx\\,dy=(1,1,1)dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>注意这不是单位法向量，因此不需要除以 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt3</annotation></semantics></math>。其投影区域由柱面确定：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D:|x|+|y|\\le1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第二步：逐项求旋度，尤其检查第二分量</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=y^2-z^2,\\qquad Q=2z^2-x^2,\\qquad R=3x^2-y^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_y-Q_z=-2y-4z,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_z-R_x=-2z-6x,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_x-P_y=-2x-2y.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla\\times\\boldsymbol F=(-2y-4z,-2z-6x,-2x-2y).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>旋度的第二分量是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_z-R_x</annotation></semantics></math>，不能误写成相反的次序。</p><h4>第三步：点乘后再代平面关系</h4><p>三个旋度分量与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,1,1)</annotation></semantics></math> 点乘，相加得</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-8x-4y-6z.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>代入 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=2-x-y</annotation></semantics></math>：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>12.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-8x-4y-6(2-x-y)=-2x+2y-12.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=\\iint_D(-2x+2y-12)\\,dx\\,dy.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第四步：利用完整投影域的对称性</h4><p>菱形关于两个坐标轴都对称，所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_Dx\\,dx\\,dy=0,\\qquad\\iint_Dy\\,dx\\,dy=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>菱形两条对角线的长度都为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math>，因此面积为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_D=\\frac12\\cdot2\\cdot2=2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>也可把菱形分成四个直角边长均为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math> 的三角形，每个面积 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/2</annotation></semantics></math>，总面积仍为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math>。于是</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>24.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=-12S_D=-12\\cdot2=-24.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>结论与易错点</h4><p>结果为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-24</annotation></semantics></math>。只有先把 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2-x-y</annotation></semantics></math> 代掉，才得到投影平面上的完整被积函数并准确使用奇偶性。若使用单位法向量 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,1,1)/\\sqrt3</annotation></semantics></math>，则还须同时使用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS=\\sqrt3\\,dx\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math>，二者最终应抵消。</p>","figureImages":["assets/48cbaf041a87407409.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/f075c83c336c416355.webp","assets/000a74fddece57692a.webp"]},{"id":"H34","source":"H","page":52,"label":"H34｜p.52","title":"第一卦限球面三角形质量","method":"偶函数取全球八分之一，轮换得x²,z²积分；第12、17节。","module":"applications","nodeIds":["s6-0","s6-1","s12-3","s17-0"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["第一卦限球面三角形 ABC 是全球的八分之一；密度 x²+z² 跨三个坐标面均为偶函数。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>在单位球面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2+z^2=1</annotation></semantics></math> 上，取以 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(1,0,0)</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(0,1,0)</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(0,0,1)</annotation></semantics></math> 为顶点的球面三角形 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math>。若面密度为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho=x^2+z^2,</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>求该球面三角形的质量 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：第一卦限球面片扩成整个球面，再用轮换对称</h4><p>质量应由“面密度乘曲面面积微元”计算。这里的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math> 是第一卦限内由三个坐标平面截出的单位球面三角形，并不是三点围成的平面三角形；因此不能直接使用平面三角形的面积公式。</p><h4>第一步：写出质量积分并检查偶性</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mi>ρ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m=\\iint_\\Sigma\\rho\\,dS=\\iint_\\Sigma(x^2+z^2)\\,dS.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>球面三角形是整个球面的八分之一。能否直接乘 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math>，还必须检查被积函数：<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+z^2</annotation></semantics></math> 对 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y,z</annotation></semantics></math> 的符号变化都不变，面积微元也保持不变，所以八个卦限对该积分的贡献确实相同。</p><p>记整个单位球面为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math>，则</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>S</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m=\\frac18\\iint_S(x^2+z^2)\\,dS.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第二步：在整个球面上使用轮换对称</h4><p>令</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>S</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J=\\iint_Sx^2\\,dS.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>由三个变量地位相同，有</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>S</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>S</mi></msub><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>S</mi></msub><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>J</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_Sx^2\\,dS=\\iint_Sy^2\\,dS=\\iint_Sz^2\\,dS=J.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>三式相加，利用球面方程：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>S</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3J=\\iint_S(x^2+y^2+z^2)\\,dS.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>S</mi></msub><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3J=\\iint_S1\\,dS=4\\pi.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J=\\frac{4\\pi}{3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m=\\frac18\\left(\\frac{4\\pi}{3}+\\frac{4\\pi}{3}\\right)=\\frac\\pi3.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>另一种组织方式：直接在球面三角形内轮换</h4><p>第一卦限的单位球面片对三个坐标的轮换同样保持不变。因此在该片上，三个平方项的积分各占面积的三分之一。其面积为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\pi/8=\\pi/2</annotation></semantics></math>，故</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_\\Sigma x^2\\,dS=\\frac13\\cdot\\frac\\pi2=\\frac\\pi6.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>同理 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></msub><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_\\Sigma z^2\\,dS=\\pi/6</annotation></semantics></math>，两项相加仍为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi/3</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><h4>结论与易错点</h4><p>质量为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi/3</annotation></semantics></math>。面壳质量使用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dS</annotation></semantics></math>，立体质量才使用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dV</annotation></semantics></math>。扩域乘倍数时，要同时检查曲面的对称性、被积函数的偶性以及微元的保持性，不能见到第一卦限就一律乘 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>","figureImages":["assets/db021d0467885dbf45.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/a2e27dfad470fa6706.webp"]},{"id":"H35","source":"H","page":53,"label":"H35｜p.53","title":"抛物面与平面围体的形心高度","method":"水平截面A(z)=πz，体积与z一阶矩作比；第17节。","module":"applications","nodeIds":["s4-2","s17-1"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["抛物面 z=x²+y² 与平面 z=1 围成立体；水平截面半径 √z，截面积 πz。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>设立体区域</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∣</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega=\\{(x,y,z)\\mid x^2+y^2\\le z\\le1\\},</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>求其形心的竖坐标 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar z</annotation></semantics></math>。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：按高度截圆盘，形心坐标等于一阶体积矩除以体积</h4><p>立体位于抛物面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=x^2+y^2</annotation></semantics></math> 与平面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=1</annotation></semantics></math> 之间。要求的是均匀立体的形心，不是抛物面薄壳的重心，因此分子、分母都使用体积微元 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dV</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><h4>第一步：明确高度范围与水平截面积</h4><p>区域不等式为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2\\le z\\le1</annotation></semantics></math>。因为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math>，可知高度范围为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le z\\le1</annotation></semantics></math>。固定一个高度 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>，截面满足</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2\\le z.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>这是半径 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mi>z</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt z</annotation></semantics></math> 的圆盘，截面面积为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msqrt><mi>z</mi></msqrt><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(z)=\\pi(\\sqrt z)^2=\\pi z.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>截面积由下往上随 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 增大，这是结果应高于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/2</annotation></semantics></math> 的直观原因。</p><h4>第二步：计算体积</h4><p>将每个水平截面的面积对高度累加：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V=\\iiint_\\Omega1\\,dV=\\int_0^1A(z)\\,dz.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V=\\pi\\int_0^1z\\,dz=\\pi\\left[\\frac{z^2}{2}\\right]_0^1=\\frac\\pi2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第三步：计算竖直坐标的一阶体积矩</h4><p>同一水平截面上所有点的竖直坐标都等于该层高度 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>，所以</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>z</mi><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_z=\\iiint_\\Omega z\\,dV=\\int_0^1zA(z)\\,dz.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_z=\\pi\\int_0^1z^2\\,dz=\\pi\\left[\\frac{z^3}{3}\\right]_0^1=\\frac\\pi3.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>这里的记号 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_z</annotation></semantics></math> 表示使用坐标 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 作权重的一阶体积矩，其对应参考平面是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xOy</annotation></semantics></math> 面。</p><h4>第四步：按定义作比值</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mi>V</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar z=\\frac{\\iiint_\\Omega z\\,dV}{\\iiint_\\Omega1\\,dV}=\\frac{M_z}{V}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar z=\\frac{\\pi/3}{\\pi/2}=\\frac13\\cdot2=\\frac23.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>常规积分如何与截面法对应</h4><p>若不直接写截面积，也可以在每一层用极坐标：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><msqrt><mi>z</mi></msqrt></msubsup><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(z)=\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\int_0^{\\sqrt z}r\\,dr\\,d\\theta=\\pi z.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>所以截面法只是把内层二重积分先算成了熟悉的圆面积，并没有引入新的公式。</p><h4>结论与易错点</h4><p>竖直形心坐标为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2/3</annotation></semantics></math>。不要把外层高度范围误写成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[-1,1]</annotation></semantics></math>，也不要漏掉分母中的体积。高度大的地方截面积更大，因此 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2/3&gt;1/2</annotation></semantics></math> 与几何直觉一致。</p>","figureImages":["assets/85338f97d60d6709e0.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/47816a3d2a55fd7862.webp"]},{"id":"H36","source":"H","page":54,"label":"H36｜p.54—56","title":"斜圆锥立体形心","method":"截面中心随z移动，A(z)=π(1-z)²，使用截面形心；第17节。","module":"applications","nodeIds":["s4-2","s17-1"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["斜圆锥的截面圆心是 (0,z,z)，半径为 1−z；虚线显示圆心随高度的移动，不能误当正圆锥。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>设 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math> 是由圆锥面</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+(y-z)^2=(1-z)^2,\\qquad0\\le z\\le1</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>与平面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=0</annotation></semantics></math> 围成的锥体，求 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math> 的形心坐标。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：水平截面是圆盘，但圆心会随高度移动</h4><p>这是一个斜圆锥。若直接做三重积分，容易因为截面圆心不是原点而把 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math> 的一阶矩误算成零。更稳妥的方法是：对每个高度先写截面面积和截面形心，再沿高度积分。</p><h4>第一步：确定每个水平截面的形状与圆心</h4><p>立体在高度 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\in[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math> 处的截面是</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_z:x^2+(y-z)^2\\le(1-z)^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>圆心为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,z)</annotation></semantics></math>，半径为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-z</annotation></semantics></math>，所以截面面积为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(z)=\\pi(1-z)^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>该层在平面中的形心坐标为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,z)</annotation></semantics></math>。其中第二个坐标随 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 改变，正是斜圆锥区别于直圆锥的关键。</p><h4>第二步：计算立体体积</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V=\\int_0^1A(z)\\,dz=\\pi\\int_0^1(1-z)^2\\,dz.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V=\\pi\\int_0^1(1-2z+z^2)\\,dz.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V=\\pi\\left[z-z^2+\\frac{z^3}{3}\\right]_0^1=\\frac\\pi3.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>第三步：分别处理三个坐标的一阶矩</h4><p>区域关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0</annotation></semantics></math> 对称，因此 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iiint_\\Omega x\\,dV=0</annotation></semantics></math>，进而 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar x=0</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><p>对固定的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>，将圆盘坐标平移成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=x,v=y-z</annotation></semantics></math>。圆盘以 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u,v)=(0,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 为中心，因而 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∬</mo><mi>v</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint v\\,du\\,dv=0</annotation></semantics></math>。于是</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></msub><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_{D_z}y\\,dx\\,dy=\\iint_{D_z}(z+v)\\,du\\,dv=zA(z).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>另一方面，该层的竖直坐标恒为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>，因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></msub><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iint_{D_z}z\\,dx\\,dy=zA(z).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>所以 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 的一阶体积矩相等：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∭</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iiint_\\Omega y\\,dV=\\iiint_\\Omega z\\,dV=\\pi\\int_0^1z(1-z)^2\\,dz.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>展开并逐项积分：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_0^1(z-2z^2+z^3)\\,dz=\\frac12-\\frac23+\\frac14.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac12-\\frac23+\\frac14=\\frac{6-8+3}{12}=\\frac1{12}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>12</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar y=\\bar z=\\frac{\\pi/12}{\\pi/3}=\\frac14.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\bar x,\\bar y,\\bar z)=\\left(0,\\frac14,\\frac14\\right).</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>几何核对：与圆锥形心结论一致</h4><p>底面圆心为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O=(0,0,0)</annotation></semantics></math>，顶点由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=1</annotation></semantics></math> 得 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=(0,1,1)</annotation></semantics></math>。均匀圆锥的形心位于底面中心与顶点的连线上，从底面中心向顶点走全长的四分之一，故应为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O+\\frac14(A-O)=\\left(0,\\frac14,\\frac14\\right).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>这可以作为核对；若没有记住几何结论，上面的截面推导已经给出完整证明。不要因为截面是圆盘，就误认为整个立体关于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=0</annotation></semantics></math> 对称。</p>","figureImages":["assets/0cf73a4df14f6699a9.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/5597f391f1fff99949.webp","assets/1afad398746d043370.webp","assets/81b252e327dc7012e8.webp"]},{"id":"H37","source":"H","page":57,"label":"H37｜p.57—59","title":"直线旋转生成曲面与立体形心","method":"先写x(z),y(z)，半径平方为两者平方和；第17节。","module":"applications","nodeIds":["s17-2"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["青色为母线 x=1−z、y=z。绕 z 轴旋转后半径平方为 (1−z)²+z²，截取 0≤z≤2 的部分。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>直线 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 过点 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(1,0,0)</annotation></semantics></math>、<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(0,1,1)</annotation></semantics></math>。将 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> 绕 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 轴旋转一周得到曲面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math> 与平面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=0,z=2</annotation></semantics></math> 围成的立体记为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><p>（1）求曲面 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math> 的方程；<br/>（2）求 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math> 的形心坐标。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：先找直线上每个高度的点，再求旋转半径</h4><p>空间直线绕 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 轴旋转时，高度不变，点到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 轴的距离变成该层圆周的半径。因此先将直线写成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=x(z),y=y(z)</annotation></semantics></math>，比直接套某种旋转曲面的类型更可靠。</p><h4>第一问：由两点写出直线参数，再消去参数</h4><p>从 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=(1,0,0)</annotation></semantics></math> 指向 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B=(0,1,1)</annotation></semantics></math> 的方向向量为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-1,1,1)</annotation></semantics></math>。因此直线可写为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=1-t,\\qquad y=t,\\qquad z=t.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>由于 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=z</annotation></semantics></math>，得到</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=1-z,\\qquad y=z.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>该点到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 轴的距离平方为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R^2(z)=x^2+y^2=(1-z)^2+z^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>旋转后同一高度的所有点满足</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2=R^2(z)=2z^2-2z+1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>这就是曲面方程。这里旋转的是整条直线，不只线段 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math>；因此第二问截在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=0</annotation></semantics></math> 与 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=2</annotation></semantics></math> 之间时，应使用完整高度区间 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,2]</annotation></semantics></math>。</p><h4>第二问：截面面积与两个对称坐标</h4><p>立体绕 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math> 轴对称，所以 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar x=\\bar y=0</annotation></semantics></math>。固定 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math>，内部截面为圆盘，其面积是</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(z)=\\pi R^2(z)=\\pi(2z^2-2z+1).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>注意形心不是直接取上下高度的中点，因为不同高度的截面面积不相等。</p><h4>逐步计算体积</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V=\\pi\\int_0^2(2z^2-2z+1)\\,dz.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V=\\pi\\left[\\frac23z^3-z^2+z\\right]_0^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V=\\pi\\left(\\frac{16}{3}-4+2\\right)=\\frac{10\\pi}{3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>逐步计算竖直一阶矩</h4><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_z=\\pi\\int_0^2z(2z^2-2z+1)\\,dz.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_z=\\pi\\int_0^2(2z^3-2z^2+z)\\,dz.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_z=\\pi\\left[\\frac{z^4}{2}-\\frac23z^3+\\frac{z^2}{2}\\right]_0^2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>14</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_z=\\pi\\left(8-\\frac{16}{3}+2\\right)=\\frac{14\\pi}{3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>按形心定义作比值：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mi>V</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>14</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar z=\\frac{M_z}{V}=\\frac{14\\pi/3}{10\\pi/3}=\\frac75.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\bar x,\\bar y,\\bar z)=\\left(0,0,\\frac75\\right).</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>结论与易错点</h4><p>曲面方程为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+y^2=2z^2-2z+1</annotation></semantics></math>，形心为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0,7/5)</annotation></semantics></math>。旋转半径是点到轴的距离 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}</annotation></semantics></math>，不能只取原直线的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math> 坐标；面积中使用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi R^2</annotation></semantics></math>，不再对半径平方多开或多平方一次。</p>","figureImages":["assets/5f9c382f9902bb1dd7.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/59184080a954bb7776.webp","assets/7795b566aa55b5bbb5.webp","assets/f48ab9da17e4af0f51.webp"]},{"id":"H38","source":"H","page":60,"label":"H38｜p.60—61","title":"变力做功在椭球面上取最大","method":"微分式d(xyz)，端点积转约束最值；均值不等式或乘数法；第18节。","module":"applications","nodeIds":["s18-1","s18-3"],"correction":"","figureCaptions":["椭球比例示意取 a:b:c=1.6:1.15:0.8。最大功点的三个归一化坐标相等，均为 1/√3；青色是原点到该点的运动直线。"],"diagramType":"redrawn","questionHtml":"<p>在变力</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">i</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">j</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol F=yz\\boldsymbol i+zx\\boldsymbol j+xy\\boldsymbol k</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>的作用下，质点由原点沿直线运动到椭球面</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{x^2}{a^2}+\\frac{y^2}{b^2}+\\frac{z^2}{c^2}=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>上第一卦限内的点 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>η</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>ζ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M(\\xi,\\eta,\\zeta)</annotation></semantics></math>。问 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>η</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>ζ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi,\\eta,\\zeta</annotation></semantics></math> 取何值时，力所作的功 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math> 最大，并求 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math> 的最大值。<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a,b,c</annotation></semantics></math> 取椭球的正半轴长。</p>","solutionHtml":"<h4>主线：先把做功积分化成端点乘积，再处理椭球约束最值</h4><p>直接写出直线参数当然可以计算，但场的三个分量 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">yz,zx,xy</annotation></semantics></math> 正好是函数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xyz</annotation></semantics></math> 对三个变量的偏导。识别全微分后，路径积分立刻变成端点值，是本题最有用的考场观察。</p><h4>第一步：识别原函数并计算做功</h4><p>由乘积求微分公式，</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d(xyz)=yz\\,dx+zx\\,dy+xy\\,dz.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因此从原点到 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>η</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>ζ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M=(\\xi,\\eta,\\zeta)</annotation></semantics></math> 的功为</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi></msubsup><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W=\\int_O^M d(xyz)=[xyz]_O^M.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mi>η</mi><mi>ζ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mi>η</mi><mi>ζ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W=\\xi\\eta\\zeta-0=\\xi\\eta\\zeta.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>原函数在整个空间内光滑，所以本题的功与路径无关；沿直线只是题目指定的一条路径。</p><h4>第二步：将椭球约束化为单位球约束</h4><p>将正半轴长记为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a,b,c</annotation></semantics></math>，取</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>ξ</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>η</mi><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>ζ</mi><mi>c</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=\\frac\\xi a,\\qquad v=\\frac\\eta b,\\qquad w=\\frac\\zeta c.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>第一卦限给出 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u,v,w&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>，椭球方程给出</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>u</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u^2+v^2+w^2=1,\\qquad W=abc\\,uvw.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>方法一：均值不等式，最快</h4><p>对三个非负数 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u^2,v^2,w^2</annotation></semantics></math> 使用均值不等式：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>≥</mo><mroot><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mroot><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{u^2+v^2+w^2}{3}\\ge\\sqrt[3]{u^2v^2w^2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>代入和为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math>，并将两边立方：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>27</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u^2v^2w^2\\le\\frac1{27}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u,v,w</annotation></semantics></math> 都为正，开平方后不改变大小关系：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>w</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">uvw\\le\\frac1{3\\sqrt3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W\\le\\frac{abc}{3\\sqrt3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>等号成立当且仅当 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u^2=v^2=w^2</annotation></semantics></math>。再结合正性与平方和为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math>，得到</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=v=w=\\frac1{\\sqrt3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>因此</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>ζ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi=\\frac a{\\sqrt3},\\qquad\\eta=\\frac b{\\sqrt3},\\qquad\\zeta=\\frac c{\\sqrt3},</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\max}=\\frac{abc}{3\\sqrt3}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>方法二：拉格朗日乘数法，适合一般约束题</h4><p>对归一化后的乘积 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">uvw</annotation></semantics></math> 建立辅助函数</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>w</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(u,v,w)=uvw-\\lambda(u^2+v^2+w^2-1).</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>令三个偏导为零：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>u</mi><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><mi>v</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>u</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><mi>w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">vw=2\\lambda u,\\qquad uw=2\\lambda v,\\qquad uv=2\\lambda w.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>分别将三个等式乘以 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u,v,w</annotation></semantics></math>，左边都变成 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">uvw</annotation></semantics></math>，于是</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><msup><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\lambda u^2=2\\lambda v^2=2\\lambda w^2=uvw.</annotation></semantics></math></span><p>第一卦限中 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>w</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">uvw&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>，故 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda\\ne0</annotation></semantics></math>，可以推出 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u^2=v^2=w^2=1/3</annotation></semantics></math>。若把可行范围补成闭的第一卦限球面，边界上至少一个变量为零，乘积为零；而上述内点乘积为正，所以内点给出的就是全局最大值。</p><h4>直线路径的计算核对</h4><p>若暂时没认出全微分，可取 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>ξ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>η</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>ζ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,y,z)=(t\\xi,t\\eta,t\\zeta)</annotation></semantics></math>，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le t\\le1</annotation></semantics></math>。代入做功微分式：</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>ξ</mi><mi>η</mi><mi>ζ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mi>η</mi><mi>ζ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mi>η</mi><mi>ζ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W=\\int_0^1 3t^2\\xi\\eta\\zeta\\,dt=\\xi\\eta\\zeta[t^3]_0^1=\\xi\\eta\\zeta.</annotation></semantics></math></span><h4>结论与易错点</h4><p>最大功为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">abc/(3\\sqrt3)</annotation></semantics></math>，对应点的坐标为 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(a/\\sqrt3,b/\\sqrt3,c/\\sqrt3)</annotation></semantics></math>。这里相等的是归一化坐标 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>η</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>ζ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi/a,\\eta/b,\\zeta/c</annotation></semantics></math>，一般不是 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ζ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi=\\eta=\\zeta</annotation></semantics></math>；只有三个半轴相等时，原坐标才相等。</p>","figureImages":["assets/02c0b2202b4a6630c4.svg"],"answerImages":["assets/a86484e86d2b1e78ea.webp","assets/abe788ee1c51afb003.webp"]}]};
